(789598, 86955, 1041, '<td valign="top">Yep, that''s a cat''s life for you :)  I like the pose (it''s so typical) and while I like the leaves, too, to give it a bit more texture and depth, I do think I would like the shot even better if the one eye wasn''t covered up and both eyes were a little bit more instantly noticable, often, it works best if they are the focal point of the photo that draws the users attention.</td>', 'Yep, that''s a cat''s life for you :)  I like the pose (it''s so typical) and while I like the leaves, too, to give it a bit more texture and depth, I do think I would like the shot even better if the one eye wasn''t covered up and both eyes were a little bit more instantly noticable, often, it works best if they are the focal point of the photo that draws the users attention.', '2004-07-01 09:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
