(789604, 84771, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  One of those images that stick out amongst the thumbnails and then also doesn''t disappoint when you open it up.  The gradient sky and the stars alone would make a superb image.  The two ears of wheat are a nice counterbalance and are fabulously lit.  The two (wheat and sky) almost look like they haven''t been photographed at the same time (no, I''m not accusing you of cheating :), I''m curious about the lighting, did you light the wheat separately?  Will check comments after the voting is over.</td>', 'Beautiful.  One of those images that stick out amongst the thumbnails and then also doesn''t disappoint when you open it up.  The gradient sky and the stars alone would make a superb image.  The two ears of wheat are a nice counterbalance and are fabulously lit.  The two (wheat and sky) almost look like they haven''t been photographed at the same time (no, I''m not accusing you of cheating :), I''m curious about the lighting, did you light the wheat separately?  Will check comments after the voting is over.', '2004-07-01 10:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
