(789678, 82739, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the classic portrait composition, also, that she is looking at the viewer and that there''s room to the right of her.  The backgorund is a nice contrast and complements her eyes well.  My only preference would be to have the image a little sharper, it looks soft to me.  Not sure if that''s a tad OOF or neatimage, my guess is neatimage.</td>', 'I like the classic portrait composition, also, that she is looking at the viewer and that there''s room to the right of her.  The backgorund is a nice contrast and complements her eyes well.  My only preference would be to have the image a little sharper, it looks soft to me.  Not sure if that''s a tad OOF or neatimage, my guess is neatimage.', '2004-07-01 10:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
