(789739, 86769, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh...  Beautiful shot.  Hard to separate the photographic details from the emotions this evokes.  The only thing I don''t care for is the slight overexposure on the white uniform, but other than that it''s perfect.  9</td>', 'Oh...  Beautiful shot.  Hard to separate the photographic details from the emotions this evokes.  The only thing I don''t care for is the slight overexposure on the white uniform, but other than that it''s perfect.  9', '2004-07-01 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
