(789865, 85941, 6008, '<td valign="top">This makes me wonder if it''s part of a statue or else you got your child''s first shoes bronzed, which I know a lot of people do. The lighting isnt bad, although the background can be seen near the top of the image, which is a little distracting. The full frame/crop is good too. I''m sure both this image and the boots will be a cherished memory for you!</td>', 'This makes me wonder if it''s part of a statue or else you got your child''s first shoes bronzed, which I know a lot of people do. The lighting isnt bad, although the background can be seen near the top of the image, which is a little distracting. The full frame/crop is good too. I''m sure both this image and the boots will be a cherished memory for you!', '2004-07-01 12:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(789866, 84673, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice. But I really don''t like colour of the border. I can''t look at the image because the border is so annoying.</td>', 'Nice. But I really don''t like colour of the border. I can''t look at the image because the border is so annoying.', '2004-07-01 12:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
