(789914, 87104, 21714, '<td valign="top">Her skin looks like it''s made of rubber. I think you gone a bit overboard.</td>', 'Her skin looks like it''s made of rubber. I think you gone a bit overboard.', '2004-07-01 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(789915, 86394, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  I spent a couple of midsommar evenings in Sweden (no idea whether this was taken there) and this immediately reminded me.  There''s really not much I would change, it''s a great capture.  I would consider cropping a bit on the right, while I like the open space there, there''s a white spot right at the top that draws attention away, and there''s alos just a tad too much empty room there for my liking.</td>', 'What a cutie!  I spent a couple of midsommar evenings in Sweden (no idea whether this was taken there) and this immediately reminded me.  There''s really not much I would change, it''s a great capture.  I would consider cropping a bit on the right, while I like the open space there, there''s a white spot right at the top that draws attention away, and there''s alos just a tad too much empty room there for my liking.', '2004-07-01 12:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(789918, 84771, 21714, '<td valign="top">Brillaint image from a creative genius.</td>', 'Brillaint image from a creative genius.', '2004-07-01 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(789922, 86961, 2612, '<td valign="top">Bravo! I see so many photographs where the photographer has smooth out those lines and made the subject into something they are not.. usually at the subject''s request. Beautiful face, excellent exposure, and wonderful composition. I wouldn''t change a thing... you nailed this one. I cannot wait to see the rest of the portfolio from this photographer.</td>', 'Bravo! I see so many photographs where the photographer has smooth out those lines and made the subject into something they are not.. usually at the subject''s request. Beautiful face, excellent exposure, and wonderful composition. I wouldn''t change a thing... you nailed this one. I cannot wait to see the rest of the portfolio from this photographer.', '2004-07-01 12:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(789925, 82756, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s clean alright. but if the mouth was in better focus this would have been a magnificent shot. It''s already a brilliant image.</td>', 'It''s clean alright. but if the mouth was in better focus this would have been a magnificent shot. It''s already a brilliant image.', '2004-07-01 12:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(789934, 86867, 21714, '<td valign="top">Breathtakingly beautiful colurs captured so well I am out of words. Excellent work!</td>', 'Breathtakingly beautiful colurs captured so well I am out of words. Excellent work!', '2004-07-01 12:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(789936, 85064, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, very nice soft detail in the petals, looks very vurnerable. Composition not very attractive, the two petals covering the middle do disturb the image in my opinion, maybe a more attractive specimen was available ?</td>', 'Good exposure, very nice soft detail in the petals, looks very vurnerable. Composition not very attractive, the two petals covering the middle do disturb the image in my opinion, maybe a more attractive specimen was available ?', '2004-07-01 12:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(789937, 84587, 4008, '<td valign="top">I feel the trees at the back and the bend in the track should be in focus, whereas now the focus is more to the front.</td>', 'I feel the trees at the back and the bend in the track should be in focus, whereas now the focus is more to the front.', '2004-07-01 12:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(789945, 83375, 4008, '<td valign="top">This picture makes me wonder what the subject is, the happy couple or the wineglass. The wineglass draws all the attention because of color and focus, while I tend to consider the couple as the main subject.</td>', 'This picture makes me wonder what the subject is, the happy couple or the wineglass. The wineglass draws all the attention because of color and focus, while I tend to consider the couple as the main subject.', '2004-07-01 12:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(789950, 86870, 4008, '<td valign="top">Technically spot on and appealing picture, but I find the colors of the reflection a bit too strong, drawing away attention of the subject.</td>', 'Technically spot on and appealing picture, but I find the colors of the reflection a bit too strong, drawing away attention of the subject.', '2004-07-01 12:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(789954, 86256, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent reflection. My only thought is that this could use some simplification. As it is it causes the eye to wander all over the image rather than settling anywhere. I think a tighter crop would help this. If you cropped out the white area along the bottom the eye would move to the water line and rest there.</td>', 'Excellent reflection. My only thought is that this could use some simplification. As it is it causes the eye to wander all over the image rather than settling anywhere. I think a tighter crop would help this. If you cropped out the white area along the bottom the eye would move to the water line and rest there.', '2004-07-01 12:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(789956, 85449, 22046, '<td valign="top">A very nice study of hands that have worked. My only wish is for a deeper depth of field and sharper focus.</td>', 'A very nice study of hands that have worked. My only wish is for a deeper depth of field and sharper focus.', '2004-07-01 12:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(789959, 83826, 22046, '<td valign="top">Cute kid. I like his serious expression. I wish the primary focal point were more on his face as well as the light.</td>', 'Cute kid. I like his serious expression. I wish the primary focal point were more on his face as well as the light.', '2004-07-01 12:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(789961, 87141, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but I am missing something, maybe some action or a more nostalgic atmosphere. The bright green and the light area around the boy look artifical (not sure whether it actually is), maybe some less bright green would have done it for me.</td>', 'Nice image, but I am missing something, maybe some action or a more nostalgic atmosphere. The bright green and the light area around the boy look artifical (not sure whether it actually is), maybe some less bright green would have done it for me.', '2004-07-01 12:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(789967, 81480, 13602, '<td valign="top">Have you tried this in b/w? IMHO it would of have more impact in b/w. Anyways nice reflection verry well caught.</td>', 'Have you tried this in b/w? IMHO it would of have more impact in b/w. Anyways nice reflection verry well caught.', '2004-07-01 12:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
