(790014, 86800, 4008, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an image, best so far in this challenge. The gradient in the sky is perfect to match the position of the women, combine that with the dress and it makes me think of an angle (and I now see your title .....). To be really nitpicking, I would desaturate the green patch bottom right to match the color of the rest.</td>', 'Wow, what an image, best so far in this challenge. The gradient in the sky is perfect to match the position of the women, combine that with the dress and it makes me think of an angle (and I now see your title .....). To be really nitpicking, I would desaturate the green patch bottom right to match the color of the rest.', '2004-07-01 13:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(790018, 86399, 13602, '<td valign="top">This is such a great capture, what I like verry much about it is the contrast between one unhapy and most probably verry lonely person and the happy couple in that picture next to him. Also I''m sure it whas a verry good choice to make this b/w colors I think would only ruin it''s impact. Absolutely wonderful story here, worth 1 million words. Congratulations - 10 + favorites!</td>', 'This is such a great capture, what I like verry much about it is the contrast between one unhapy and most probably verry lonely person and the happy couple in that picture next to him. Also I''m sure it whas a verry good choice to make this b/w colors I think would only ruin it''s impact. Absolutely wonderful story here, worth 1 million words. Congratulations - 10 + favorites!', '2004-07-01 13:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(790019, 87012, 4008, '<td valign="top">great expression and the partial desaturation works well here.</td>', 'great expression and the partial desaturation works well here.', '2004-07-01 13:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(790027, 87103, 14620, '<td valign="top">My most favorite of the challenge.  I don''t think it can get much better than this. :)  The composition is excellent, as well as the b&amp;w treatment.  But most of all the emotion that this photo projects is just awesome!  9</td>', 'My most favorite of the challenge.  I don''t think it can get much better than this. :)  The composition is excellent, as well as the b&w treatment.  But most of all the emotion that this photo projects is just awesome!  9', '2004-07-01 13:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790028, 86436, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice nostalgic atmosphere to it, with the soft focus and subdued colors, although lower legs are a bit greyish. I think inclusion of her feet would be better.</td>', 'Nice nostalgic atmosphere to it, with the soft focus and subdued colors, although lower legs are a bit greyish. I think inclusion of her feet would be better.', '2004-07-01 13:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(790031, 82511, 14620, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is exactly that I like about this, but it has a cool abstract feel to it and the tones are great.  Nice use of shadow and light.  7</td>', 'Not sure what it is exactly that I like about this, but it has a cool abstract feel to it and the tones are great.  Nice use of shadow and light.  7', '2004-07-01 13:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790032, 85939, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great subject. But (In my opinion of course)  I think the main interest in your nice shot is in the left hand 2/3rds with that sweeping line and color of the palm leaf.   There is that little distraction on the right hand edge too...   If you have the pixels, a closeup of that central stalk surrounded by the yellow graduating to the greens could be stunning.</td>', 'Great subject. But (In my opinion of course)  I think the main interest in your nice shot is in the left hand 2/3rds with that sweeping line and color of the palm leaf.   There is that little distraction on the right hand edge too...   If you have the pixels, a closeup of that central stalk surrounded by the yellow graduating to the greens could be stunning.', '2004-07-01 13:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790036, 81572, 14620, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF and especially love the sepia treatment.  Very beautiful composition!</td>', 'Love the DOF and especially love the sepia treatment.  Very beautiful composition!', '2004-07-01 13:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790037, 82745, 14476, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice simple moonshine shot.  However, it could use just a little something to break up the expanse and add interest.</td>', 'It''s a nice simple moonshine shot.  However, it could use just a little something to break up the expanse and add interest.', '2004-07-01 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(790040, 86397, 14476, '<td valign="top">Great experience to even get this image.  I''d probably have bracketed the shot to try for really good lights and darks.</td>', 'Great experience to even get this image.  I''d probably have bracketed the shot to try for really good lights and darks.', '2004-07-01 13:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(790043, 84188, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures and muted tones, also nice use of DOF.  Well done.</td>', 'Wonderful textures and muted tones, also nice use of DOF.  Well done.', '2004-07-01 13:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790049, 86933, 14476, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, yum.  I"ll be right over.  Good detail and nice subject.  The horizontal lines in the upper background  (house siding?) are distracting.  Might try cropping down to really feature that central scallop (I think you''ve got the room) and that would really bring out the succulence.</td>', 'Ohhh, yum.  I"ll be right over.  Good detail and nice subject.  The horizontal lines in the upper background  (house siding?) are distracting.  Might try cropping down to really feature that central scallop (I think you''ve got the room) and that would really bring out the succulence.', '2004-07-01 13:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790053, 85610, 14476, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and composition.  Focus could be a bit sharper and I''d suggest bracketing your shots to bring out more lights and darks as this is a touch over exposed.</td>', 'Nice shapes and composition.  Focus could be a bit sharper and I''d suggest bracketing your shots to bring out more lights and darks as this is a touch over exposed.', '2004-07-01 13:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(790055, 81973, 4008, '<td valign="top">Unsharp everywhere.</td>', 'Unsharp everywhere.', '2004-07-01 13:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(790057, 83748, 18517, '<td valign="top">I''ve been working on the long-exposure lightning captures, very nice grab!</td>', 'I''ve been working on the long-exposure lightning captures, very nice grab!', '2004-07-01 13:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(790058, 87108, 18517, '<td valign="top">This would have been a fantastic shot... if that woman was about 10ft to the left.</td>', 'This would have been a fantastic shot... if that woman was about 10ft to the left.', '2004-07-01 13:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(790060, 84379, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great colors and sharpness. The bee makes a very dead and static impression to me.</td>', 'Great colors and sharpness. The bee makes a very dead and static impression to me.', '2004-07-01 13:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(790066, 87007, 4008, '<td valign="top">Fill flash would have improved it in my opinion. Also try cropping a bit closer, the branch on the right is distracting.</td>', 'Fill flash would have improved it in my opinion. Also try cropping a bit closer, the branch on the right is distracting.', '2004-07-01 13:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(790067, 85659, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very sweet picture, cute expression.  A couple things I would do differently is get rid of the shampoo bottle, just distracts from the cute baby and also try not to use the onboard flash, which is hard to do in the bathroom because there usually isn''t good natural lighting there, but it just tends to wash out the subject.  Overall, it''s a very cute picture.</td>', 'Very sweet picture, cute expression.  A couple things I would do differently is get rid of the shampoo bottle, just distracts from the cute baby and also try not to use the onboard flash, which is hard to do in the bathroom because there usually isn''t good natural lighting there, but it just tends to wash out the subject.  Overall, it''s a very cute picture.', '2004-07-01 13:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(790068, 85220, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  I like the addition of the tail lights at the bottom.  Nice contrast of old and new.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  I like the addition of the tail lights at the bottom.  Nice contrast of old and new.', '2004-07-01 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
