(790090, 87106, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great atmosphere. Expresses the excitement, the adrenaline of the moment to me. Could be advertisement for paintball to me.</td>', 'Great atmosphere. Expresses the excitement, the adrenaline of the moment to me. Could be advertisement for paintball to me.', '2004-07-01 13:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(790092, 86959, 18517, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of that movie E.T.</td>', 'This reminds me of that movie E.T.', '2004-07-01 13:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(790097, 83375, 18517, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the glass doesn''t stand out enough to give it the effect I think you were looking for. At first glance it just looks like a plain old wedding photo. There doesn''t seem to be enough of a contrast between the desat/sat areas. Seems like the glass would have been better placed neaer to the bride''s boquet. Also the green and blue through the glass should probably also have been desat, as it kind of goofs with the natural flow of color.</td>', 'Unfortunately the glass doesn''t stand out enough to give it the effect I think you were looking for. At first glance it just looks like a plain old wedding photo. There doesn''t seem to be enough of a contrast between the desat/sat areas. Seems like the glass would have been better placed neaer to the bride''s boquet. Also the green and blue through the glass should probably also have been desat, as it kind of goofs with the natural flow of color.', '2004-07-01 13:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(790098, 86941, 7322, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m partial because I''m half-Portuguese (my mom immigrated from Sao` Miguel when she was 5) but I really like this. The composition has a lovely graphic quality and the boat with its crusty red and green paint is quite an interesting subject. It''s a teeny bit noisy and there is some loss of detail at the rim of the boat otherwise my score would be a bit higher. Still, I''m giving it a 6. On second thought, a 7.</td>', 'Maybe I''m partial because I''m half-Portuguese (my mom immigrated from Sao` Miguel when she was 5) but I really like this. The composition has a lovely graphic quality and the boat with its crusty red and green paint is quite an interesting subject. It''s a teeny bit noisy and there is some loss of detail at the rim of the boat otherwise my score would be a bit higher. Still, I''m giving it a 6. On second thought, a 7.', '2004-07-01 13:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(790099, 86861, 18517, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more waterfall photos taken at LESS than 1 second exposure.</td>', 'I''d like to see more waterfall photos taken at LESS than 1 second exposure.', '2004-07-01 13:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790101, 86439, 18517, '<td valign="top">Surreal, almost too surreal.</td>', 'Surreal, almost too surreal.', '2004-07-01 13:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
