(790148, 84310, 11518, '<td valign="top">Slight colour cast, the veil is not quite white.  The shoulder looks weird, kinda out of place, almost looks dislocated.  She could still keep the same pose but with the shoulder down.</td>', 'Slight colour cast, the veil is not quite white.  The shoulder looks weird, kinda out of place, almost looks dislocated.  She could still keep the same pose but with the shoulder down.', '2004-07-01 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790151, 87024, 18080, '<td valign="top">Top capture<br/>looks just like a cute pussy cat<br/> <br/>well done<br/>8</td>', 'Top capturelooks just like a cute pussy cat well done8', '2004-07-01 14:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(790159, 85741, 16563, '<td valign="top">There''s a slight red tint to the photo, noticeable on the white and blue areas. Otherwise, great capture. Looks like she''s smoking.</td>', 'There''s a slight red tint to the photo, noticeable on the white and blue areas. Otherwise, great capture. Looks like she''s smoking.', '2004-07-01 14:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(790164, 84513, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp capture. But it would be better if the subject was placed into a context, rather than just being a capture the details kind of shot.</td>', 'Nice sharp capture. But it would be better if the subject was placed into a context, rather than just being a capture the details kind of shot.', '2004-07-01 14:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(790166, 85358, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive capture. Might also work as a BW photo, but then you''d lose the wild colors. Bump up the saturation a bit next time to bring out the colors and increase the shadows to give it a moodier feel.</td>', 'Nice emotive capture. Might also work as a BW photo, but then you''d lose the wild colors. Bump up the saturation a bit next time to bring out the colors and increase the shadows to give it a moodier feel.', '2004-07-01 14:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(790170, 87082, 16563, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. The background is a bit distracting, you can darken those areas next time or use a much larger aperture.</td>', 'Interesting subject. The background is a bit distracting, you can darken those areas next time or use a much larger aperture.', '2004-07-01 14:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(790172, 82739, 16563, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... interesting. I like the green eyes, but the green in the background seems to take away from the unique eye color.</td>', 'Hmmm... interesting. I like the green eyes, but the green in the background seems to take away from the unique eye color.', '2004-07-01 14:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(790173, 86559, 16563, '<td valign="top">Good action shot,. A bit too centered though, otherwise great. Just need some bird poop to bring out the scene.</td>', 'Good action shot,. A bit too centered though, otherwise great. Just need some bird poop to bring out the scene.', '2004-07-01 14:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(790176, 86951, 9763, '<td valign="top">Looks very stormy.  I love the neutral density effect.  Very nice color!  I also like your choice in softness.  I think the composition could be a little better though, perhaps move her to the left a little?</td>', 'Looks very stormy.  I love the neutral density effect.  Very nice color!  I also like your choice in softness.  I think the composition could be a little better though, perhaps move her to the left a little?', '2004-07-01 14:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(790177, 83057, 16563, '<td valign="top">There are distracting blown out highlights on the fur caused by harsh shadows.  When taking animal shots, it''s more effective (in my opinion) to capture the eyes.</td>', 'There are distracting blown out highlights on the fur caused by harsh shadows.  When taking animal shots, it''s more effective (in my opinion) to capture the eyes.', '2004-07-01 14:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(790180, 86803, 9763, '<td valign="top">i would like to see this building centered horizontally just a tiny bit more.  It''s a great photo otherwise (color, contrast, idea).  :)</td>', 'i would like to see this building centered horizontally just a tiny bit more.  It''s a great photo otherwise (color, contrast, idea).  :)', '2004-07-01 14:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(790182, 86597, 16563, '<td valign="top">Nice color and contrast between textures. Can be improved if the haystacks were lightneed a bit to bring out the missing details. It''s advanced editing, I''m sure you are allowed.</td>', 'Nice color and contrast between textures. Can be improved if the haystacks were lightneed a bit to bring out the missing details. It''s advanced editing, I''m sure you are allowed.', '2004-07-01 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(790185, 86904, 16563, '<td valign="top">Ooo, ouch. Did he just sucker-punk him? Great action shot.</td>', 'Ooo, ouch. Did he just sucker-punk him? Great action shot.', '2004-07-01 14:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(790186, 84811, 9763, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit dark.  Perhaps try lighting it with a small light source.  The color is a bit dull too.  Not sure how to make it pop, maybe a smaller aperature with longer exposure?</td>', 'The background is a bit dark.  Perhaps try lighting it with a small light source.  The color is a bit dull too.  Not sure how to make it pop, maybe a smaller aperature with longer exposure?', '2004-07-01 14:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(790189, 86027, 9763, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  It''d be neat to see one of you skipping stones or something too.  I like the color and the feel.  I think the silhouette could be done with more contrast though.  Great job!</td>', 'Great composition.  It''d be neat to see one of you skipping stones or something too.  I like the color and the feel.  I think the silhouette could be done with more contrast though.  Great job!', '2004-07-01 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790190, 85659, 16563, '<td valign="top">What big eyes you have! Try to diffuse or bounce the flash next time to prevent losing the textures. The bathroom walls are white enough to be a diffusive box.</td>', 'What big eyes you have! Try to diffuse or bounce the flash next time to prevent losing the textures. The bathroom walls are white enough to be a diffusive box.', '2004-07-01 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790193, 86947, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition.  I think you need to rotate left just a teeeeeny tiny bit though.  THe motion is fun too!</td>', 'Nice color and composition.  I think you need to rotate left just a teeeeeny tiny bit though.  THe motion is fun too!', '2004-07-01 14:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(790195, 84587, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice color and soft focus.  The front (bottom) is a little dark.  The interest is not overly engaging but it is nice.</td>', 'Nice color and soft focus.  The front (bottom) is a little dark.  The interest is not overly engaging but it is nice.', '2004-07-01 14:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(790196, 86009, 16563, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting, i LOVE the use of desaturation.</td>', 'Amazing lighting, i LOVE the use of desaturation.', '2004-07-01 14:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(790198, 84578, 3865, '<td valign="top">The bright background is rather distracting, otherwise amazing!</td>', 'The bright background is rather distracting, otherwise amazing!', '2004-07-01 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(790199, 85741, 9763, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a little high, and the reds (or magentas) are up a just a tad.  The composition and interest is really great!</td>', 'Contrast is a little high, and the reds (or magentas) are up a just a tad.  The composition and interest is really great!', '2004-07-01 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(790201, 87102, 16563, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice and soft. Makes me wanna cuddle the cute kitten. Just wish I didn''t have this darn allergy. Amazing.</td>', 'Wow, nice and soft. Makes me wanna cuddle the cute kitten. Just wish I didn''t have this darn allergy. Amazing.', '2004-07-01 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(790203, 86447, 16563, '<td valign="top">Need a more pronounced subject. And watch out for blown out highlights next time.</td>', 'Need a more pronounced subject. And watch out for blown out highlights next time.', '2004-07-01 14:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(790204, 86514, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition, color is also pretty.  The photo is a tiny bit dark and the background (upper right) is a little distracting.  Maybe add more light in the background shooting toward the flower to wash out the background more?</td>', 'Very nice composition, color is also pretty.  The photo is a tiny bit dark and the background (upper right) is a little distracting.  Maybe add more light in the background shooting toward the flower to wash out the background more?', '2004-07-01 14:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(790206, 85953, 16563, '<td valign="top">Are those wall paintings? I can''t really tell. Interesting composition though.</td>', 'Are those wall paintings? I can''t really tell. Interesting composition though.', '2004-07-01 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(790208, 86988, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beatuful color and composition.  Very engaging.  It would be nice if the grey to the right was not so abundant, but great job otherwise!</td>', 'Beatuful color and composition.  Very engaging.  It would be nice if the grey to the right was not so abundant, but great job otherwise!', '2004-07-01 14:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(790209, 83643, 16563, '<td valign="top">Quack! hehe.</td>', 'Quack! hehe.', '2004-07-01 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790211, 86457, 16563, '<td valign="top">Wow, where is this place? I wanna visit. Works great in BW too. Serene.</td>', 'Wow, where is this place? I wanna visit. Works great in BW too. Serene.', '2004-07-01 14:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(790212, 85680, 3865, '<td valign="top">is it me, or is it not quite straight?</td>', 'is it me, or is it not quite straight?', '2004-07-01 14:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(790213, 86836, 22619, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Would have liked the large strand in the foreground to be lit though.</td>', 'Nice shot. Would have liked the large strand in the foreground to be lit though.', '2004-07-01 14:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(790214, 83204, 16753, '<td valign="top">Great tonal range and composition. Love the sparkles. Very evocative.  Fave so far this challenge. Congrats.</td>', 'Great tonal range and composition. Love the sparkles. Very evocative.  Fave so far this challenge. Congrats.', '2004-07-01 14:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(790216, 87139, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  Great interest.  I wish the reflection was not cropped in 1/2.  It might be better to crop by the reflection''s legs or show the entire reflection.  The silhouette is nice too.  I would like to see more yellows and oranges though!</td>', 'Nice capture!  Great interest.  I wish the reflection was not cropped in 1/2.  It might be better to crop by the reflection''s legs or show the entire reflection.  The silhouette is nice too.  I would like to see more yellows and oranges though!', '2004-07-01 14:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790218, 86942, 16563, '<td valign="top">Too much green, the subject becomes lose in all the green. Place him on red or white if possible.</td>', 'Too much green, the subject becomes lose in all the green. Place him on red or white if possible.', '2004-07-01 14:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(790219, 84365, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and composition.  The crop is a little tight though at the top.  I would also like to see a little more light shining on the bird near the bottom of the photo (center).</td>', 'Very nice color and composition.  The crop is a little tight though at the top.  I would also like to see a little more light shining on the bird near the bottom of the photo (center).', '2004-07-01 14:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(790222, 86789, 22619, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet elegant. the one distracting thing (very minor) is the dark line in the sky near the left edge. a cloud perhaps? but that''s REALLY nitpicky. love the shot overall.</td>', 'Simple, yet elegant. the one distracting thing (very minor) is the dark line in the sky near the left edge. a cloud perhaps? but that''s REALLY nitpicky. love the shot overall.', '2004-07-01 14:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(790224, 86438, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast.  Great interest too (esp with the birds flying about).  This photo would be even better if the sky behind the smoke was bright blue, but i know that''s not really in your control.  The clarity could be a little better but the composition is great!</td>', 'Nice color contrast.  Great interest too (esp with the birds flying about).  This photo would be even better if the sky behind the smoke was bright blue, but i know that''s not really in your control.  The clarity could be a little better but the composition is great!', '2004-07-01 14:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(790225, 87106, 16563, '<td valign="top">I enjoy this unique perspective.</td>', 'I enjoy this unique perspective.', '2004-07-01 14:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(790226, 85052, 9763, '<td valign="top">I also entered a seagull.  I like the capture, composition and color.  I wish there was less grain and less grey to the right of your bird though.  Nice job.</td>', 'I also entered a seagull.  I like the capture, composition and color.  I wish there was less grain and less grey to the right of your bird though.  Nice job.', '2004-07-01 14:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(790227, 85964, 16563, '<td valign="top">Bokeh the background!!! It''ll improve this image by tons.</td>', 'Bokeh the background!!! It''ll improve this image by tons.', '2004-07-01 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(790228, 86559, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice flight capture.  I like that you think it''s going to land on the in-focus wooden post.  The blurred background is great and the color is nice.  I wish for a little more clarity and on the right of the photo: a little more brightness.</td>', 'Nice flight capture.  I like that you think it''s going to land on the in-focus wooden post.  The blurred background is great and the color is nice.  I wish for a little more clarity and on the right of the photo: a little more brightness.', '2004-07-01 14:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(790230, 85061, 9763, '<td valign="top">Wow, is he going through a wormhole?  I like the blurred fun background.  The brightness of the bug is a bit high though.  Nice still motion capture!</td>', 'Wow, is he going through a wormhole?  I like the blurred fun background.  The brightness of the bug is a bit high though.  Nice still motion capture!', '2004-07-01 14:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790231, 86258, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very very interesting indeed.  Great composition and color.  I would like to see the house a little brighter (perhaps on the opposite time of day where the sun is on this side.</td>', 'Very very interesting indeed.  Great composition and color.  I would like to see the house a little brighter (perhaps on the opposite time of day where the sun is on this side.', '2004-07-01 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(790232, 85866, 3865, '<td valign="top">wow!</td>', 'wow!', '2004-07-01 14:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(790234, 84513, 9763, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a little high on the rooster''s feathers and above his eye.  I like the color and composition.</td>', 'Contrast is a little high on the rooster''s feathers and above his eye.  I like the color and composition.', '2004-07-01 14:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(790236, 86948, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  Interest is also nice.  Clarity could be higher, background is a bit distracting, rotation to the left a tiny bit might help.  Water reflection also a bit distracting.  composition is nice.</td>', 'Very nice color.  Interest is also nice.  Clarity could be higher, background is a bit distracting, rotation to the left a tiny bit might help.  Water reflection also a bit distracting.  composition is nice.', '2004-07-01 14:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(790238, 84115, 16563, '<td valign="top">I love the background, it''s important that it''s grey to highlight the colors of this emperor penguine. Amazing.</td>', 'I love the background, it''s important that it''s grey to highlight the colors of this emperor penguine. Amazing.', '2004-07-01 14:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(790239, 82739, 22619, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Only thing, to me, to make it better would be removing some of the green tint from the model. or maybe it was your intent to do that?</td>', 'Nice shot. Only thing, to me, to make it better would be removing some of the green tint from the model. or maybe it was your intent to do that?', '2004-07-01 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(790241, 86867, 16563, '<td valign="top">Haven''t this shot shown up on the challenge before? I swear it''s the same shot. strange...</td>', 'Haven''t this shot shown up on the challenge before? I swear it''s the same shot. strange...', '2004-07-01 14:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790242, 83224, 9763, '<td valign="top">you may want to rotate a very tiny bit clockwise.</td>', 'you may want to rotate a very tiny bit clockwise.', '2004-07-01 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(790244, 85449, 9763, '<td valign="top">Very engaging, nice color and composition.  A little too dark at the bottom left though.</td>', 'Very engaging, nice color and composition.  A little too dark at the bottom left though.', '2004-07-01 14:51:10.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(790245, 83392, 22619, '<td valign="top">great catch!</td>', 'great catch!', '2004-07-01 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(790246, 87132, 9763, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, crop and color.  A little grainy though.  Great interest.</td>', 'Nice composition, crop and color.  A little grainy though.  Great interest.', '2004-07-01 14:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(790251, 86409, 22619, '<td valign="top">very well done. love it.</td>', 'very well done. love it.', '2004-07-01 14:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(790252, 86807, 9763, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and softness.  Nice composition and feel.  Very engaging.  I wish the background wasn''t so dark on the upper left.  It''d be nice if that section matched the upper right for color, blur and light.</td>', 'Beautiful color and softness.  Nice composition and feel.  Very engaging.  I wish the background wasn''t so dark on the upper left.  It''d be nice if that section matched the upper right for color, blur and light.', '2004-07-01 14:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(790255, 84364, 16563, '<td valign="top">Clean and silky, i love it.</td>', 'Clean and silky, i love it.', '2004-07-01 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(790256, 84188, 16753, '<td valign="top">I feel you''re on to something here, but unfortunately, the very narrow depth of field directs me forcefully to something that holds little interest.</td>', 'I feel you''re on to something here, but unfortunately, the very narrow depth of field directs me forcefully to something that holds little interest.', '2004-07-01 14:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790257, 84365, 16563, '<td valign="top">a bit front focused. The important part (the face) is blurry.</td>', 'a bit front focused. The important part (the face) is blurry.', '2004-07-01 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(790265, 85700, 16563, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition, amazing colors, contrast, and sharpness. Simply amazing. My choice for top 3. Great job! It just all fits together.</td>', 'Fabulous composition, amazing colors, contrast, and sharpness. Simply amazing. My choice for top 3. Great job! It just all fits together.', '2004-07-01 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(790267, 84332, 16563, '<td valign="top">Was this taken with a mirror lens? I see CA and swirllies. Looks a bit metallic to me, better if it were warmed up a bit to bring out the organic feel of the subject.</td>', 'Was this taken with a mirror lens? I see CA and swirllies. Looks a bit metallic to me, better if it were warmed up a bit to bring out the organic feel of the subject.', '2004-07-01 14:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(790268, 86085, 16753, '<td valign="top">Needs a lot more contrast. Also, the composition leaves me wondering what the subject is. Too many compoeteing elements: the chair, the swath of grass, the road.</td>', 'Needs a lot more contrast. Also, the composition leaves me wondering what the subject is. Too many compoeteing elements: the chair, the swath of grass, the road.', '2004-07-01 15:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(790269, 81239, 16563, '<td valign="top">I think side lighting would work better. Subject is a bit too dark.</td>', 'I think side lighting would work better. Subject is a bit too dark.', '2004-07-01 15:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(790279, 86323, 16753, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and contrast.  A less centered subject would have made this even better.</td>', 'Love the colors and contrast.  A less centered subject would have made this even better.', '2004-07-01 15:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790280, 87143, 19608, '<td valign="top">My first glance and I knew the title was going to be "Bad Hair Day!"  Then I looked and you got me...  Nice capture and placement.  The green band at the top is a nice compositional element.  Catchlight in the eye is great.  The only suggestion I have is that I''d like a bit more room in front of the beak.</td>', 'My first glance and I knew the title was going to be "Bad Hair Day!"  Then I looked and you got me...  Nice capture and placement.  The green band at the top is a nice compositional element.  Catchlight in the eye is great.  The only suggestion I have is that I''d like a bit more room in front of the beak.', '2004-07-01 15:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(790283, 86951, 16753, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Could have so easily been boring, but it really works. The nicely contrasting touch of gold and lack of distracting elements are two things that strike me immediately.</td>', 'Nicely done. Could have so easily been boring, but it really works. The nicely contrasting touch of gold and lack of distracting elements are two things that strike me immediately.', '2004-07-01 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(790284, 86597, 21034, '<td valign="top">Color and exposure look good, but the centered bale doesn''t look right, esp. with the one behind it and to the left.</td>', 'Color and exposure look good, but the centered bale doesn''t look right, esp. with the one behind it and to the left.', '2004-07-01 15:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(790285, 80856, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely.  Slim Jim presentation works very well - but I''m afraid I''d toss the border in a heartbeat.</td>', 'Lovely, just lovely.  Slim Jim presentation works very well - but I''m afraid I''d toss the border in a heartbeat.', '2004-07-01 15:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(790286, 85710, 3865, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a bit too much foreground and you''ve lost the mast off the top of the ship.</td>', 'I think there''s a bit too much foreground and you''ve lost the mast off the top of the ship.', '2004-07-01 15:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(790288, 85713, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- maybe a polarizing filter for the sky next time?</td>', 'Great shot -- maybe a polarizing filter for the sky next time?', '2004-07-01 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(790291, 86445, 21034, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but that flag is really, really distracting, and you left a lot of blank space above the headstones.</td>', 'Very nice, but that flag is really, really distracting, and you left a lot of blank space above the headstones.', '2004-07-01 15:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(790293, 84754, 16753, '<td valign="top">Simply and nicely composed. Love the warmth of the colors. Would recommend going easier on the sharpening and maybe doing  a noise reduction pass on the background.</td>', 'Simply and nicely composed. Love the warmth of the colors. Would recommend going easier on the sharpening and maybe doing  a noise reduction pass on the background.', '2004-07-01 15:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(790295, 85925, 21034, '<td valign="top">Hilarious title. Could you have killed  the glare on the frog?</td>', 'Hilarious title. Could you have killed  the glare on the frog?', '2004-07-01 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(790296, 86870, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great colors -- is the focus too soft on the duck, though?</td>', 'Great colors -- is the focus too soft on the duck, though?', '2004-07-01 15:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790297, 86948, 4008, '<td valign="top">Sunflowers are always good for an attractive image, but I feel you failed here. Some more thought into composition, background, light would be needed. Now it is just a flower in a vase on a table, nothing more. Sorry.</td>', 'Sunflowers are always good for an attractive image, but I feel you failed here. Some more thought into composition, background, light would be needed. Now it is just a flower in a vase on a table, nothing more. Sorry.', '2004-07-01 15:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(790310, 83597, 16753, '<td valign="top">Technically good, but very cliche, and it feels like proselytizing.</td>', 'Technically good, but very cliche, and it feels like proselytizing.', '2004-07-01 15:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790314, 84288, 16753, '<td valign="top">IMHO, too unrecognizable to make an impression as highway lights and not interesting enough to work as an abstract.</td>', 'IMHO, too unrecognizable to make an impression as highway lights and not interesting enough to work as an abstract.', '2004-07-01 15:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(790321, 87093, 21362, '<td valign="top">A nice setting, but I think a spot of color would really make this image pop. A woman standing on the bridge with a brightly colored parasol maybe, a child walking across with a toy in hand... some little zing of color.</td>', 'A nice setting, but I think a spot of color would really make this image pop. A woman standing on the bridge with a brightly colored parasol maybe, a child walking across with a toy in hand... some little zing of color.', '2004-07-01 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(790324, 86779, 16753, '<td valign="top">Good subject caught at the right moment, but falls down on  poor sharpness (focus?) and composition. Maybe try cropping some from the top (even cutting off the top of the head) and left to avoid the dead-centered focal point.</td>', 'Good subject caught at the right moment, but falls down on  poor sharpness (focus?) and composition. Maybe try cropping some from the top (even cutting off the top of the head) and left to avoid the dead-centered focal point.', '2004-07-01 15:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790326, 86950, 16753, '<td valign="top">Weird!</td>', 'Weird!', '2004-07-01 15:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(790331, 86624, 10867, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and textures.  I would have preferred the background to be quite a bit more blurred and out of focus.  Also, the skin tone of the model''s face seems a bit too yellowish.  You might want to try selecting the skin area and using colour balance or hue/saturation to correct the tones.</td>', 'Good exposure and textures.  I would have preferred the background to be quite a bit more blurred and out of focus.  Also, the skin tone of the model''s face seems a bit too yellowish.  You might want to try selecting the skin area and using colour balance or hue/saturation to correct the tones.', '2004-07-01 15:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(790332, 86338, 16753, '<td valign="top">Well-spotted and captured. Such an interesting range of colors. Lots going on but nothing overwhelms or distracts.</td>', 'Well-spotted and captured. Such an interesting range of colors. Lots going on but nothing overwhelms or distracts.', '2004-07-01 15:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790334, 86970, 14620, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the glass is a very nice touch, it''s what makes this photo.  But the overall photo seems just a little washed out and a bit fuzzy, but the composition is very nice.</td>', 'The reflection in the glass is a very nice touch, it''s what makes this photo.  But the overall photo seems just a little washed out and a bit fuzzy, but the composition is very nice.', '2004-07-01 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
