(790339, 83508, 14620, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!! Very sharp with great color and movement.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Great action shot!! Very sharp with great color and movement.  Wonderful shot!', '2004-07-01 15:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
