(790395, 84307, 16753, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. Love the mood you captured so well. So many things make this work: the outstretched arms; the shafts of falling water; the overall darkness, yet full range of tones; the diagonal division of the frame; the perfect arrangement of people leading the eye to the foreground. Congrats!</td>', 'Fabulous. Love the mood you captured so well. So many things make this work: the outstretched arms; the shafts of falling water; the overall darkness, yet full range of tones; the diagonal division of the frame; the perfect arrangement of people leading the eye to the foreground. Congrats!', '2004-07-01 15:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
