(790484, 86033, 16563, '<td valign="top">There''s something photoshop about this image. Looks unreal, not surreal but unreal. I think it''s been doctored too much. Otherwise, if it were a bit more natural looking (instead of looking like shiny plastic), it would be a surreal image.</td>', 'There''s something photoshop about this image. Looks unreal, not surreal but unreal. I think it''s been doctored too much. Otherwise, if it were a bit more natural looking (instead of looking like shiny plastic), it would be a surreal image.', '2004-07-01 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(790486, 87132, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting.  Love the composition, too. Two things I would''ve tried to do (considering this was an advanced editing challenge) would be to clone out the light area right at the top, and also either not crop so tightly at the bottom (since the reflection is such an integral part of the image), or, if you have to crop tightly to get other distracting stuff out of the way, maybe some cloning there, too.  Having said all that, of course, I don''t know what the surroundings looked like so all of these suggestions may be impossible.  They are just impressions of what would have improved this particular photo from my point of view.</td>', 'Nice backlighting.  Love the composition, too. Two things I would''ve tried to do (considering this was an advanced editing challenge) would be to clone out the light area right at the top, and also either not crop so tightly at the bottom (since the reflection is such an integral part of the image), or, if you have to crop tightly to get other distracting stuff out of the way, maybe some cloning there, too.  Having said all that, of course, I don''t know what the surroundings looked like so all of these suggestions may be impossible.  They are just impressions of what would have improved this particular photo from my point of view.', '2004-07-01 16:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(790489, 86755, 16563, '<td valign="top">I think leaving only hte candles with color would''ve worked much better.</td>', 'I think leaving only hte candles with color would''ve worked much better.', '2004-07-01 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
