(790831, 83141, 20115, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I had a quacker for 30 something years.  His name was Gimli (yes, from Lord of the Rings, when I originally read it in the 1970s).  He died a year ago this past April.  I loved that bird.  They all look so so similar--it''s like looking at my Gim again.  Thanks.</td>', 'I love this picture.  I had a quacker for 30 something years.  His name was Gimli (yes, from Lord of the Rings, when I originally read it in the 1970s).  He died a year ago this past April.  I loved that bird.  They all look so so similar--it''s like looking at my Gim again.  Thanks.', '2004-07-01 18:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(790857, 83643, 10263, '<td valign="top">How did you get him to pose like that?  Pretty duck. Nice shot.</td>', 'How did you get him to pose like that?  Pretty duck. Nice shot.', '2004-07-01 19:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(790859, 83188, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The colors are amazing and the softness really compliments the flower very well.  Thanks for sharing.  Jacko. 10</td>', 'Wow!  The colors are amazing and the softness really compliments the flower very well.  Thanks for sharing.  Jacko. 10', '2004-07-01 19:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(790862, 86052, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is nice. I love how the little one is looking at the big one. If you could see the big ones eye it would be perfect.</td>', 'This is nice. I love how the little one is looking at the big one. If you could see the big ones eye it would be perfect.', '2004-07-01 19:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(790867, 83392, 10263, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Very clear, clean shot.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Very clear, clean shot.', '2004-07-01 19:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(790868, 86951, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the overal green tinge to the shot, including the dramatic sky. The soft focus is also interesting, and I think it works here in a mythical type of way. Good shot!</td>', 'I like the overal green tinge to the shot, including the dramatic sky. The soft focus is also interesting, and I think it works here in a mythical type of way. Good shot!', '2004-07-01 19:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(790869, 82739, 10263, '<td valign="top">This would have worked for portraits too. She has beautiful eyes. I like the pale green behind her. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'This would have worked for portraits too. She has beautiful eyes. I like the pale green behind her. Beautiful shot.', '2004-07-01 19:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(790870, 86514, 7743, '<td valign="top">The colours and the rhythm of this image are wonderful, however it could use a bit more exposure to make the flowers pop.  This is probably related to the lighting.  It appears to be an overcast day.  6</td>', 'The colours and the rhythm of this image are wonderful, however it could use a bit more exposure to make the flowers pop.  This is probably related to the lighting.  It appears to be an overcast day.  6', '2004-07-01 19:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(790874, 83825, 21362, '<td valign="top">Fun image! Composition might have been improved by having the pink-haired clown as a more prominent subject, rather than off to the side. Or by just having the one clown and its strange reflections by the whole subject. As is, the eye is drawn to two different places in the frame. Good overall. :)</td>', 'Fun image! Composition might have been improved by having the pink-haired clown as a more prominent subject, rather than off to the side. Or by just having the one clown and its strange reflections by the whole subject. As is, the eye is drawn to two different places in the frame. Good overall. :)', '2004-07-01 19:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790876, 84486, 21362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-07-01 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790878, 86698, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing but I think the foreground elements are a little too much and so dominate the image, which takes away from viewing the center element.</td>', 'Interesting framing but I think the foreground elements are a little too much and so dominate the image, which takes away from viewing the center element.', '2004-07-01 19:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(790880, 87015, 14255, '<td valign="top">excellent detail on the head of the moth / butterfly &amp; good DOF. the yellow centre of the flower lacks detail though.</td>', 'excellent detail on the head of the moth / butterfly & good DOF. the yellow centre of the flower lacks detail though.', '2004-07-01 19:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(790881, 86789, 21362, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how to get that star effect on the lights. Great image. I love the rich colors and all the patterns -- the fence, the shadows, the lights. Really lovely.</td>', 'I''d love to know how to get that star effect on the lights. Great image. I love the rich colors and all the patterns -- the fence, the shadows, the lights. Really lovely.', '2004-07-01 19:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(790882, 86119, 6008, '<td valign="top">Ewww bug! The exposure is good and it''s interesting how the bug has a similar camoflage coloring to the petals. I like how the petal he was ''hiding'' behind is lifted up, almost like it is revealing the predator.</td>', 'Ewww bug! The exposure is good and it''s interesting how the bug has a similar camoflage coloring to the petals. I like how the petal he was ''hiding'' behind is lifted up, almost like it is revealing the predator.', '2004-07-01 19:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(790883, 87012, 21362, '<td valign="top">So cute! Great use of the selective desaturation. :)</td>', 'So cute! Great use of the selective desaturation. :)', '2004-07-01 19:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(790884, 86625, 22293, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  so simple, yet so graceful.</td>', 'nice shot.  so simple, yet so graceful.', '2004-07-01 19:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790885, 86054, 21362, '<td valign="top">So simple. I love it.</td>', 'So simple. I love it.', '2004-07-01 19:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(790886, 86409, 3649, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning image. great toning, taking advantage of the light, the right parts are just in focus and the noise adds greatly to the image. composition is excellent. the small amount of light between hand and neck is the SLIGHTEST bit distracting - tone it down a tad? overall excellent. now if i could just vote :)</td>', 'absolutely stunning image. great toning, taking advantage of the light, the right parts are just in focus and the noise adds greatly to the image. composition is excellent. the small amount of light between hand and neck is the SLIGHTEST bit distracting - tone it down a tad? overall excellent. now if i could just vote :)', '2004-07-01 19:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790887, 83675, 21362, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2004-07-01 19:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790888, 86542, 14255, '<td valign="top">The brightness of the background spoilsthisshot for me</td>', 'The brightness of the background spoilsthisshot for me', '2004-07-01 19:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(790889, 86009, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting...really enjoy looking at this one.  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful lighting...really enjoy looking at this one.  :o)', '2004-07-01 19:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(790891, 86800, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, almost a Celtic or Gaelic look to it (moreso than a religious look IMHO).  Love the sky and it''s contrast with her delicate dress.  Good shot!  :o)</td>', 'Very pretty, almost a Celtic or Gaelic look to it (moreso than a religious look IMHO).  Love the sky and it''s contrast with her delicate dress.  Good shot!  :o)', '2004-07-01 19:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(790892, 82862, 14255, '<td valign="top">Good viewpoint, colouring and reflections</td>', 'Good viewpoint, colouring and reflections', '2004-07-01 19:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(790893, 86100, 6008, '<td valign="top">A classic image of pier, reflected water, sun, and silhouette. In a perfect moment the sun would have been hazed out a little and been a big perfectly round circle - this sun, hoever, is a little overexposed, but still creates a nice presence. The lone figure and his/her reflection/shadow adds a nice human interest.</td>', 'A classic image of pier, reflected water, sun, and silhouette. In a perfect moment the sun would have been hazed out a little and been a big perfectly round circle - this sun, hoever, is a little overexposed, but still creates a nice presence. The lone figure and his/her reflection/shadow adds a nice human interest.', '2004-07-01 19:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(790896, 84310, 18349, '<td valign="top">The bride needs to be sure all of her business is covered before walking down that aisle!  ;o)  Beautiful shot, very runway.  Pose and lighting are well-captured.</td>', 'The bride needs to be sure all of her business is covered before walking down that aisle!  ;o)  Beautiful shot, very runway.  Pose and lighting are well-captured.', '2004-07-01 19:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(790897, 85152, 22046, '<td valign="top">This one keeps drawing me back for another look. It is the graphic design of the picture that I find so attractive. And its mystery.</td>', 'This one keeps drawing me back for another look. It is the graphic design of the picture that I find so attractive. And its mystery.', '2004-07-01 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790898, 81761, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good dark tones and a good urban gritty feeling to the shot. A little chaotic, but that represents well the subculture of skateboarding. The body language of the main skater is good, although wish I could see his facial expression a little clearer/closer (I think his tongue is poking out!). A good street shot.</td>', 'Good dark tones and a good urban gritty feeling to the shot. A little chaotic, but that represents well the subculture of skateboarding. The body language of the main skater is good, although wish I could see his facial expression a little clearer/closer (I think his tongue is poking out!). A good street shot.', '2004-07-01 19:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(790899, 86580, 22046, '<td valign="top">Elegant photo of one of my favorite butterflies. These are not easy to catch sitting still. What really works for me about this is the simplicity of the composition and the out of focus deep green background. Very well done.</td>', 'Elegant photo of one of my favorite butterflies. These are not easy to catch sitting still. What really works for me about this is the simplicity of the composition and the out of focus deep green background. Very well done.', '2004-07-01 19:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(790901, 86947, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit image. i wouldhowever have prefered the shot if you had cropped off the bottom section where all the people are as they (especially the ghostly figure under 5th pillar from the left)distract from an otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'Nicely lit image. i wouldhowever have prefered the shot if you had cropped off the bottom section where all the people are as they (especially the ghostly figure under 5th pillar from the left)distract from an otherwise nice shot.', '2004-07-01 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(790902, 86961, 22046, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful portrait of a life! Your title is also magnificent. This celebrates the living of a life and gives deep meaning to age. In our agist society this is a welcome look at having lived awhile. Thank you! My vote - 10 for photographic expertise, 10 for subject.</td>', 'What a beautiful portrait of a life! Your title is also magnificent. This celebrates the living of a life and gives deep meaning to age. In our agist society this is a welcome look at having lived awhile. Thank you! My vote - 10 for photographic expertise, 10 for subject.', '2004-07-01 19:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(790903, 84115, 6008, '<td valign="top">Great textures and color. Nice simple composition with a good non-distractive background. Seems nicely sharp too. Only nitpick would be to have his eye a little brighter/clearer.</td>', 'Great textures and color. Nice simple composition with a good non-distractive background. Seems nicely sharp too. Only nitpick would be to have his eye a little brighter/clearer.', '2004-07-01 19:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(790905, 86870, 22046, '<td valign="top">Don''t know where the purple came from but it makes this shot! I think your crop is just right too, leaving about two thirds purple above the duck. (I''m not a stickler for the rule of thirds but it certainly works well in this shot.)</td>', 'Don''t know where the purple came from but it makes this shot! I think your crop is just right too, leaving about two thirds purple above the duck. (I''m not a stickler for the rule of thirds but it certainly works well in this shot.)', '2004-07-01 19:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(790909, 86409, 22046, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait. The use of sepia tone works very well. The lighting is beautiful and dramatic. The balance of the dark figure on the left and the bright area on the right is wonderful. My only wish would be to see her eye a bit more clearly but that is a minor issue as the rest is so beautifully moving.</td>', 'I really like this portrait. The use of sepia tone works very well. The lighting is beautiful and dramatic. The balance of the dark figure on the left and the bright area on the right is wonderful. My only wish would be to see her eye a bit more clearly but that is a minor issue as the rest is so beautifully moving.', '2004-07-01 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(790910, 86491, 14255, '<td valign="top">image is too bright on the left hand side. nicely captured shot otherwise.</td>', 'image is too bright on the left hand side. nicely captured shot otherwise.', '2004-07-01 19:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(790913, 85713, 21362, '<td valign="top">Cute. The perspective totally makes this image. :) Good job.</td>', 'Cute. The perspective totally makes this image. :) Good job.', '2004-07-01 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(790915, 86323, 22046, '<td valign="top">The thing that makes this special is the lighting and that dark sky. Well done.</td>', 'The thing that makes this special is the lighting and that dark sky. Well done.', '2004-07-01 19:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(790916, 84578, 14255, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the dragonfly. The multi coloured background is a bit busy &amp; a little distracting though.</td>', 'Good detail on the dragonfly. The multi coloured background is a bit busy & a little distracting though.', '2004-07-01 19:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(790918, 86323, 21362, '<td valign="top">Great light. I wish it was a more natural setting and didn''t have those treadmarks, but otherwise very pretty.</td>', 'Great light. I wish it was a more natural setting and didn''t have those treadmarks, but otherwise very pretty.', '2004-07-01 19:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790919, 83748, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice catch!  Personally, I thinhk this image would be much stronger with the bottom third cropped off (the road and the lit up building, too).  As it is now, the light trails on the road are competing too much with the lightning.  I realize that you obviously intended the shot this way, this is just my opinion on what I feel would be a stronger crop, even though it''s a very different shot at that point.</td>', 'Nice catch!  Personally, I thinhk this image would be much stronger with the bottom third cropped off (the road and the lit up building, too).  As it is now, the light trails on the road are competing too much with the lightning.  I realize that you obviously intended the shot this way, this is just my opinion on what I feel would be a stronger crop, even though it''s a very different shot at that point.', '2004-07-01 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(790920, 85238, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very pretty landscape. I like the layers of foreground grass, background grass, and mountain, and of course the sky is very dramatic. The colors seem a little odd, although I''m not sure I can explain why it feels like that. The composition is a good classic.</td>', 'Very pretty landscape. I like the layers of foreground grass, background grass, and mountain, and of course the sky is very dramatic. The colors seem a little odd, although I''m not sure I can explain why it feels like that. The composition is a good classic.', '2004-07-01 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(790921, 87132, 22046, '<td valign="top">It is very hard to get a lily pond shot that isn''t cluttered. You have achieved this with this lovely image.</td>', 'It is very hard to get a lily pond shot that isn''t cluttered. You have achieved this with this lovely image.', '2004-07-01 19:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
