(790927, 86950, 21362, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this is the only challenge entry documenting this June event! Glad you got such a great image of it! Really cool!<br/> <br/>What''s with the smiley face though?</td>', 'I can''t believe this is the only challenge entry documenting this June event! Glad you got such a great image of it! Really cool! What''s with the smiley face though?', '2004-07-01 19:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(790928, 87006, 22046, '<td valign="top">It is so hard to get a backlit tree to look luminescent like this. You''ve done a great job here. I especially like the dark curving branches against the bright leaves.</td>', 'It is so hard to get a backlit tree to look luminescent like this. You''ve done a great job here. I especially like the dark curving branches against the bright leaves.', '2004-07-01 19:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(790931, 84278, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2004-07-01 19:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(790933, 85605, 6008, '<td valign="top">The black and white seems a little wishy-washy and could probably do with more contrast to really darken the blacks that seem fairly grey to me. The close, full-frame shot is good, but the background still seems to be a major part of the image. The petals also lack a little texture and I''m guessing it was likely slightly overexposed. The soft focus helps make it look more delicate but I think having the middle bits (stamen?) be in focus could help balance it out more.</td>', 'The black and white seems a little wishy-washy and could probably do with more contrast to really darken the blacks that seem fairly grey to me. The close, full-frame shot is good, but the background still seems to be a major part of the image. The petals also lack a little texture and I''m guessing it was likely slightly overexposed. The soft focus helps make it look more delicate but I think having the middle bits (stamen?) be in focus could help balance it out more.', '2004-07-01 19:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(790934, 85041, 22046, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is one gorgeous seagul photo. The purity of the white against the blue. The sharp focus on his beak and eyes. The curve of the upper wing. Bravo!</td>', 'Wow! This is one gorgeous seagul photo. The purity of the white against the blue. The sharp focus on his beak and eyes. The curve of the upper wing. Bravo!', '2004-07-01 19:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
