(790937, 86693, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the dof to isolate the head - he looks like he is winking. I also like the earthy tones and the green contrasts nicely. Good texture on the head and seems fairly sharp too.</td>', 'I like the dof to isolate the head - he looks like he is winking. I also like the earthy tones and the green contrasts nicely. Good texture on the head and seems fairly sharp too.', '2004-07-01 19:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
