(791074, 87025, 2130, '<td valign="top">I can smell the mood in this one...a really good job...maybe it would look more interesting if the object (whatever you call it...my name for it is vespa) in the foreground was lit up...maybe with headlights or a fill-in flash...and the whole thing was in the photo...the tire too...then it would stand out and shine and make the whole street seem like a magical place......</td>', 'I can smell the mood in this one...a really good job...maybe it would look more interesting if the object (whatever you call it...my name for it is vespa) in the foreground was lit up...maybe with headlights or a fill-in flash...and the whole thing was in the photo...the tire too...then it would stand out and shine and make the whole street seem like a magical place......', '2004-07-01 20:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
