(791512, 86067, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish she didn''t blend in with the background so well.  Focus is good, and I like the subject.  Quite interesting.  I like the movement in her arms.  I really do like the arms.  I guess my only real complaint would be that she blends in too well with the background. ~Heather~</td>', 'I wish she didn''t blend in with the background so well.  Focus is good, and I like the subject.  Quite interesting.  I like the movement in her arms.  I really do like the arms.  I guess my only real complaint would be that she blends in too well with the background. ~Heather~', '2004-07-02 00:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
