(791621, 86961, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a superb portrait, IMHO.  I love the tones and the texture of the skin.  Beautiful!  :o)</td>', 'This is a superb portrait, IMHO.  I love the tones and the texture of the skin.  Beautiful!  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(791632, 87025, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of thsi shot.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of thsi shot.', '2004-07-02 01:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(791636, 85160, 4007, '<td valign="top">I understand that spotting this bird might be rare and therefore of some significance, but this photo doesn''t really provide much more than evidence of having spotted it.  I''m not quite sure how to explain why (and I''m sorry for that), but nothing here really captures or holds my interest.</td>', 'I understand that spotting this bird might be rare and therefore of some significance, but this photo doesn''t really provide much more than evidence of having spotted it.  I''m not quite sure how to explain why (and I''m sorry for that), but nothing here really captures or holds my interest.', '2004-07-02 01:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(791643, 84771, 7485, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary! I''d love to find out how you did that (assuming that really is the sky, if it''s a solid background then that''s cheating and I''m not interested) - 8</td>', 'Extraordinary! I''d love to find out how you did that (assuming that really is the sky, if it''s a solid background then that''s cheating and I''m not interested) - 8', '2004-07-02 01:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(791646, 86056, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but really needs a little boost in the black-point (to make the darks darker).</td>', 'Great shot, but really needs a little boost in the black-point (to make the darks darker).', '2004-07-02 01:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(791654, 87014, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very cool...love the heat mirage going on in the background...and that car is just awesome.  Next time, run off those people so the car gets seen in all it''s glory!  LOL :o)</td>', 'Very cool...love the heat mirage going on in the background...and that car is just awesome.  Next time, run off those people so the car gets seen in all it''s glory!  LOL :o)', '2004-07-02 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(791693, 86800, 10848, '<td valign="top">outstanding, this is a winner for sure 10</td>', 'outstanding, this is a winner for sure 10', '2004-07-02 02:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791695, 85502, 10848, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2004-07-02 02:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791699, 86027, 10848, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, very moving 10</td>', 'beautiful shot, very moving 10', '2004-07-02 02:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(791701, 86800, 19608, '<td valign="top">With almost 400 entries, it would be hard to pick out a single photographer - unless that person had an incredible and unique style.  But I expect that is the case - another stunning image from Iceland!  There are not enough adjectives to describe the emotions this image invokes.   It''s a 10 now.. remove the border and it''s an 11.  (If you are not from Iceland - my sincere congratulations on being able to shoot in the same way she does.)</td>', 'With almost 400 entries, it would be hard to pick out a single photographer - unless that person had an incredible and unique style.  But I expect that is the case - another stunning image from Iceland!  There are not enough adjectives to describe the emotions this image invokes.   It''s a 10 now.. remove the border and it''s an 11.  (If you are not from Iceland - my sincere congratulations on being able to shoot in the same way she does.)', '2004-07-02 02:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(791706, 86507, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love flowers.  I love perfection.  I truly love this image!  You are a very brave person to enter a flower into this challenge - there are (my guess) at least 40 or 50 "others."   But - this is heads and shoulders above the pack.  I hope you get by the "I hate flowers" crowd and win a ribbon as you really should.  I normally try to give a suggestion to improve an image..... but.. there is absolutely nothing that comes to mind.</td>', 'I love flowers.  I love perfection.  I truly love this image!  You are a very brave person to enter a flower into this challenge - there are (my guess) at least 40 or 50 "others."   But - this is heads and shoulders above the pack.  I hope you get by the "I hate flowers" crowd and win a ribbon as you really should.  I normally try to give a suggestion to improve an image..... but.. there is absolutely nothing that comes to mind.', '2004-07-02 02:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(791715, 86338, 19608, '<td valign="top">How do you spell ribbon?  If you don''t know - you''d better practice as this image  is headed for topsville.  I''m in total awe - so I''ll just shut up and enjoy your moment for a while....</td>', 'How do you spell ribbon?  If you don''t know - you''d better practice as this image  is headed for topsville.  I''m in total awe - so I''ll just shut up and enjoy your moment for a while....', '2004-07-02 02:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791721, 85595, 10848, '<td valign="top">I am a big Disney fan, and of course Timon and Pumba are my very favorite, this is a very good shot. Much attention to detail, the eyes are phenominal. 9</td>', 'I am a big Disney fan, and of course Timon and Pumba are my very favorite, this is a very good shot. Much attention to detail, the eyes are phenominal. 9', '2004-07-02 02:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(791722, 86180, 10848, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot</td>', 'Gorgeous shot', '2004-07-02 02:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(791724, 86939, 10848, '<td valign="top">Love dolphins, this is a great shot.</td>', 'Love dolphins, this is a great shot.', '2004-07-02 02:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791726, 85677, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful great clarity and color.</td>', 'Beautiful great clarity and color.', '2004-07-02 02:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(791730, 86800, 11756, '<td valign="top">wow, how did you get the background like that?  It''sdramatic, but not sure it looks natural.</td>', 'wow, how did you get the background like that?  It''sdramatic, but not sure it looks natural.', '2004-07-02 02:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(791750, 86531, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional.  Emotional. Evocative.  Perfect exposure and focal point.  It''s already a 10 - move your camera a tiny bit to the right - it becomes an 11!<br/> <br/>The title needs less fact and more imagination.<br/> <br/>There''s a bus to a town called "Ribbonsville"  - you are seated in the front seat..</td>', 'Exceptional.  Emotional. Evocative.  Perfect exposure and focal point.  It''s already a 10 - move your camera a tiny bit to the right - it becomes an 11! The title needs less fact and more imagination. There''s a bus to a town called "Ribbonsville"  - you are seated in the front seat..', '2004-07-02 03:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(791752, 87103, 10414, '<td valign="top">Priceless!!!!  10</td>', 'Priceless!!!!  10', '2004-07-02 03:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(791754, 83748, 19608, '<td valign="top">Some images lack the wow factor - yours reeks of it!  I have no suggestions on what you could do any better.</td>', 'Some images lack the wow factor - yours reeks of it!  I have no suggestions on what you could do any better.', '2004-07-02 03:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(791758, 87150, 10414, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed here were his eyes....and then all the color around him! Wonderful picture!!! Beautiful eyes! 10</td>', 'The first thing I noticed here were his eyes....and then all the color around him! Wonderful picture!!! Beautiful eyes! 10', '2004-07-02 03:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791761, 84527, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh....this is a winner in my book!  I wish I could give you more, but here''s a 10. :)</td>', 'Ahhhh....this is a winner in my book!  I wish I could give you more, but here''s a 10. :)', '2004-07-02 03:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(791765, 86597, 10414, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Did you do something to make the sky this grey and colorless? Or was it like this? Good shot!! 9</td>', 'I really like this shot. Did you do something to make the sky this grey and colorless? Or was it like this? Good shot!! 9', '2004-07-02 03:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(791768, 86947, 10414, '<td valign="top">Oh...how much we take that for granted!  :) Great shot!!  9</td>', 'Oh...how much we take that for granted!  :) Great shot!!  9', '2004-07-02 03:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(791776, 87079, 10414, '<td valign="top">What an adorable little boy!!! The water seems frozen in the air! What a nice camera you must have!!!  :)</td>', 'What an adorable little boy!!! The water seems frozen in the air! What a nice camera you must have!!!  :)', '2004-07-02 03:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(791785, 85431, 6172, '<td valign="top">poor focus, and, looks like just a snapshot</td>', 'poor focus, and, looks like just a snapshot', '2004-07-02 03:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(791788, 87015, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.  That seems like a good flower to have the moth perch on.  It seems like more of the moth could be in focus</td>', 'Nice catch.  That seems like a good flower to have the moth perch on.  It seems like more of the moth could be in focus', '2004-07-02 03:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(791791, 86054, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very good use of lighting in this shot.  Nice simple beauty in this shot.</td>', 'Very good use of lighting in this shot.  Nice simple beauty in this shot.', '2004-07-02 03:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(791794, 84486, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, I like it a lot.  I might have preferred to see this in a high-contrast b&amp;w without the sepia tone, but it''s hard to tell</td>', 'Very interesting subject, I like it a lot.  I might have preferred to see this in a high-contrast b&w without the sepia tone, but it''s hard to tell', '2004-07-02 03:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(791795, 84332, 6172, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus on it''s face, great use of DOF here.  Love those colors.</td>', 'Perfect focus on it''s face, great use of DOF here.  Love those colors.', '2004-07-02 03:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791798, 86807, 6172, '<td valign="top">I like the drops of water and the soft focus.  Tres cliche</td>', 'I like the drops of water and the soft focus.  Tres cliche', '2004-07-02 03:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(791806, 86835, 6172, '<td valign="top">Perfect use of symmetry.  I wonder if this shot would look better if you had cropped the shadow in the forefront out?</td>', 'Perfect use of symmetry.  I wonder if this shot would look better if you had cropped the shadow in the forefront out?', '2004-07-02 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(791811, 83041, 20781, '<td valign="top">This is the best use of effects on a picture that i have seen in a long time, great job.</td>', 'This is the best use of effects on a picture that i have seen in a long time, great job.', '2004-07-02 03:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(791837, 83057, 10680, '<td valign="top">this is a good picture but i think the harsh lighting here seems like it was too much to overcome. very hot light from above, and too much clutter from the shadows unfortunately.</td>', 'this is a good picture but i think the harsh lighting here seems like it was too much to overcome. very hot light from above, and too much clutter from the shadows unfortunately.', '2004-07-02 04:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(791885, 87012, 23743, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Nice retro feel, too.</td>', 'Great expression!  Nice retro feel, too.', '2004-07-02 07:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791905, 84307, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and nice steely grey tones which add a moodiness to the shot.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and nice steely grey tones which add a moodiness to the shot.', '2004-07-02 08:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(791909, 86394, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and just the right amount of softening to give the image appeal.</td>', 'Nice composition and just the right amount of softening to give the image appeal.', '2004-07-02 08:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791911, 86439, 3724, '<td valign="top">great depth and texture to this sky...</td>', 'great depth and texture to this sky...', '2004-07-02 08:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(791912, 85358, 6678, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - a great capture</td>', 'Brilliant - a great capture', '2004-07-02 08:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791914, 86984, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good composition and nice subdued lighting</td>', 'Good composition and nice subdued lighting', '2004-07-02 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(791915, 81724, 6678, '<td valign="top">Looks like this baby popped right up in front of you. A great capture.</td>', 'Looks like this baby popped right up in front of you. A great capture.', '2004-07-02 08:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(791919, 84115, 14603, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully sharp image..the water drops on the penguins head really add interest.. a little reflected light to brighten up the side of it`s head and bring the eye into view would have made this perfect.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Wonderfully sharp image..the water drops on the penguins head really add interest.. a little reflected light to brighten up the side of it`s head and bring the eye into view would have made this perfect.Good work', '2004-07-02 08:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(791922, 87106, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very unusual angle of shot ..excellent composition and nice hazy lighting all add to the impact of the image..the haziness behind the subject (almost like a lens reflection) is the only minor drawback to me.<br/>Interesting shot of an unusual subject..should do well</td>', 'Very unusual angle of shot ..excellent composition and nice hazy lighting all add to the impact of the image..the haziness behind the subject (almost like a lens reflection) is the only minor drawback to me.Interesting shot of an unusual subject..should do well', '2004-07-02 08:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791932, 83121, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and wonderful simplicity.<br/>I would imagine you will have had a few comments regarding the oversoftened halo effects. I actually like it in this image but some voters will probably lower your score because of it...hope not.</td>', 'Nice composition and wonderful simplicity.I would imagine you will have had a few comments regarding the oversoftened halo effects. I actually like it in this image but some voters will probably lower your score because of it...hope not.', '2004-07-02 08:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791935, 86409, 14603, '<td valign="top">I would like to comment fully on this image but it would probably take a week to finish. I love everything about it.<br/>Composition, tones, textures, lighting.. all superb.<br/>This has got to win a ribbon..fantastic work...10 but I would like to give more.</td>', 'I would like to comment fully on this image but it would probably take a week to finish. I love everything about it.Composition, tones, textures, lighting.. all superb.This has got to win a ribbon..fantastic work...10 but I would like to give more.', '2004-07-02 08:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(791937, 82511, 8860, '<td valign="top">... Neither am I. But this shot is lovely. Great tone, light and texture.</td>', '... Neither am I. But this shot is lovely. Great tone, light and texture.', '2004-07-02 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(791941, 86535, 14603, '<td valign="top">In company with the heron...nicely captured</td>', 'In company with the heron...nicely captured', '2004-07-02 08:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791943, 87028, 14603, '<td valign="top">The unusual composition makes this a study of shapes and angles which gives the image added interest..also nicely lit.</td>', 'The unusual composition makes this a study of shapes and angles which gives the image added interest..also nicely lit.', '2004-07-02 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(791944, 85502, 14603, '<td valign="top">A flower picture with a difference..the effect you have used has given this image a real boost.<br/>Very original..excellent work..9</td>', 'A flower picture with a difference..the effect you have used has given this image a real boost.Very original..excellent work..9', '2004-07-02 08:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(791945, 85061, 14603, '<td valign="top">Original approach to a popular subject..definitely one of the best of it`s genre</td>', 'Original approach to a popular subject..definitely one of the best of it`s genre', '2004-07-02 08:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791946, 86535, 8759, '<td valign="top">beautiful capture and composition</td>', 'beautiful capture and composition', '2004-07-02 08:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(791948, 85054, 14614, '<td valign="top">I drive across this one almost every day -- always thought about where I shoot it from... :)<br/>I think you''ve got about the best angle.  I think it''s missing a focal point (as composed the abutment (?) becomes the focal pont but it''s too far away to be very interesting and too bland in color to add much to the shot.</td>', 'I drive across this one almost every day -- always thought about where I shoot it from... :)I think you''ve got about the best angle.  I think it''s missing a focal point (as composed the abutment (?) becomes the focal pont but it''s too far away to be very interesting and too bland in color to add much to the shot.', '2004-07-02 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791949, 87006, 14603, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition using light to full effect as well.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Lovely composition using light to full effect as well.Good work', '2004-07-02 08:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791950, 86054, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely 10</td>', 'Lovely 10', '2004-07-02 08:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(791952, 85713, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-07-02 08:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(791953, 86499, 14614, '<td valign="top">a really great shot (I''d leave off the "editoriall" candid comment in your title).  The composition is made by the subject jumping into the water.  B&amp;W treatment works well.  Blurry stuff in the lower foreground distracts a bit but adds to the chaotic water feel.</td>', 'a really great shot (I''d leave off the "editoriall" candid comment in your title).  The composition is made by the subject jumping into the water.  B&W treatment works well.  Blurry stuff in the lower foreground distracts a bit but adds to the chaotic water feel.', '2004-07-02 08:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791954, 86778, 8759, '<td valign="top">sparkles are nice so the colours. The poor focus on the babys face spoils the pic. And a little too much noise...</td>', 'sparkles are nice so the colours. The poor focus on the babys face spoils the pic. And a little too much noise...', '2004-07-02 08:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(791955, 86963, 14603, '<td valign="top">Quite a hike to get this pic I would imagine ?<br/>Pretty scary view..nice composition and range of colour in the image.</td>', 'Quite a hike to get this pic I would imagine ?Pretty scary view..nice composition and range of colour in the image.', '2004-07-02 08:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791957, 86474, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good old cows..they can always be relied upon to be inquisitive.<br/>You`ve managed to get a nice exposure range considering the angle of shot which takes in the sky.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Good old cows..they can always be relied upon to be inquisitive.You`ve managed to get a nice exposure range considering the angle of shot which takes in the sky.Good work', '2004-07-02 09:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(791958, 86338, 14603, '<td valign="top">Fantastic depth to this picture and the sky effects are the icing on the cake.<br/>Well captured</td>', 'Fantastic depth to this picture and the sky effects are the icing on the cake.Well captured', '2004-07-02 09:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(791964, 86466, 14603, '<td valign="top">First class image..the lighting is superb..my only reservation is the centre composition. When I blot out the lefthand side of the image (from the edge of the hair back) leaving the child looking into dark negative space it adds impact (for me). I stress that this is only personal preference and I am no expert in portraiture..but I do know that this image will finish with a high placing as it is an excellent piece of work</td>', 'First class image..the lighting is superb..my only reservation is the centre composition. When I blot out the lefthand side of the image (from the edge of the hair back) leaving the child looking into dark negative space it adds impact (for me). I stress that this is only personal preference and I am no expert in portraiture..but I do know that this image will finish with a high placing as it is an excellent piece of work', '2004-07-02 09:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791967, 87103, 13602, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent story, I like it. I also agree to your choice to go for b/w colors would only take away allot of the impact for this shot. Verry good, I hope you do well, good luck!</td>', 'This is an excellent story, I like it. I also agree to your choice to go for b/w colors would only take away allot of the impact for this shot. Verry good, I hope you do well, good luck!', '2004-07-02 09:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(791971, 84771, 14603, '<td valign="top">The type of image where digital photography and techniques come to the fore.<br/>Wonderful picture..certain to do well.</td>', 'The type of image where digital photography and techniques come to the fore.Wonderful picture..certain to do well.', '2004-07-02 09:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(791973, 86961, 11800, '<td valign="top">Hmm. I guess you have to choose it as a favorite first, then leave a comment. It just deleted my original comment.<br/>I had just gone on and on about how I like this and how it shows such a quiet strength. I also said something about the tonal range and the composition. All good things. I like it.</td>', 'Hmm. I guess you have to choose it as a favorite first, then leave a comment. It just deleted my original comment.I had just gone on and on about how I like this and how it shows such a quiet strength. I also said something about the tonal range and the composition. All good things. I like it.', '2004-07-02 09:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(791975, 86457, 14603, '<td valign="top">Superb clarity and depth of field..very powerful image.</td>', 'Superb clarity and depth of field..very powerful image.', '2004-07-02 09:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(791982, 86499, 21714, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. Lovely shot. Very Cool.</td>', 'Brilliant. Lovely shot. Very Cool.', '2004-07-02 09:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(791986, 87151, 11800, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the timing. This would have been outstanding in the advertisement challenge. You probably hate to hear that as much as I do. lol<br/>Well. Now for the critique. Viewed on a pc with ms ie.<br/>Dof ok. I think it would have been more effective to have the second boot a little more in focus. I just now saw it.  One would be better able to see the fence line which might be an important leading line in the composition. <br/>The color is nice and rich but a bit on the underexposed side.<br/>Composition, perfect. <br/>Exposure. There isn''t a good range in tones. The sole of the boot is so dark much of the detail is lost and the fence blends in with the trees.<br/>I do like this and think it is well thought out but maybe suffered a little from the post processing..</td>', 'Too bad about the timing. This would have been outstanding in the advertisement challenge. You probably hate to hear that as much as I do. lolWell. Now for the critique. Viewed on a pc with ms ie.Dof ok. I think it would have been more effective to have the second boot a little more in focus. I just now saw it.  One would be better able to see the fence line which might be an important leading line in the composition. The color is nice and rich but a bit on the underexposed side.Composition, perfect. Exposure. There isn''t a good range in tones. The sole of the boot is so dark much of the detail is lost and the fence blends in with the trees.I do like this and think it is well thought out but maybe suffered a little from the post processing..', '2004-07-02 09:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(791989, 85152, 21714, '<td valign="top">A brilliant creation.</td>', 'A brilliant creation.', '2004-07-02 09:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(791990, 86446, 21714, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. :)</td>', 'Lovely shot. :)', '2004-07-02 09:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791992, 86453, 21714, '<td valign="top">Would make a very good print.</td>', 'Would make a very good print.', '2004-07-02 10:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(791995, 84137, 21714, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  Would have made it a great image if the bird had sharper focus - especially around the eye.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  Would have made it a great image if the bird had sharper focus - especially around the eye.', '2004-07-02 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(791997, 84188, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice title and I like it.</td>', 'Nice title and I like it.', '2004-07-02 10:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(791998, 86457, 6130, '<td valign="top">Great 10</td>', 'Great 10', '2004-07-02 10:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
