(792044, 86409, 22877, '<td valign="top">Wow, really nice tones. Personally I would  have liked to see the eyes. But still congrats!!!</td>', 'Wow, really nice tones. Personally I would  have liked to see the eyes. But still congrats!!!', '2004-07-02 11:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(792058, 84124, 22781, '<td valign="top">A very intense look!</td>', 'A very intense look!', '2004-07-02 11:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(792067, 86100, 15832, '<td valign="top">Is it possabel to crop this photo tighter or is the pixel not high enough?<br/>I was thinking if the left half could be croped out at the border where the bridge ends (on the side where the man is standing) .  And then almost the half of the top of the picture so the sun is centerd and the man standing at the left end on the photo?  I think it could be really chatcy..<br/>Anyway...<br/>Just my opinion. I like this picture alot. 9</td>', 'Is it possabel to crop this photo tighter or is the pixel not high enough?I was thinking if the left half could be croped out at the border where the bridge ends (on the side where the man is standing) .  And then almost the half of the top of the picture so the sun is centerd and the man standing at the left end on the photo?  I think it could be really chatcy..Anyway...Just my opinion. I like this picture alot. 9', '2004-07-02 11:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(792077, 87151, 18349, '<td valign="top">Had to add this to my faves...I have a cowboy thing, I guess!   :o)  Wonderful colors, DOF is excellent; love the angle.  Beautiful!</td>', 'Had to add this to my faves...I have a cowboy thing, I guess!   :o)  Wonderful colors, DOF is excellent; love the angle.  Beautiful!', '2004-07-02 11:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
