(792336, 84310, 4008, '<td valign="top">I guess she caught a lot of attention with that dress, a day to remember for many. The colors of this image seem to be a bit off, like there is a bit dull soft greyish  cast across the image, maybe lens flare (or filter flare ?).</td>', 'I guess she caught a lot of attention with that dress, a day to remember for many. The colors of this image seem to be a bit off, like there is a bit dull soft greyish  cast across the image, maybe lens flare (or filter flare ?).', '2004-07-02 13:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
