(792438, 86999, 16301, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the almost centered composition here works :) Maybe try composing it using the rule of thirds, it''ll look better...Good luck.</td>', 'I don''t think the almost centered composition here works :) Maybe try composing it using the rule of thirds, it''ll look better...Good luck.', '2004-07-02 14:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
