(792474, 87102, 22781, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title because of my bad english. But I get the picture.<br/>As most DCP voters I vote lower on "my pet" pictures until I see something realy good.<br/>This is one of them. Realy good, and realy sweet.</td>', 'I don''t get the title because of my bad english. But I get the picture.As most DCP voters I vote lower on "my pet" pictures until I see something realy good.This is one of them. Realy good, and realy sweet.', '2004-07-02 15:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
