(792484, 86485, 11800, '<td valign="top">This might be one of the shots that would do better if the viewer had more information.  The exposure is pretty good except for the spot where the sun is reflecting off the water. The people run too much together which, to me, makes them seem alien. I can see how each generation has a pair melded together which could have been a type of story. But then there are single people also, so I am left to wonder what the message of the picture is. Nice concept. Maybe reshoot with more space between the people or with some more front lighting.<br/>viewed on a pc with ms ie</td>', 'This might be one of the shots that would do better if the viewer had more information.  The exposure is pretty good except for the spot where the sun is reflecting off the water. The people run too much together which, to me, makes them seem alien. I can see how each generation has a pair melded together which could have been a type of story. But then there are single people also, so I am left to wonder what the message of the picture is. Nice concept. Maybe reshoot with more space between the people or with some more front lighting.viewed on a pc with ms ie', '2004-07-02 15:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
