(792512, 85628, 9411, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. It conveys the ttle perfectly. Great pose, background and light. The only thing I find not perfect is the light shining through her hair.  If it is supposed to convey a spot light, I think it would have been better to have it coming from a side or other wise showing what it is.   Because all the background it black I think it is a distraction as it is.  9</td>', 'I love this shot. It conveys the ttle perfectly. Great pose, background and light. The only thing I find not perfect is the light shining through her hair.  If it is supposed to convey a spot light, I think it would have been better to have it coming from a side or other wise showing what it is.   Because all the background it black I think it is a distraction as it is.  9', '2004-07-02 15:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(792515, 87033, 9411, '<td valign="top">Outstanding image.   Given the simplicity of the over all image, I feel the person on the breakwater is a bit of a distraction.  Of course that is just my opinion. 9</td>', 'Outstanding image.   Given the simplicity of the over all image, I feel the person on the breakwater is a bit of a distraction.  Of course that is just my opinion. 9', '2004-07-02 15:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(792518, 85943, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image.  It is stunning in it''s simplicity. My one thought is that given the choice of crop, having the negative space be what it is and the floral elements be off centre, I feel there should have been something to anchor the flowers to the frame. Possibly if it was centred, that would not be necessary. 9</td>', 'Wonderful image.  It is stunning in it''s simplicity. My one thought is that given the choice of crop, having the negative space be what it is and the floral elements be off centre, I feel there should have been something to anchor the flowers to the frame. Possibly if it was centred, that would not be necessary. 9', '2004-07-02 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
