(792857, 85834, 11800, '<td valign="top">The color that is in the picture is nice. The choice of dof created some nice blurring on the futher leaves while allowing good detail on the front leaves and water. I like how the light penetrates the leaves causing the tranlucient color on the left center leaf. Unfortunately, I think because of the strong light, this looks overexposed. IMO, it would have been outstanding if there was a little more than a hint of green in the composition.</td>', 'The color that is in the picture is nice. The choice of dof created some nice blurring on the futher leaves while allowing good detail on the front leaves and water. I like how the light penetrates the leaves causing the tranlucient color on the left center leaf. Unfortunately, I think because of the strong light, this looks overexposed. IMO, it would have been outstanding if there was a little more than a hint of green in the composition.', '2004-07-02 19:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
