(792874, 87150, 21202, '<td valign="top">Good picture of helmet and shoulder pads.  I find the background unsettlingly out of focus as if intentionally blurred and it would be interesting to find some way to illumiinate the face.</td>', 'Good picture of helmet and shoulder pads.  I find the background unsettlingly out of focus as if intentionally blurred and it would be interesting to find some way to illumiinate the face.', '2004-07-02 20:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(792876, 86052, 21202, '<td valign="top">The expressions are somewhat interesting.  I would like better lighting, composition, and depth of field.</td>', 'The expressions are somewhat interesting.  I would like better lighting, composition, and depth of field.', '2004-07-02 20:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(792879, 86544, 21202, '<td valign="top">A candid shot with a blank background is a little strange.  I like the expression, light distribution, but the bottom of the picture and shoulder seem purposely blurred (not out of focus) and very uninteresting.</td>', 'A candid shot with a blank background is a little strange.  I like the expression, light distribution, but the bottom of the picture and shoulder seem purposely blurred (not out of focus) and very uninteresting.', '2004-07-02 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(792883, 86449, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is nice in that some of the petals are backlit and some are in direct light.  I think a better picture could be taken when there is less glare.</td>', 'This is nice in that some of the petals are backlit and some are in direct light.  I think a better picture could be taken when there is less glare.', '2004-07-02 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792888, 82756, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice expression.  I would like to see more of the head and more light in the mouth and throat.</td>', 'Very nice expression.  I would like to see more of the head and more light in the mouth and throat.', '2004-07-02 20:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(792889, 87077, 17134, '<td valign="top">looks like it''s floating on the picture itself.. very nice effect, especially when its reached ''naturally''</td>', 'looks like it''s floating on the picture itself.. very nice effect, especially when its reached ''naturally''', '2004-07-02 20:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792891, 86607, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would like greater depth of field, as the body and flowers are in relatively sharp focus.  Alternatively, by focusing at a lesser distance, everything could have been in soft focus.</td>', 'I would like greater depth of field, as the body and flowers are in relatively sharp focus.  Alternatively, by focusing at a lesser distance, everything could have been in soft focus.', '2004-07-02 20:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792893, 86033, 21202, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent contradiction to the one third rule.  Sky and lake equally beautiful.  I love the back lit leaves at center top and the colors are awesome.  The fill lighting really helps as well.  Good luck on this.</td>', 'This is an excellent contradiction to the one third rule.  Sky and lake equally beautiful.  I love the back lit leaves at center top and the colors are awesome.  The fill lighting really helps as well.  Good luck on this.', '2004-07-02 20:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(792895, 85357, 21202, '<td valign="top">Beautil night scene, nice still reflective water.  I might have been tempted to clone out building on hill.</td>', 'Beautil night scene, nice still reflective water.  I might have been tempted to clone out building on hill.', '2004-07-02 20:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(792896, 84994, 17134, '<td valign="top">hot ''n steamy..</td>', 'hot ''n steamy..', '2004-07-02 20:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(792899, 86162, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field for action shot.  I might have made the lake or river edge horizontal which might make the tilt of the skier even more pronounced.</td>', 'Great depth of field for action shot.  I might have made the lake or river edge horizontal which might make the tilt of the skier even more pronounced.', '2004-07-02 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792902, 87064, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.  The back lighting helps distinguish the depth of the layers of petals, however, a little more reflected light into the flower itself would have been nice.  A 9, and I hope this does very well.</td>', 'Very nice idea.  The back lighting helps distinguish the depth of the layers of petals, however, a little more reflected light into the flower itself would have been nice.  A 9, and I hope this does very well.', '2004-07-02 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(792906, 86476, 21202, '<td valign="top">I love the patterns on the skin and on the shadowed part of the apple as well.  The surface on which the apple is seated detract somewhat as does glare.  I am not too keen on the composition, but it is okay.  A 7.</td>', 'I love the patterns on the skin and on the shadowed part of the apple as well.  The surface on which the apple is seated detract somewhat as does glare.  I am not too keen on the composition, but it is okay.  A 7.', '2004-07-02 20:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(792909, 84587, 21202, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if there were a longer exposure and greater depth of field.  It is certainly a beautiful scene with nice lighting and nice perspectives at play.</td>', 'I would like this better if there were a longer exposure and greater depth of field.  It is certainly a beautiful scene with nice lighting and nice perspectives at play.', '2004-07-02 20:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(792912, 86855, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice froggy.  Excellent job focusing on eye.  Unfortunate that he is in shadow.  I would also like less background and more foreground.  A 7.</td>', 'Nice froggy.  Excellent job focusing on eye.  Unfortunate that he is in shadow.  I would also like less background and more foreground.  A 7.', '2004-07-02 20:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(792918, 87078, 21202, '<td valign="top">That seems to be the source of many of the difficulties here.  The lighting is different on the two geysers so what is good for one is not for the other.  Also, much of the spray from the upper geyser is out of the frame.  Nothing seems to be really in focus nor very sharp.  A 4.</td>', 'That seems to be the source of many of the difficulties here.  The lighting is different on the two geysers so what is good for one is not for the other.  Also, much of the spray from the upper geyser is out of the frame.  Nothing seems to be really in focus nor very sharp.  A 4.', '2004-07-02 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(792922, 86997, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Perhaps a tad soft, though.</td>', 'Very cute.  Perhaps a tad soft, though.', '2004-07-02 20:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792923, 86409, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2004-07-02 20:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(792925, 85166, 21202, '<td valign="top">Well focused, good depth of field.  I would have cropped left hand side where rock touches bottom.  I understand that UF lens will help reduce glare on noonday shots. A 5.</td>', 'Well focused, good depth of field.  I would have cropped left hand side where rock touches bottom.  I understand that UF lens will help reduce glare on noonday shots. A 5.', '2004-07-02 20:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(792928, 81179, 10867, '<td valign="top">What a grumpy looking little bird!  This is a very nice capture, but it looks a little bit soft to me.</td>', 'What a grumpy looking little bird!  This is a very nice capture, but it looks a little bit soft to me.', '2004-07-02 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(792933, 86059, 10867, '<td valign="top">GWonderful sharpness and lighting on the daisy and water drops.  The background greens are perhaps just a bit too sharply defined.</td>', 'GWonderful sharpness and lighting on the daisy and water drops.  The background greens are perhaps just a bit too sharply defined.', '2004-07-02 21:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(792935, 87079, 21202, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of water and boy''s expression is perfect.  I am not sure why you did not align fence with horizontal and vertical axes.  A 9.</td>', 'Nice capture of water and boy''s expression is perfect.  I am not sure why you did not align fence with horizontal and vertical axes.  A 9.', '2004-07-02 21:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(792938, 87103, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice mood,10</td>', 'Nice mood,10', '2004-07-02 21:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(792939, 85752, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors on water and well placed silhouette.  An 8.</td>', 'Very nice colors on water and well placed silhouette.  An 8.', '2004-07-02 21:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(792943, 84740, 21202, '<td valign="top">This shot really grabbed me.  The light.  The retaining walls detract somewhat.  Good job.  I hope this does well.  A 9.</td>', 'This shot really grabbed me.  The light.  The retaining walls detract somewhat.  Good job.  I hope this does well.  A 9.', '2004-07-02 21:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(792951, 86447, 21202, '<td valign="top">I love the sky, but find the rest of the picture far less appealing.  A 5.</td>', 'I love the sky, but find the rest of the picture far less appealing.  A 5.', '2004-07-02 21:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(792952, 87101, 21202, '<td valign="top">The building actually detracts from a beautiful shot of grass and trees.  A 7.</td>', 'The building actually detracts from a beautiful shot of grass and trees.  A 7.', '2004-07-02 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(792955, 86755, 21202, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better shot from other side with light on tree.  Nice job capturing candle lights.</td>', 'I think this would have been better shot from other side with light on tree.  Nice job capturing candle lights.', '2004-07-02 21:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(792956, 87007, 21202, '<td valign="top">This really cries out for a fill flash.  A 4.</td>', 'This really cries out for a fill flash.  A 4.', '2004-07-02 21:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(792961, 85712, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very interesting motion study.  A 7.</td>', 'Very interesting motion study.  A 7.', '2004-07-02 21:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(792963, 86939, 21202, '<td valign="top">Very well done.</td>', 'Very well done.', '2004-07-02 21:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(792968, 86338, 21202, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous foreground, awesome background, beautifu colors.  I hope this does very well.  A 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous foreground, awesome background, beautifu colors.  I hope this does very well.  A 10.', '2004-07-02 21:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
