(792973, 87012, 13602, '<td valign="top">hehe :) I like it verry expressive in a natural way. Selective desat works verry well here.</td>', 'hehe :) I like it verry expressive in a natural way. Selective desat works verry well here.', '2004-07-02 21:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
