(792986, 80970, 22967, '<td valign="top">Wow, did you take this outside? I would be so scared to go out with a tripod and stuff.</td>', 'Wow, did you take this outside? I would be so scared to go out with a tripod and stuff.', '2004-07-02 21:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(792989, 83041, 22967, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but I think I''d rather see the original.<br/></td>', 'Interesting, but I think I''d rather see the original.', '2004-07-02 21:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
