(793016, 86000, 4767, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Makes me want to head to Tucson just to revisit San Xavier del Bac.  Terrific job - lighting is exquisite, contract makes it a powerful image. 10</td>', 'WOW!  Makes me want to head to Tucson just to revisit San Xavier del Bac.  Terrific job - lighting is exquisite, contract makes it a powerful image. 10', '2004-07-02 22:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
