(793556, 86423, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice scene with nice soft colors. I would have tried to get closer, the water in front does not add to the image in my opinion. A foreground consisting of the beach with the wood would have been nice. The image is slightly tilted.</td>', 'Nice scene with nice soft colors. I would have tried to get closer, the water in front does not add to the image in my opinion. A foreground consisting of the beach with the wood would have been nice. The image is slightly tilted.', '2004-07-03 05:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(793557, 82805, 17233, '<td valign="top">This image appears to lack contrast and the DOF is probably a bit too shallow. The composition is a little tight and centred diagonally. Great idea though - the light really plays on those drops well.</td>', 'This image appears to lack contrast and the DOF is probably a bit too shallow. The composition is a little tight and centred diagonally. Great idea though - the light really plays on those drops well.', '2004-07-03 05:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(793558, 86052, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice close-up. A pity about the dark eyes, especially the one on the left.</td>', 'Very nice close-up. A pity about the dark eyes, especially the one on the left.', '2004-07-03 05:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(793559, 86807, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus and soft colors. Composition not very appealing.</td>', 'Nice soft focus and soft colors. Composition not very appealing.', '2004-07-03 05:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(793560, 83826, 4008, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait, good expression, good toning. The border gradient is a bit too strong for my taste.</td>', 'very nice portrait, good expression, good toning. The border gradient is a bit too strong for my taste.', '2004-07-03 05:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(793561, 87093, 17233, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lovely spot. Your exposure seems quite good too. The only thing that I would suggest is to play with some different perspectives to get some interest in the subject - the bridge just seems a little flat and acts as a separation between the water and the trees instead of complimenting the image. The bridge would make an ideal lead in if viewed from a more acute angle.</td>', 'Looks like a lovely spot. Your exposure seems quite good too. The only thing that I would suggest is to play with some different perspectives to get some interest in the subject - the bridge just seems a little flat and acts as a separation between the water and the trees instead of complimenting the image. The bridge would make an ideal lead in if viewed from a more acute angle.', '2004-07-03 05:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(793562, 84527, 4008, '<td valign="top">This really expresses comfort, trust, cosiness to me. Good job. Nice soft light, good focus.</td>', 'This really expresses comfort, trust, cosiness to me. Good job. Nice soft light, good focus.', '2004-07-03 05:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(793564, 84695, 4008, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse is well hidden in this image. I don''t like the dark B&amp;W.</td>', 'The lighthouse is well hidden in this image. I don''t like the dark B&W.', '2004-07-03 05:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(793565, 86543, 4008, '<td valign="top">great catch, good choice of shutterspeed, still maintaining slight movement, good angle of view. Crop is extremly tight, could use a bit more space.</td>', 'great catch, good choice of shutterspeed, still maintaining slight movement, good angle of view. Crop is extremly tight, could use a bit more space.', '2004-07-03 05:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(793566, 87108, 17233, '<td valign="top">This image appears to lack contrast and is a little washed out. Try adjusting your levels or curves to maybe boost the midtones and darken the shadows a little. Maybe also increase saturation a tad if the levels or curves didn''t already do that. Also check your monitor calibration - if that''s out too far you''re in a spot of bother.</td>', 'This image appears to lack contrast and is a little washed out. Try adjusting your levels or curves to maybe boost the midtones and darken the shadows a little. Maybe also increase saturation a tad if the levels or curves didn''t already do that. Also check your monitor calibration - if that''s out too far you''re in a spot of bother.', '2004-07-03 05:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(793570, 81045, 10263, '<td valign="top">I love how you put him on the white background. Simply beautiful.</td>', 'I love how you put him on the white background. Simply beautiful.', '2004-07-03 06:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(793572, 84994, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice curves with great soft light flowing across them. The hands seem a bit harsh, reducing the softness of the whole image. The shirt (?) covering her right breast  is distracting in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice curves with great soft light flowing across them. The hands seem a bit harsh, reducing the softness of the whole image. The shirt (?) covering her right breast  is distracting in my opinion.', '2004-07-03 06:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(793573, 86552, 17233, '<td valign="top">The people in the background are quite distracting and I find my eye wondering towards them. Maybe try to get in a bit closer to the subject and improve the angle so you can cut the distractions out and include more of the other cars. A shallower DOF would also work to separate the subject from the rest of the image.</td>', 'The people in the background are quite distracting and I find my eye wondering towards them. Maybe try to get in a bit closer to the subject and improve the angle so you can cut the distractions out and include more of the other cars. A shallower DOF would also work to separate the subject from the rest of the image.', '2004-07-03 06:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(793574, 86474, 4008, '<td valign="top">great view, great colors. Could have cropped some more of the right part in my opinion.</td>', 'great view, great colors. Could have cropped some more of the right part in my opinion.', '2004-07-03 06:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(793576, 85502, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot. Great use of depth here. Soft colors. Really concentrates the eye on the flower. makes me wonder how you achieved this, since the background looks like movement blur whereas the flower is pinsharp. Very good image.</td>', 'I like it a lot. Great use of depth here. Soft colors. Really concentrates the eye on the flower. makes me wonder how you achieved this, since the background looks like movement blur whereas the flower is pinsharp. Very good image.', '2004-07-03 06:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(793577, 83350, 10263, '<td valign="top">Hes absolutely adorable. I love the tones and his expression.</td>', 'Hes absolutely adorable. I love the tones and his expression.', '2004-07-03 06:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(793578, 87077, 17233, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and exposure. The composition however is too dead centre for this type of image. Just try cropping some off the left side as there isn''t anything of value on that side anyway.</td>', 'Good DOF and exposure. The composition however is too dead centre for this type of image. Just try cropping some off the left side as there isn''t anything of value on that side anyway.', '2004-07-03 06:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793579, 83465, 4008, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition and focus, great to also have the ball included. Great action shot.</td>', 'Perfect composition and focus, great to also have the ball included. Great action shot.', '2004-07-03 06:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(793581, 83350, 4008, '<td valign="top">Great expression, nice soft light and good focus. I would crop away part of the right of the image and soften the toning.</td>', 'Great expression, nice soft light and good focus. I would crop away part of the right of the image and soften the toning.', '2004-07-03 06:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(793584, 85928, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you are trying to express here. The face looks very emotionless, but the hand suggest otherwise.</td>', 'I am not sure what you are trying to express here. The face looks very emotionless, but the hand suggest otherwise.', '2004-07-03 06:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(793585, 87084, 17233, '<td valign="top">The only real problem I have with this image is that the brides head lacks form as a silhouette behind the veil. Maybe that''s the desired effect, but I can''t help but wonder what this image would look like if you could see a silhouette of the brides face.</td>', 'The only real problem I have with this image is that the brides head lacks form as a silhouette behind the veil. Maybe that''s the desired effect, but I can''t help but wonder what this image would look like if you could see a silhouette of the brides face.', '2004-07-03 06:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(793586, 83041, 10263, '<td valign="top">The composition is wonderful on this. I love the lines and the colors.</td>', 'The composition is wonderful on this. I love the lines and the colors.', '2004-07-03 06:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(793590, 83508, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is a wow. I love how you stopped the action with the horses feet and the ball all in the air. Very good capture.</td>', 'This is a wow. I love how you stopped the action with the horses feet and the ball all in the air. Very good capture.', '2004-07-03 06:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(793592, 86538, 10263, '<td valign="top">The half eye doesn''t work for me but you''re right about him/her being a cute kid :) I would rather see both of those beautiful eyes.</td>', 'The half eye doesn''t work for me but you''re right about him/her being a cute kid :) I would rather see both of those beautiful eyes.', '2004-07-03 06:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(793593, 87094, 17233, '<td valign="top">The two things that detract from this image are the rifle entering from stage left without an owner and the rifle that seems to slapping the girl in the face. Perhaps the young defender on the left could be aiming the rifle in a classic pose (butt to shoulder) and you could safely lose the rifle entering from the left.</td>', 'The two things that detract from this image are the rifle entering from stage left without an owner and the rifle that seems to slapping the girl in the face. Perhaps the young defender on the left could be aiming the rifle in a classic pose (butt to shoulder) and you could safely lose the rifle entering from the left.', '2004-07-03 06:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(793596, 86964, 17233, '<td valign="top">Colour, exposure, composition and feel, all 10/10. Great image</td>', 'Colour, exposure, composition and feel, all 10/10. Great image', '2004-07-03 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(793599, 83036, 17233, '<td valign="top">This is simply one the best sunset images that I have ever seen. Composition and exposure are perfect. What more can I say except 10/10. Awesome work.</td>', 'This is simply one the best sunset images that I have ever seen. Composition and exposure are perfect. What more can I say except 10/10. Awesome work.', '2004-07-03 06:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793600, 86866, 10263, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. Colors are awesome.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. Colors are awesome.', '2004-07-03 06:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(793601, 84994, 17233, '<td valign="top">Beautifully exposed and composed. Provocative image that shows excellent form through great use of available light. The only picky thing that I would dare suggest is that the small area of clothing (?) over the right breast is distracting. If, by removing it, the pic was too revealing then maybe just a slight crop would rectify it. Still an awesome image - well done (10)</td>', 'Beautifully exposed and composed. Provocative image that shows excellent form through great use of available light. The only picky thing that I would dare suggest is that the small area of clothing (?) over the right breast is distracting. If, by removing it, the pic was too revealing then maybe just a slight crop would rectify it. Still an awesome image - well done (10)', '2004-07-03 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(793603, 83675, 17233, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Great exposure and composition and the lens flare from the sun is very appropriate for this image. Well done (9)</td>', 'Beautiful image. Great exposure and composition and the lens flare from the sun is very appropriate for this image. Well done (9)', '2004-07-03 06:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(793604, 86409, 17233, '<td valign="top">What a beatiful image. Excellent use of light and a very thoughtful, peaceful pose. I matbe would have cropped a little from the left - but that''s just me being picky. Very well done (9)</td>', 'What a beatiful image. Excellent use of light and a very thoughtful, peaceful pose. I matbe would have cropped a little from the left - but that''s just me being picky. Very well done (9)', '2004-07-03 06:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(793605, 86600, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very good capture, nice and sharp. I think a bit more space on the right for the bird to "fly into" would better the composition slightly.</td>', 'Very good capture, nice and sharp. I think a bit more space on the right for the bird to "fly into" would better the composition slightly.', '2004-07-03 06:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(793606, 81179, 2780, '<td valign="top">Hehe cute photo. Good contrast and DoF.</td>', 'Hehe cute photo. Good contrast and DoF.', '2004-07-03 06:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(793607, 85176, 2780, '<td valign="top">The hand is a bit out of focus but other than great shot. The tones and contrast is really good.</td>', 'The hand is a bit out of focus but other than great shot. The tones and contrast is really good.', '2004-07-03 06:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(793608, 86637, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic colours, nice shot.</td>', 'Very dramatic colours, nice shot.', '2004-07-03 06:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793610, 86054, 17233, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image. The stem winding through the image gives the eye something to follow and the leaf is so strong that it keeps the eye from running off image. The highlight at the top on the stem provides the perfect lead in too. Well done (9)</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image. The stem winding through the image gives the eye something to follow and the leaf is so strong that it keeps the eye from running off image. The highlight at the top on the stem provides the perfect lead in too. Well done (9)', '2004-07-03 06:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(793611, 80856, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really keen on the border, I think it''s too dark, and I think you added a bit too much soft focus.</td>', 'I''m not really keen on the border, I think it''s too dark, and I think you added a bit too much soft focus.', '2004-07-03 06:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(793612, 86836, 2780, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of jagged lines here, probably caused by resizing and sharpening too much. Try using a different resample method such as bicubic. ALso adding some contrast would give the image more "pop"</td>', 'There are a lot of jagged lines here, probably caused by resizing and sharpening too much. Try using a different resample method such as bicubic. ALso adding some contrast would give the image more "pop"', '2004-07-03 06:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(793613, 86769, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.</td>', 'Very good shot.', '2004-07-03 06:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793614, 87015, 2780, '<td valign="top">Its a shame the bottom of the wings arent in focus. A higher f-stop number would have helped get them in focus.</td>', 'Its a shame the bottom of the wings arent in focus. A higher f-stop number would have helped get them in focus.', '2004-07-03 06:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(793615, 86323, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great colours and contrast.</td>', 'Great colours and contrast.', '2004-07-03 06:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793616, 85220, 2780, '<td valign="top">SLightly soft, applying USM would sharpen it up nicely :) I like the colour of the sky contrasting with the red. Very nice :)</td>', 'SLightly soft, applying USM would sharpen it up nicely :) I like the colour of the sky contrasting with the red. Very nice :)', '2004-07-03 06:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(793617, 86052, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great shot. It''s a bit soft but I like it that way. 9</td>', 'Great shot. It''s a bit soft but I like it that way. 9', '2004-07-03 06:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(793618, 84124, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great DoF. I think cropping in a bit closer would look a bit better but still this is a very nice shot.</td>', 'Great DoF. I think cropping in a bit closer would look a bit better but still this is a very nice shot.', '2004-07-03 06:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(793619, 86338, 2780, '<td valign="top">It''s like something from Lord of the Rings. Great transition from green to blue to red. 10</td>', 'It''s like something from Lord of the Rings. Great transition from green to blue to red. 10', '2004-07-03 06:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(793620, 86027, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours seem a bit flat to me. Dodging and Burning would help I think.</td>', 'The colours seem a bit flat to me. Dodging and Burning would help I think.', '2004-07-03 06:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(793621, 86474, 10263, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh this is my absolute favorite so far. I love cows and this photo captures their personalities wonderfully. This will be on my desktop for awhile :)</td>', 'Ohhhh this is my absolute favorite so far. I love cows and this photo captures their personalities wonderfully. This will be on my desktop for awhile :)', '2004-07-03 06:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(793622, 86091, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I don''t really understand what I''m seeing, they look like floating statues? ANyway, cool shot :) 7</td>', 'Interesting shot, I don''t really understand what I''m seeing, they look like floating statues? ANyway, cool shot :) 7', '2004-07-03 06:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793623, 82927, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colour balance looks odd here, too edited for my tastes. 2</td>', 'The colour balance looks odd here, too edited for my tastes. 2', '2004-07-03 06:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(793624, 86953, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great black and white shot. Really nice contrast and a great scene. 9</td>', 'Great black and white shot. Really nice contrast and a great scene. 9', '2004-07-03 06:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(793625, 86908, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think dodging the faces in the background to make them more visable would add to the impact of this shot.</td>', 'I think dodging the faces in the background to make them more visable would add to the impact of this shot.', '2004-07-03 06:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(793626, 86956, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think adjusting the contrast would help this image from looking so flat.</td>', 'I think adjusting the contrast would help this image from looking so flat.', '2004-07-03 06:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(793627, 86457, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot. Everything about it is great. Could be a winner! 10</td>', 'This is an amazing shot. Everything about it is great. Could be a winner! 10', '2004-07-03 06:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(793628, 86522, 2780, '<td valign="top">Bumping the contrast up a bit to get some blacks instead of greys would vastly improve this shot.</td>', 'Bumping the contrast up a bit to get some blacks instead of greys would vastly improve this shot.', '2004-07-03 06:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(793629, 86038, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think the rock is too close to the bottom of the frame. I feel it needs more space surrounded with sea at the bottom, but thats just a personal preference.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I think the rock is too close to the bottom of the frame. I feel it needs more space surrounded with sea at the bottom, but thats just a personal preference.', '2004-07-03 06:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(793630, 87103, 10263, '<td valign="top">This is precious beyond words.  It literally brings tears to my eyes.  Excellent job of capturing emotion. This is what photography is about to me.</td>', 'This is precious beyond words.  It literally brings tears to my eyes.  Excellent job of capturing emotion. This is what photography is about to me.', '2004-07-03 07:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(793631, 86180, 6172, '<td valign="top">Lot''s of nice color in this shot!</td>', 'Lot''s of nice color in this shot!', '2004-07-03 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(793632, 85903, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing, and the row of trees has quite an effect - like you''re entering a magic kingdom or something.</td>', 'Very intriguing, and the row of trees has quite an effect - like you''re entering a magic kingdom or something.', '2004-07-03 07:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793652, 86439, 14603, '<td valign="top">Superbly impressive cloud structure..reminds me of something you would expect to see in the "Biblical epic" films. All that`s missing is Charlton Heston dividing the waters of the Red Sea.<br/>Perhaps a horizon line with a lone tree would increase the impact even more (if that`s possible).<br/>Great capture.</td>', 'Superbly impressive cloud structure..reminds me of something you would expect to see in the "Biblical epic" films. All that`s missing is Charlton Heston dividing the waters of the Red Sea.Perhaps a horizon line with a lone tree would increase the impact even more (if that`s possible).Great capture.', '2004-07-03 08:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(793655, 81761, 14603, '<td valign="top">A nice "culture" study which really suits the b/w format.<br/>If the guy at the skateboarders right knee was out of shot it would have helped to define the action even better as his leg seems to blend with the dark shirt.<br/>Great action though and the lighting is first class..well done</td>', 'A nice "culture" study which really suits the b/w format.If the guy at the skateboarders right knee was out of shot it would have helped to define the action even better as his leg seems to blend with the dark shirt.Great action though and the lighting is first class..well done', '2004-07-03 08:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(793657, 86600, 14603, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured shot..I am very envious, as I have been trying to get close enough to a heron to get something like this..but so far I`ve been unsuccessful.<br/>Well done.</td>', 'Beautifully captured shot..I am very envious, as I have been trying to get close enough to a heron to get something like this..but so far I`ve been unsuccessful.Well done.', '2004-07-03 08:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(793658, 87012, 14603, '<td valign="top">I think this would probably have finished highly in the partial desat challenge..would certainly have got a 10 from me.<br/>Great expression and very good use of the technique.</td>', 'I think this would probably have finished highly in the partial desat challenge..would certainly have got a 10 from me.Great expression and very good use of the technique.', '2004-07-03 08:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793685, 86970, 200, '<td valign="top">The reflection is awesome. Too bad the other parts of the image are blown out. I bet you could work with it and even out the darks and lights. Good luck.</td>', 'The reflection is awesome. Too bad the other parts of the image are blown out. I bet you could work with it and even out the darks and lights. Good luck.', '2004-07-03 09:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793712, 83675, 11800, '<td valign="top">What a nice feeling this has. There are quiet a few things that are appealing. The solitude of the people, the color treatment,  the composition. All good. I think the picture might have looked better with the sun down a little more. Also there is a haze or halo around the people that could have been removed in post processing. It''s really amazing how well this is exposed considering how the sun is almost in the center.</td>', 'What a nice feeling this has. There are quiet a few things that are appealing. The solitude of the people, the color treatment,  the composition. All good. I think the picture might have looked better with the sun down a little more. Also there is a haze or halo around the people that could have been removed in post processing. It''s really amazing how well this is exposed considering how the sun is almost in the center.', '2004-07-03 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(793723, 87014, 11800, '<td valign="top">That is one shiny car. The colors are attractive. I don''t know, but this looks like something happened in post processing or maybe camera shake during the exposure but the double outline causes my eyes to hurt. Sometimes neat image helps and sometimes it doesn''t. I think in this case it doesn''t.</td>', 'That is one shiny car. The colors are attractive. I don''t know, but this looks like something happened in post processing or maybe camera shake during the exposure but the double outline causes my eyes to hurt. Sometimes neat image helps and sometimes it doesn''t. I think in this case it doesn''t.', '2004-07-03 10:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793727, 84771, 12857, '<td valign="top">The color is Perfection.  It makes the entiere shot work.  I just cant stop looking at it.  I wish i could add something constructive but what can one say about such a perfect shot. <br/>dc</td>', 'The color is Perfection.  It makes the entiere shot work.  I just cant stop looking at it.  I wish i could add something constructive but what can one say about such a perfect shot. dc', '2004-07-03 10:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(793729, 86054, 12857, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.  One of my favorite of the bunch.   You nailed the lighting.  If you get a chance please drop me a line and let me know how you crated this shot.  <br/>Bravo. <br/>dc</td>', 'Simply stunning.  One of my favorite of the bunch.   You nailed the lighting.  If you get a chance please drop me a line and let me know how you crated this shot.  Bravo. dc', '2004-07-03 10:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(793735, 86800, 4411, '<td valign="top">&lt;sound of jaw hitting floor&gt;<br/>Ouch.<br/> <br/>My god, those clouds! Awesome.<br/>Looking forward to some background info on this one : )</td>', '<sound of jaw hitting floor>Ouch. My god, those clouds! Awesome.Looking forward to some background info on this one : )', '2004-07-03 10:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(793737, 87084, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the noise and there is a flowing symmetry to the picture. My personal feeling about this is it would be better to at least see some detail in the bride''s face. It looks like maybe she is turned away from the camera, hard to tell.</td>', 'I like the noise and there is a flowing symmetry to the picture. My personal feeling about this is it would be better to at least see some detail in the bride''s face. It looks like maybe she is turned away from the camera, hard to tell.', '2004-07-03 10:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793748, 84994, 18023, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous! *jealous*</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous! *jealous*', '2004-07-03 11:23:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(793763, 83204, 4008, '<td valign="top">This one works really well in B&amp;W. The dark foreground concentrates the eye on the dock, but still has these sparkles to break the monotony. great composition, great tones.</td>', 'This one works really well in B&W. The dark foreground concentrates the eye on the dock, but still has these sparkles to break the monotony. great composition, great tones.', '2004-07-03 11:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(793766, 86766, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice golden glow, but I don''t particularly like the composition.</td>', 'Very nice golden glow, but I don''t particularly like the composition.', '2004-07-03 12:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(793768, 86033, 4008, '<td valign="top">very nice scene, good framing by the leaves, but what a strange colors. And you should have removed the spot top right.</td>', 'very nice scene, good framing by the leaves, but what a strange colors. And you should have removed the spot top right.', '2004-07-03 12:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(793774, 84115, 4008, '<td valign="top">wow, the detail in this image is amazing. And great soft natural colors. A brighter eye would be even more appealing. The background desaturation works very well here, looks very natural.</td>', 'wow, the detail in this image is amazing. And great soft natural colors. A brighter eye would be even more appealing. The background desaturation works very well here, looks very natural.', '2004-07-03 12:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(793775, 86476, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out the fabric underneath the apple (or better, make it very dark so no detail is visible).</td>', 'I would have cropped out the fabric underneath the apple (or better, make it very dark so no detail is visible).', '2004-07-03 12:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(793776, 86441, 4008, '<td valign="top">cute, good expression with the look away from the camera. technically perfect.</td>', 'cute, good expression with the look away from the camera. technically perfect.', '2004-07-03 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793777, 86568, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would like to see some more detail and color in the rocks, but realise you have to manage some extremes in exposure here.</td>', 'I would like to see some more detail and color in the rocks, but realise you have to manage some extremes in exposure here.', '2004-07-03 12:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(793778, 87138, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp, well isolated from the background.</td>', 'Nice and sharp, well isolated from the background.', '2004-07-03 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(793779, 84740, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, although the sky looks a bit dark. Great composition and point of view.</td>', 'Beautiful, although the sky looks a bit dark. Great composition and point of view.', '2004-07-03 12:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(793780, 86853, 4008, '<td valign="top">no need to see the whole flower in my opinion, could have gone closer. But great colors and sharpness.</td>', 'no need to see the whole flower in my opinion, could have gone closer. But great colors and sharpness.', '2004-07-03 12:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(793782, 87104, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice lady, nice soft colors. Looks a bit artifical, so soft (neatimage ?), the white patch on her dress leads the eye away from here face.</td>', 'Nice lady, nice soft colors. Looks a bit artifical, so soft (neatimage ?), the white patch on her dress leads the eye away from here face.', '2004-07-03 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(793783, 85346, 4008, '<td valign="top">nice minimalistic landscape.</td>', 'nice minimalistic landscape.', '2004-07-03 12:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793784, 86466, 4008, '<td valign="top">simply great image. The light concentrates perfectly on her face.</td>', 'simply great image. The light concentrates perfectly on her face.', '2004-07-03 12:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(793786, 86357, 4008, '<td valign="top">a bit messy in composition with one flower hidden behnd the other.</td>', 'a bit messy in composition with one flower hidden behnd the other.', '2004-07-03 12:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(793787, 87077, 4008, '<td valign="top">unappealing composition, straight from above, bang in the middle.</td>', 'unappealing composition, straight from above, bang in the middle.', '2004-07-03 12:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(793794, 84811, 4008, '<td valign="top">very nice colors, good to have the red buds forming a nice pattern around it.</td>', 'very nice colors, good to have the red buds forming a nice pattern around it.', '2004-07-03 12:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(793796, 84188, 17134, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit too much editing (blurring) here, but it''s a great composition and nice colours</td>', 'Looks a bit too much editing (blurring) here, but it''s a great composition and nice colours', '2004-07-03 12:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(793799, 84347, 4008, '<td valign="top">great capture and focus is exactly where it needs to be.</td>', 'great capture and focus is exactly where it needs to be.', '2004-07-03 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(793803, 86054, 4008, '<td valign="top">beautiful crisp detail</td>', 'beautiful crisp detail', '2004-07-03 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(793807, 86597, 4008, '<td valign="top">why desaturate the sky ? A threathening blue sky would have worked much better in my opinion. Great colors and detail in the land.</td>', 'why desaturate the sky ? A threathening blue sky would have worked much better in my opinion. Great colors and detail in the land.', '2004-07-03 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(793809, 86543, 10414, '<td valign="top">Awesome action shot!! I love the expression on his face!!!  10</td>', 'Awesome action shot!! I love the expression on his face!!!  10', '2004-07-03 12:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(793812, 87014, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see lots of halo''s around the every object in the image which spoils it for me. Otherwise it''s a great sharp car with great color, shown in the setting of an event.</td>', 'I see lots of halo''s around the every object in the image which spoils it for me. Otherwise it''s a great sharp car with great color, shown in the setting of an event.', '2004-07-03 12:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793816, 83121, 4008, '<td valign="top">refreshingly different approach of a dragonfly image. Gone a bit overboard with the blur.</td>', 'refreshingly different approach of a dragonfly image. Gone a bit overboard with the blur.', '2004-07-03 12:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(793819, 86836, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly like the composition. I would have liked to see a bit more of the straw in front.</td>', 'I don''t particularly like the composition. I would have liked to see a bit more of the straw in front.', '2004-07-03 12:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(793821, 83041, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t like strong manipulation, but this one results in a nice graphic image. Good choice.</td>', 'I don''t like strong manipulation, but this one results in a nice graphic image. Good choice.', '2004-07-03 12:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(793822, 84347, 10414, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh....what a hauntingly beautiful picture!! Wonderful job!!! 10</td>', 'Ohhhh....what a hauntingly beautiful picture!! Wonderful job!!! 10', '2004-07-03 12:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(793823, 84365, 4008, '<td valign="top">great detail and colors. Stunning. And catchlight n the eye.</td>', 'great detail and colors. Stunning. And catchlight n the eye.', '2004-07-03 12:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(793825, 87143, 4008, '<td valign="top">so funny and adorable. Bad hair day.</td>', 'so funny and adorable. Bad hair day.', '2004-07-03 12:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(793827, 81045, 4008, '<td valign="top">great detail, good capture with the legs showing movement, would have been a very static image otherwise.</td>', 'great detail, good capture with the legs showing movement, would have been a very static image otherwise.', '2004-07-03 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(793834, 86997, 10414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!  10</td>', 'Beautiful!!!  10', '2004-07-03 12:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(793835, 87102, 4008, '<td valign="top">great cat picture. Some fill in flash to lighten up the face/eyes would have made it even better.</td>', 'great cat picture. Some fill in flash to lighten up the face/eyes would have made it even better.', '2004-07-03 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793837, 87084, 4008, '<td valign="top">what a messy picture, very unappealing, sorry.</td>', 'what a messy picture, very unappealing, sorry.', '2004-07-03 13:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(793846, 86800, 15832, '<td valign="top">If thats not heida''s work, it must be someone inspierd by her..<br/>magic atmosphere, creativ, great photo.<br/>10...</td>', 'If thats not heida''s work, it must be someone inspierd by her..magic atmosphere, creativ, great photo.10...', '2004-07-03 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(793853, 85152, 4008, '<td valign="top">beautiful image spoiled by the strange blue coloring in her hair and the strange eye, a pity.</td>', 'beautiful image spoiled by the strange blue coloring in her hair and the strange eye, a pity.', '2004-07-03 13:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(793857, 85939, 4008, '<td valign="top">messy composition, suggest to get closer to the middle of the palm leave and avoid the clutter around it.</td>', 'messy composition, suggest to get closer to the middle of the palm leave and avoid the clutter around it.', '2004-07-03 13:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(793863, 85560, 15768, '<td valign="top">great title!</td>', 'great title!', '2004-07-03 13:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(793882, 86970, 11800, '<td valign="top">To me the reflection is telling the story and I find that a rather unique take on the usual "kid at aquarium" shot. Since the actual people are blurry and overexposed, I might have been tempted to crop them out. That would have brought up the perceived quality of the shot and made a definitive statement as to the intentions of the photographer. I might have tried taking it at a different angle to use the waterline as a natural frame for the picture.</td>', 'To me the reflection is telling the story and I find that a rather unique take on the usual "kid at aquarium" shot. Since the actual people are blurry and overexposed, I might have been tempted to crop them out. That would have brought up the perceived quality of the shot and made a definitive statement as to the intentions of the photographer. I might have tried taking it at a different angle to use the waterline as a natural frame for the picture.', '2004-07-03 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(793892, 86410, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really well taken. The red and purple add pizzaz to the composition.  <br/>I feel the white lampshade throws it off a bit. Without it there is a nice digression from white in the upper left to black in the lower right.  Maybe something with a medium color would have been better in that spot or nothing at all.  I do hope you can set it up again, as I think it really has a cozy feeling to it and like it a lot.</td>', 'Really well taken. The red and purple add pizzaz to the composition.  I feel the white lampshade throws it off a bit. Without it there is a nice digression from white in the upper left to black in the lower right.  Maybe something with a medium color would have been better in that spot or nothing at all.  I do hope you can set it up again, as I think it really has a cozy feeling to it and like it a lot.', '2004-07-03 14:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
