(794276, 84307, 12857, '<td valign="top">This shot is one of my favorite of the bunch.   It is sexy, raw, dramatic....  It leaves me with so many questions.  Just what a photo should do!!  You nailed the angle.  Att first I was not sure I liked the  people walking up to the fall in the shot but the more I look at it the more I think they are important to the mood.  Good job<br/> <br/>Went back to revisit this photo again.  Just had to raise the score again.  It just speaks to me.  <br/>dc<br/>dc</td>', 'This shot is one of my favorite of the bunch.   It is sexy, raw, dramatic....  It leaves me with so many questions.  Just what a photo should do!!  You nailed the angle.  Att first I was not sure I liked the  people walking up to the fall in the shot but the more I look at it the more I think they are important to the mood.  Good job Went back to revisit this photo again.  Just had to raise the score again.  It just speaks to me.  dcdc', '2004-07-03 20:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(794280, 85759, 14255, '<td valign="top">WOW !!!  Nicely captured.  Bees rear end slightly out of focus though.</td>', 'WOW !!!  Nicely captured.  Bees rear end slightly out of focus though.', '2004-07-03 20:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794281, 86942, 14255, '<td valign="top">Good Maro shot. You have got the DOF just right</td>', 'Good Maro shot. You have got the DOF just right', '2004-07-03 20:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794282, 81973, 12857, '<td valign="top">The color is great.  Just not as crisp as I would have liked wih this photo. <br/>dc</td>', 'The color is great.  Just not as crisp as I would have liked wih this photo. dc', '2004-07-03 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(794285, 86333, 14255, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured shot. I like the way you have the sails positioned.</td>', 'Nicely captured shot. I like the way you have the sails positioned.', '2004-07-03 20:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(794286, 86256, 12857, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this photo.  I love the reflection of the trees in the water.  The problem that I had with it was that there was just too much going on.  It was a bit destracting.  It might have worked better for me if you could have cut out a lot of the forground.</td>', 'I like the concept of this photo.  I love the reflection of the trees in the water.  The problem that I had with it was that there was just too much going on.  It was a bit destracting.  It might have worked better for me if you could have cut out a lot of the forground.', '2004-07-03 20:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794287, 86531, 14255, '<td valign="top">A really great shot. The little chap looks really deep in thought.</td>', 'A really great shot. The little chap looks really deep in thought.', '2004-07-03 20:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(794288, 86964, 12857, '<td valign="top">Nice color.  For me there is just too much going on.  It is a bit distracting. <br/>dc</td>', 'Nice color.  For me there is just too much going on.  It is a bit distracting. dc', '2004-07-03 20:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(794290, 86449, 14255, '<td valign="top">I love the vibrant colours you have used in thisshot.</td>', 'I love the vibrant colours you have used in thisshot.', '2004-07-03 20:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(794293, 84645, 14255, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle &amp; colouring. Nice shot.</td>', 'Unusual angle & colouring. Nice shot.', '2004-07-03 21:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(794296, 86607, 14255, '<td valign="top">Soft Focus on wings a bit overdone for my liking. But a nice shot all the same.</td>', 'Soft Focus on wings a bit overdone for my liking. But a nice shot all the same.', '2004-07-03 21:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794297, 83036, 14255, '<td valign="top">Just Brilliant from the detail of the Lilly Pads in the foreground to the beautiful whispy sky. (10)</td>', 'Just Brilliant from the detail of the Lilly Pads in the foreground to the beautiful whispy sky. (10)', '2004-07-03 21:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794306, 85572, 11793, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/></td>', ' ', '2004-07-03 21:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(794319, 86597, 20941, '<td valign="top">personally i like the desat and the composition it just looks  a bit oversharpened or oversaturated on the color to me.</td>', 'personally i like the desat and the composition it just looks  a bit oversharpened or oversaturated on the color to me.', '2004-07-03 21:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(794393, 86535, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great Capture.</td>', 'Great Capture.', '2004-07-03 23:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(794398, 85713, 6597, '<td valign="top">great shot great smile very cute I like cute  9</td>', 'great shot great smile very cute I like cute  9', '2004-07-03 23:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794442, 86404, 509, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I think this could be stronger: the line on the left does well to lead to the subject, but the line on the right does not add any strength to the image.  Different framing and maybe some darkening of the sky (for impact) might make this more powerful.</td>', 'Compositionally, I think this could be stronger: the line on the left does well to lead to the subject, but the line on the right does not add any strength to the image.  Different framing and maybe some darkening of the sky (for impact) might make this more powerful.', '2004-07-04 00:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(794443, 86397, 509, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overexposed to my eye.  A good catch nonetheless</td>', 'Looks a little overexposed to my eye.  A good catch nonetheless', '2004-07-04 00:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(794444, 82511, 509, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow.  The textures of this are great!  Can''t think of any negatives or suggestions for improvement.</td>', 'Great use of shadow.  The textures of this are great!  Can''t think of any negatives or suggestions for improvement.', '2004-07-04 00:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(794445, 85760, 509, '<td valign="top">I might have tried this at a different time or day, as the grey sky blends in a lot with the coloring on the building, causing it to look as though there isn''t a lot of contrast.  The focus is excellent, but I would have rotated the shot about 1 degrees counter-clockwise.</td>', 'I might have tried this at a different time or day, as the grey sky blends in a lot with the coloring on the building, causing it to look as though there isn''t a lot of contrast.  The focus is excellent, but I would have rotated the shot about 1 degrees counter-clockwise.', '2004-07-04 00:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(794447, 84486, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting duotone.  I like this image, but would prefer a stronger emphasis on the tree, as the background elements are not as important in the composition.  Not sure how this could be accomplished, maybe a wider aperture or some dodging/burning in post.</td>', 'Interesting duotone.  I like this image, but would prefer a stronger emphasis on the tree, as the background elements are not as important in the composition.  Not sure how this could be accomplished, maybe a wider aperture or some dodging/burning in post.', '2004-07-04 00:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794448, 83392, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great shot.  The cropping might be a little tight for me, but everything else about this shot is nearly perfect.</td>', 'Wow.  Great shot.  The cropping might be a little tight for me, but everything else about this shot is nearly perfect.', '2004-07-04 00:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(794450, 82927, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure what effect this is going for.  To me, the saturation increase is undesirable, and almost looks like chromatic abberations in the trees and background.  I think the house could be a usable subject, but would prefer to see a more natural approach to the image.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure what effect this is going for.  To me, the saturation increase is undesirable, and almost looks like chromatic abberations in the trees and background.  I think the house could be a usable subject, but would prefer to see a more natural approach to the image.', '2004-07-04 00:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794452, 86491, 509, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color.  The blue really stands out, but the colors of the ovals in the feathers are compositionally strong as well.  I like the combination of color and repetition.</td>', 'Excellent use of color.  The blue really stands out, but the colors of the ovals in the feathers are compositionally strong as well.  I like the combination of color and repetition.', '2004-07-04 00:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(794453, 85769, 509, '<td valign="top">To add interest, having a person crossing the bridge might work.  As it is, the image is nice, but lacking a strong subject to focus on.</td>', 'To add interest, having a person crossing the bridge might work.  As it is, the image is nice, but lacking a strong subject to focus on.', '2004-07-04 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(794456, 87024, 509, '<td valign="top">Looks as though you had a tree blocking the view, in which case (if this is a crop), I would like to see more background and foreground elements to give a view of the surrounding habitat.</td>', 'Looks as though you had a tree blocking the view, in which case (if this is a crop), I would like to see more background and foreground elements to give a view of the surrounding habitat.', '2004-07-04 00:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794459, 86755, 509, '<td valign="top">If the candles are the primary subject here, I would prefer a shot from a different angle.  The tree and leaves are distracting, making it hard to determine what your emphasis is on this shot.</td>', 'If the candles are the primary subject here, I would prefer a shot from a different angle.  The tree and leaves are distracting, making it hard to determine what your emphasis is on this shot.', '2004-07-04 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(794462, 86256, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the outward expanding reflections here, as it adds interest.  The only minor issue I have is the slight overexposure in the top left.  The reflection doesn''t have this problem though, so it is a minor tradeoff.  Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the outward expanding reflections here, as it adds interest.  The only minor issue I have is the slight overexposure in the top left.  The reflection doesn''t have this problem though, so it is a minor tradeoff.  Nice shot.', '2004-07-04 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(794465, 85560, 509, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the title, but as sunset shots go, this is a nice one.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the title, but as sunset shots go, this is a nice one.', '2004-07-04 00:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794546, 84486, 23554, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful. Doing it in this coloring was perfect for the theme of the picture. I need to remember this one instead of b&amp;w when I shoot this type.</td>', 'This is really beautiful. Doing it in this coloring was perfect for the theme of the picture. I need to remember this one instead of b&w when I shoot this type.', '2004-07-04 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794548, 86499, 23554, '<td valign="top">Such a cool picture! I hope the people in it got a copy because I know I would love one in such a candid shot.</td>', 'Such a cool picture! I hope the people in it got a copy because I know I would love one in such a candid shot.', '2004-07-04 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(794550, 82862, 23554, '<td valign="top">Colors/Lighting is absolutely gorgeous.</td>', 'Colors/Lighting is absolutely gorgeous.', '2004-07-04 01:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794594, 86439, 326, '<td valign="top">WOW! What a storm front! Great shot!</td>', 'WOW! What a storm front! Great shot!', '2004-07-04 01:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794605, 86457, 326, '<td valign="top">This is BEAUTIFUL! I think I would have cropped out the white rocks? at the bottom of the image. Still a 10.</td>', 'This is BEAUTIFUL! I think I would have cropped out the white rocks? at the bottom of the image. Still a 10.', '2004-07-04 01:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(794609, 86105, 326, '<td valign="top">I really like this! Great job!</td>', 'I really like this! Great job!', '2004-07-04 01:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(794612, 86483, 326, '<td valign="top">Great shot! This would be cool framed!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-08 11:12:40.</i></td>', 'Great shot! This would be cool framed!', '2004-07-04 02:10:04.000000', '2004-07-08 12:12:40.000000', 1),
(794616, 86951, 326, '<td valign="top">Impressive shot! I like the softness of the image. Great colors.</td>', 'Impressive shot! I like the softness of the image. Great colors.', '2004-07-04 02:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794618, 83041, 6172, '<td valign="top">I get more of an impression that this ought to be in a Photoshop competition than a photography competition.</td>', 'I get more of an impression that this ought to be in a Photoshop competition than a photography competition.', '2004-07-04 02:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(794619, 86800, 326, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!!!</td>', 'Gorgeous!!!!', '2004-07-04 02:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(794729, 86543, 19134, '<td valign="top">Great Shot!</td>', 'Great Shot!', '2004-07-04 07:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794730, 86474, 19134, '<td valign="top">Oh, I like it. Great shot!</td>', 'Oh, I like it. Great shot!', '2004-07-04 07:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(794754, 81480, 8005, '<td valign="top">Good title. Great picture.</td>', 'Good title. Great picture.', '2004-07-04 09:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(794796, 86552, 4338, '<td valign="top">this would have ben nicer with out the people in it.</td>', 'this would have ben nicer with out the people in it.', '2004-07-04 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(794798, 86054, 4338, '<td valign="top">nicely done, great lighing</td>', 'nicely done, great lighing', '2004-07-04 11:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794799, 85152, 4338, '<td valign="top">great composition, but the editing looks a bit off. I can see some blue streaks in her hair</td>', 'great composition, but the editing looks a bit off. I can see some blue streaks in her hair', '2004-07-04 11:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(794801, 83815, 4338, '<td valign="top">its an interesting angle and I like it, however i wish the sky was not that color, adjusting the white ballance would have helped get the sky a darker color</td>', 'its an interesting angle and I like it, however i wish the sky was not that color, adjusting the white ballance would have helped get the sky a darker color', '2004-07-04 11:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794814, 86566, 4338, '<td valign="top">i really wish this image was larger, its hard to make out the bee, the croping and lighting are nice</td>', 'i really wish this image was larger, its hard to make out the bee, the croping and lighting are nice', '2004-07-04 11:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(794867, 87094, 1519, '<td valign="top">Love this idea, just a shame that the musket is covering the other child''s face.</td>', 'Love this idea, just a shame that the musket is covering the other child''s face.', '2004-07-04 12:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794918, 86067, 6667, '<td valign="top">Would this, by any chance, been the University CircleParade in Cleveland?  Nice capture. . .just a bit blurry on the edges. Best of luck</td>', 'Would this, by any chance, been the University CircleParade in Cleveland?  Nice capture. . .just a bit blurry on the edges. Best of luck', '2004-07-04 12:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794926, 81480, 6667, '<td valign="top">As a native Clevelander myself, you automatically have an edge.  None-the-less, this is one of the pretiest shots of this bridge that I have seen.  The soft  vs the sharp is a neat contrast.  I am not sure that I would have cropped it a little tighter. . . but that is only my preference.  The very best of luck to you.  What part of Cleveland are you from or were you just visiting?</td>', 'As a native Clevelander myself, you automatically have an edge.  None-the-less, this is one of the pretiest shots of this bridge that I have seen.  The soft  vs the sharp is a neat contrast.  I am not sure that I would have cropped it a little tighter. . . but that is only my preference.  The very best of luck to you.  What part of Cleveland are you from or were you just visiting?', '2004-07-04 12:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794935, 85431, 6667, '<td valign="top">Ok!  Her names not Modona is it?</td>', 'Ok!  Her names not Modona is it?', '2004-07-04 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(795001, 85560, 16775, '<td valign="top">nice title :)</td>', 'nice title :)', '2004-07-04 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(795007, 85945, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image with wonderful composition and excellent use of low DoF. A little low contrast for my tastes - there seems very little white or lighter tone and rather a lot of dark - but that does in itself create a mood for the image which is perhaps exactly what you intended. Beautiful image.</td>', 'A beautiful image with wonderful composition and excellent use of low DoF. A little low contrast for my tastes - there seems very little white or lighter tone and rather a lot of dark - but that does in itself create a mood for the image which is perhaps exactly what you intended. Beautiful image.', '2004-07-04 14:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(795008, 84771, 3087, '<td valign="top">A simple and yet intriguing image - the heads of corn seem to be bathed in a golden light and yet the stars are still clear in the sky. Pretty cool. Nice composition also.</td>', 'A simple and yet intriguing image - the heads of corn seem to be bathed in a golden light and yet the stars are still clear in the sky. Pretty cool. Nice composition also.', '2004-07-04 14:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795010, 85152, 3087, '<td valign="top">I really like the base image itself - the pose, , the rotation, the way the walls form such a strong compositional framing, the texture and play of light on the dress, the expression on her face - but the colour (lighting? post processing?)  doesn''t appeal - I don''t like the blue highlights in her hair nor the green tinge to the shadows on her dress.</td>', 'I really like the base image itself - the pose, , the rotation, the way the walls form such a strong compositional framing, the texture and play of light on the dress, the expression on her face - but the colour (lighting? post processing?)  doesn''t appeal - I don''t like the blue highlights in her hair nor the green tinge to the shadows on her dress.', '2004-07-04 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795011, 84115, 3087, '<td valign="top">A nicely detailed image with nice detail in the water on his body but lacks connection which, IMO, is down to the lack of detail in his eye. I think a catchlight in the eye would bring enormous improvement to this image.</td>', 'A nicely detailed image with nice detail in the water on his body but lacks connection which, IMO, is down to the lack of detail in his eye. I think a catchlight in the eye would bring enormous improvement to this image.', '2004-07-04 14:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(795012, 86338, 3087, '<td valign="top">An intriguing image - such a strange contrast between the rich green foreground, the icey gray midground and the firey clouds at the top.</td>', 'An intriguing image - such a strange contrast between the rich green foreground, the icey gray midground and the firey clouds at the top.', '2004-07-04 14:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795013, 86786, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely high contrast and intriguing shapes and textures as well as viewpoint make this quite an intriguing image.</td>', 'Lovely high contrast and intriguing shapes and textures as well as viewpoint make this quite an intriguing image.', '2004-07-04 14:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(795016, 81480, 3087, '<td valign="top">What an interesting frame that reflection creates... very strong graphically. Unfortunately, for me, the content just isn''t arresting enough to make this a winner though the reflection is appealing.</td>', 'What an interesting frame that reflection creates... very strong graphically. Unfortunately, for me, the content just isn''t arresting enough to make this a winner though the reflection is appealing.', '2004-07-04 14:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(795019, 86446, 16775, '<td valign="top">the biosphere on earth continues to completely baffle me...</td>', 'the biosphere on earth continues to completely baffle me...', '2004-07-04 14:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(795020, 86474, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great angle and very quirky. What a view! Like this a lot!</td>', 'Great angle and very quirky. What a view! Like this a lot!', '2004-07-04 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795023, 84284, 10867, '<td valign="top">I really like the clarity of this image and the interesting sky and tree shape.  I think the image could have been even more effective, though, if the tree hadn''t been centred.</td>', 'I really like the clarity of this image and the interesting sky and tree shape.  I think the image could have been even more effective, though, if the tree hadn''t been centred.', '2004-07-04 14:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(795025, 86260, 10867, '<td valign="top">You might want to consider cropping the narrow strip of sky out.  To my eye, it seems a bit distracting rather than helpful.  (Just my opinion.)  Nice colours and DOF.</td>', 'You might want to consider cropping the narrow strip of sky out.  To my eye, it seems a bit distracting rather than helpful.  (Just my opinion.)  Nice colours and DOF.', '2004-07-04 14:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(795026, 86038, 10867, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2004-07-04 14:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795029, 84364, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and composition.  The horizon seems just a bit tilted, though.</td>', 'Lovely colours and composition.  The horizon seems just a bit tilted, though.', '2004-07-04 14:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(795032, 86054, 10867, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and excellent clarity!</td>', 'Lovely colours and excellent clarity!', '2004-07-04 14:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(795156, 85238, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sky... I usually prefer more saturated colours but the muted effect of this image really appeals to me.</td>', 'What a beautiful sky... I usually prefer more saturated colours but the muted effect of this image really appeals to me.', '2004-07-04 16:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(795157, 87138, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured, great use of DOF to throw out background, and the vibrant green of that background is appealing. Love the curl of leaf onto which he is perched but the overall composition of the image doesn''t quite work for me though I must admit the semi-symmetrical nature of it is quite unusual for this kind of content... a real eye-catcher.</td>', 'Beautifully captured, great use of DOF to throw out background, and the vibrant green of that background is appealing. Love the curl of leaf onto which he is perched but the overall composition of the image doesn''t quite work for me though I must admit the semi-symmetrical nature of it is quite unusual for this kind of content... a real eye-catcher.', '2004-07-04 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795159, 86778, 3087, '<td valign="top">If focus were sharper I think this would be a wonderful image - the colour of the light is lovely. Shame about mum''s expression though - looks slightly pained even though I doubt that''s how she was feeling...</td>', 'If focus were sharper I think this would be a wonderful image - the colour of the light is lovely. Shame about mum''s expression though - looks slightly pained even though I doubt that''s how she was feeling...', '2004-07-04 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(795160, 86258, 3087, '<td valign="top">The cloud pattern makes it look as though the house is shining and rays are emanating from it - very cool.</td>', 'The cloud pattern makes it look as though the house is shining and rays are emanating from it - very cool.', '2004-07-04 16:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(795165, 86866, 3087, '<td valign="top">A truly beautiful silhouette! The sky has lots of interest but not the usual bright, in your face, golden sunset - it''s a much more subtle and subdued beauty. Subject of silhouette is just lovely and position of sun works beautifully also.</td>', 'A truly beautiful silhouette! The sky has lots of interest but not the usual bright, in your face, golden sunset - it''s a much more subtle and subdued beauty. Subject of silhouette is just lovely and position of sun works beautifully also.', '2004-07-04 16:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795166, 83204, 3087, '<td valign="top">Goodness, I used to have a recurring nightmare in  my childhood and there was this delapitated dock in the middle of a lake - this is it. For most viewers I doubt it will hold the sinister air it does for me but... this one certainly has a meaning to me.</td>', 'Goodness, I used to have a recurring nightmare in  my childhood and there was this delapitated dock in the middle of a lake - this is it. For most viewers I doubt it will hold the sinister air it does for me but... this one certainly has a meaning to me.', '2004-07-04 16:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(795169, 86611, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice choice to opt for full focus on the glass and not on the girl even though she is essentially the main subject of the image. Shame liquid is tilted and I''m not sure the way she is gripping the glass is the best option - makes her hand more of a black splodge than an easily identifiable shape.</td>', 'Nice choice to opt for full focus on the glass and not on the girl even though she is essentially the main subject of the image. Shame liquid is tilted and I''m not sure the way she is gripping the glass is the best option - makes her hand more of a black splodge than an easily identifiable shape.', '2004-07-04 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(795172, 86512, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simplicity sometimes works and in this case I think it really does. Would probably sell well for wall art.</td>', 'Simplicity sometimes works and in this case I think it really does. Would probably sell well for wall art.', '2004-07-04 16:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795173, 86418, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow, what wonderful shapes and lines - very abstract in feel - down to the choice of black and white. Really like it!</td>', 'Wow, what wonderful shapes and lines - very abstract in feel - down to the choice of black and white. Really like it!', '2004-07-04 16:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(795174, 83449, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely richness of colour in the sky and a beautiful golden light.</td>', 'Lovely richness of colour in the sky and a beautiful golden light.', '2004-07-04 16:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(795175, 86409, 3087, '<td valign="top">Stunning! Cropping, lighting, toning - all perfect. The quality of light just blows me away. Composition is superb...</td>', 'Stunning! Cropping, lighting, toning - all perfect. The quality of light just blows me away. Composition is superb...', '2004-07-04 16:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795178, 86105, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely and simple but lacks contrast... altogether too pale overall for my preference.</td>', 'Lovely and simple but lacks contrast... altogether too pale overall for my preference.', '2004-07-04 16:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(795179, 81572, 3087, '<td valign="top">A calming and uplifting image.</td>', 'A calming and uplifting image.', '2004-07-04 17:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(795182, 87003, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of soft end and harder lines of main feather and quill. Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice contrast of soft end and harder lines of main feather and quill. Nice composition.', '2004-07-04 17:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(795183, 86054, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely example of back lighting.</td>', 'Lovely example of back lighting.', '2004-07-04 17:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(795184, 81761, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of high contrast. Unfortunately there is too much going on in "background" for the main subject skater to stand out clearly. Shallower DOF might help n that unless the intention is to show the confusion and buzz of activity.</td>', 'Nice use of high contrast. Unfortunately there is too much going on in "background" for the main subject skater to stand out clearly. Shallower DOF might help n that unless the intention is to show the confusion and buzz of activity.', '2004-07-04 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(795185, 85449, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - very emotive and lighting (though probably not what people might consider technically perfect) works superbly for me. Like the strong shadows and the way the hand disappears into those.</td>', 'Beautiful - very emotive and lighting (though probably not what people might consider technically perfect) works superbly for me. Like the strong shadows and the way the hand disappears into those.', '2004-07-04 17:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795187, 86138, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely - to me this is all about horizontal planes or lines - the water, the boat sails, the grass, the buildings/ treeline, the mountains, the pale blue clouds and then the sunlit clouds and then more blue above - just lovely!</td>', 'Lovely - to me this is all about horizontal planes or lines - the water, the boat sails, the grass, the buildings/ treeline, the mountains, the pale blue clouds and then the sunlit clouds and then more blue above - just lovely!', '2004-07-04 17:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795189, 85752, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice colour to water reflections and nice silhouette - I like that it retains some detail.</td>', 'Nice colour to water reflections and nice silhouette - I like that it retains some detail.', '2004-07-04 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795190, 86483, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of that vapour trail to create a strong composition - that curve is just great. And black and white is perfect for the content. Excellent.</td>', 'Great use of that vapour trail to create a strong composition - that curve is just great. And black and white is perfect for the content. Excellent.', '2004-07-04 17:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(795191, 86399, 3087, '<td valign="top">High contrast black and white works well for the subject. The contrast with the smiling faces in the shop window display is marked.</td>', 'High contrast black and white works well for the subject. The contrast with the smiling faces in the shop window display is marked.', '2004-07-04 17:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(795192, 86203, 3087, '<td valign="top">Diagonal composition works well.</td>', 'Diagonal composition works well.', '2004-07-04 17:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(795193, 83675, 3087, '<td valign="top">Strongly nostalgic.</td>', 'Strongly nostalgic.', '2004-07-04 17:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(795194, 85342, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours and shapes and the shallow DOF really works well - the background still shows shapes and colours but doesn''t interfere with the foreground.</td>', 'Great colours and shapes and the shallow DOF really works well - the background still shows shapes and colours but doesn''t interfere with the foreground.', '2004-07-04 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795195, 84994, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good composition/ cropping.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good composition/ cropping.', '2004-07-04 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795196, 84771, 18820, '<td valign="top">10!</td>', '10!', '2004-07-04 17:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(795197, 84137, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the choice of shallow DOF, and the way it makes blurry horizontal stripes of the background. Composition of frame/ pose of the bird work well too.</td>', 'Love the choice of shallow DOF, and the way it makes blurry horizontal stripes of the background. Composition of frame/ pose of the bird work well too.', '2004-07-04 17:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795198, 86466, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting... very nostalgic.</td>', 'Lovely lighting... very nostalgic.', '2004-07-04 17:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(795199, 87103, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful candid double portrait - very touching. Black and white works very well.</td>', 'Beautiful candid double portrait - very touching. Black and white works very well.', '2004-07-04 17:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795200, 87017, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cliched content (I''ve seen similar images of a knot in the barbed wire with an out of focus background many times). That said, people say that there''s nothing new under the sun and it''s all about putting your own stamp on it. I like the composition and the lighting and the limited colour palette overall.</td>', 'Cliched content (I''ve seen similar images of a knot in the barbed wire with an out of focus background many times). That said, people say that there''s nothing new under the sun and it''s all about putting your own stamp on it. I like the composition and the lighting and the limited colour palette overall.', '2004-07-04 17:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795209, 85925, 16520, '<td valign="top">Everyone says there is to many frog frog shots I guess they don''t look at color and  texture ....Well done ................10</td>', 'Everyone says there is to many frog frog shots I guess they don''t look at color and  texture ....Well done ................10', '2004-07-04 17:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(795263, 87102, 1041, '<td valign="top">Lovely cat picture, there''s really nothing that I''d do differently.  I like the splash of color in the front from he blanket and how we can clearly see all the fuzzy hairs of the cat.  Actually, one thing that would be nice, too (and it depends much on your cat) is if you captured a shot with him/her looking at you, too.  This one works in b&amp;w, too, I think.</td>', 'Lovely cat picture, there''s really nothing that I''d do differently.  I like the splash of color in the front from he blanket and how we can clearly see all the fuzzy hairs of the cat.  Actually, one thing that would be nice, too (and it depends much on your cat) is if you captured a shot with him/her looking at you, too.  This one works in b&w, too, I think.', '2004-07-04 18:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(795269, 85314, 1041, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the sun overpowers everything and there isn''t much that I can see from what''s going on on 14th Street, therefore the image doesn''t hold my attention long.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the sun overpowers everything and there isn''t much that I can see from what''s going on on 14th Street, therefore the image doesn''t hold my attention long.', '2004-07-04 18:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(795270, 86054, 1041, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks.  I simply love the simplicity of this, the luminosity of the leaf that lets us see every little vein and the curved stem that it is growing on.  All very well complemented by the black background.  Beautiful work.  Well worth making available as a print, would work well as a card, too.</td>', 'One of my top picks.  I simply love the simplicity of this, the luminosity of the leaf that lets us see every little vein and the curved stem that it is growing on.  All very well complemented by the black background.  Beautiful work.  Well worth making available as a print, would work well as a card, too.', '2004-07-04 18:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795271, 83188, 1041, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get hammered too much by the "but there''s almost nothing in focus" voter.  I think this is a stunning image of an every-day object.  I especially like the petals to the right, I wonder if this would be an even stronger shot if you cropped a bit off the top since the top left part of the image has virtually no texture or shadow to speak off.</td>', 'I hope you don''t get hammered too much by the "but there''s almost nothing in focus" voter.  I think this is a stunning image of an every-day object.  I especially like the petals to the right, I wonder if this would be an even stronger shot if you cropped a bit off the top since the top left part of the image has virtually no texture or shadow to speak off.', '2004-07-04 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(795275, 83346, 1041, '<td valign="top">I have to confess that I like your entry for the Waiting challenge much better than this one.  The waiting one really focuses the viewer on the hands and the belly.  I understand that most people, when they have photos done obviously want to have their heads in the shot, too :)  I guess when I look at this, the hands look too posed, and while I understand that they both are looking at the belly, they both have rather sad looks on their faces which is in big contrast with the joyous event of having a baby.  I do like the b&amp;w treatment here, but could also see just a bit of toning work well, it could give the photo a slightler warmer feel.  Just my thoughts of course.  I''ve only just started to do portrait photography (well, really just one time) and I never thought it would be as hard work as it was!</td>', 'I have to confess that I like your entry for the Waiting challenge much better than this one.  The waiting one really focuses the viewer on the hands and the belly.  I understand that most people, when they have photos done obviously want to have their heads in the shot, too :)  I guess when I look at this, the hands look too posed, and while I understand that they both are looking at the belly, they both have rather sad looks on their faces which is in big contrast with the joyous event of having a baby.  I do like the b&w treatment here, but could also see just a bit of toning work well, it could give the photo a slightler warmer feel.  Just my thoughts of course.  I''ve only just started to do portrait photography (well, really just one time) and I never thought it would be as hard work as it was!', '2004-07-04 18:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(795279, 87079, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice summer picture, I love the mischief in his eyes! The only thing I would change is I would crop off about an inch from the top. The tall aspect ratio just seems a bit awkward to me.</td>', 'Very nice summer picture, I love the mischief in his eyes! The only thing I would change is I would crop off about an inch from the top. The tall aspect ratio just seems a bit awkward to me.', '2004-07-04 18:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(795280, 85837, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the subject.  Its kinda neat that you caught them all suspended in midair, but the shot doesn''t have much impact for me.  The background seems to be in sharper focus, and my eyes are drawn there.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the subject.  Its kinda neat that you caught them all suspended in midair, but the shot doesn''t have much impact for me.  The background seems to be in sharper focus, and my eyes are drawn there.', '2004-07-04 18:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(795282, 86597, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the exposure here.  Was there any color in the sky naturally or was it removed?  Either way, it contrasts nicely with the dark foreground.</td>', 'I like the exposure here.  Was there any color in the sky naturally or was it removed?  Either way, it contrasts nicely with the dark foreground.', '2004-07-04 18:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(795283, 85762, 509, '<td valign="top">A touch oversharpened, leading to the strange color effects on the green object in the center.  Also, it looks as though there may be a story here, but based on the composition, it is difficult to tell what is going on.</td>', 'A touch oversharpened, leading to the strange color effects on the green object in the center.  Also, it looks as though there may be a story here, but based on the composition, it is difficult to tell what is going on.', '2004-07-04 18:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795286, 86834, 509, '<td valign="top">The title fits well.  A good action shot.  I think from a different angle adding separation between the driver of #461 and the wreck would be more desirable, but considering that these things can''t be planned for, this is a great capture.</td>', 'The title fits well.  A good action shot.  I think from a different angle adding separation between the driver of #461 and the wreck would be more desirable, but considering that these things can''t be planned for, this is a great capture.', '2004-07-04 18:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795287, 86626, 23827, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-07-04 18:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(795290, 87021, 509, '<td valign="top">Not sure what could be changed to improve this subject.  The background elements, though blurred, are still distracting to my eye.  The image does not hold very much interest imho.</td>', 'Not sure what could be changed to improve this subject.  The background elements, though blurred, are still distracting to my eye.  The image does not hold very much interest imho.', '2004-07-04 18:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795294, 87151, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Though the blur looks unnatural to me, I think this is a nice example of more or less digital art.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Though the blur looks unnatural to me, I think this is a nice example of more or less digital art.', '2004-07-04 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(795296, 86769, 3724, '<td valign="top">timely......</td>', 'timely......', '2004-07-04 18:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795297, 83204, 509, '<td valign="top">The sparkles of light in the water add interest, especially with the forlorn looking sky in the background.  I like the subject, exposure and composiiton and really can''t think of anything I would change for improvement.  Excellent picture.</td>', 'The sparkles of light in the water add interest, especially with the forlorn looking sky in the background.  I like the subject, exposure and composiiton and really can''t think of anything I would change for improvement.  Excellent picture.', '2004-07-04 18:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795317, 86962, 509, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of emotion.  With the slight silhouettes of flags and the strangely shaped poles, it leads me to believe that there was some struggle or hardship before the happy ending.  Regardless, the picture tells a story and is very well done.</td>', 'Good portrayal of emotion.  With the slight silhouettes of flags and the strangely shaped poles, it leads me to believe that there was some struggle or hardship before the happy ending.  Regardless, the picture tells a story and is very well done.', '2004-07-04 19:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795318, 84307, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting and original shot.  The composition is well done and the selective desaturation is effective at emphasizing the human element in contrast with nature.  Nice work.</td>', 'Interesting and original shot.  The composition is well done and the selective desaturation is effective at emphasizing the human element in contrast with nature.  Nice work.', '2004-07-04 19:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795319, 84695, 509, '<td valign="top">I love the detail and smoothness of the surf.  Excellent black and white study.</td>', 'I love the detail and smoothness of the surf.  Excellent black and white study.', '2004-07-04 19:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795326, 86512, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good job keeping the noise down in this image be through software or otherwise.  IMO this image lacks context.  A reference point the foreground or background would help. 6</td>', 'Good job keeping the noise down in this image be through software or otherwise.  IMO this image lacks context.  A reference point the foreground or background would help. 6', '2004-07-04 19:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(795333, 84332, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait of the leopard.  You''ve caught the expression wonderfully and the exposure seems right on.  However, the grass in front of the face is  very distracting. 7</td>', 'This is a great portrait of the leopard.  You''ve caught the expression wonderfully and the exposure seems right on.  However, the grass in front of the face is  very distracting. 7', '2004-07-04 20:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(795335, 85773, 509, '<td valign="top">Seems to be some red and green colors mixed in the water, giving it a blotchy appearance.  It seems to me that the boat is the focus of this image, and I think it would have more impact without the bird, but then the pole would be a nuisance too.  Cloning the bird out might help, or maybe a different angle.</td>', 'Seems to be some red and green colors mixed in the water, giving it a blotchy appearance.  It seems to me that the boat is the focus of this image, and I think it would have more impact without the bird, but then the pole would be a nuisance too.  Cloning the bird out might help, or maybe a different angle.', '2004-07-04 20:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795336, 87139, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely reflection, however I think it would have alot more impact if only the reflection of the legs were included (crop the reflection of the body from the bottom of the image). 7</td>', 'Lovely reflection, however I think it would have alot more impact if only the reflection of the legs were included (crop the reflection of the body from the bottom of the image). 7', '2004-07-04 20:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795338, 87007, 509, '<td valign="top">I think in this case, fill flash would work well.  The woman is underexposed leaving the sky correctly exposed (though washed out).  Putting some light on your subject would better convey your message.  If fill flash wasn''t possible, I would overexpose the shot (compared to this exposure).  Losing the detail in the sky wouldn''t detract, as there isn''t much sky detail or color to begin with.</td>', 'I think in this case, fill flash would work well.  The woman is underexposed leaving the sky correctly exposed (though washed out).  Putting some light on your subject would better convey your message.  If fill flash wasn''t possible, I would overexpose the shot (compared to this exposure).  Losing the detail in the sky wouldn''t detract, as there isn''t much sky detail or color to begin with.', '2004-07-04 20:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(795339, 87137, 7743, '<td valign="top">The droplet on the flower with the reflection is terrific, however the flower at the bottom is a bit distracting.  The image would probably still be ballanced without it. 7</td>', 'The droplet on the flower with the reflection is terrific, however the flower at the bottom is a bit distracting.  The image would probably still be ballanced without it. 7', '2004-07-04 20:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(795340, 86474, 509, '<td valign="top">Great focus and exposure!  One of my favorite shots so far.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Great focus and exposure!  One of my favorite shots so far.  Nicely done.', '2004-07-04 20:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(795341, 81045, 509, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured a lot of detail on the bug.  I think I''d like to see all of the legs and antennae in focus, but that''s pretty much nitpicking.  Well done.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured a lot of detail on the bug.  I think I''d like to see all of the legs and antennae in focus, but that''s pretty much nitpicking.  Well done.', '2004-07-04 20:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(795343, 86105, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this would work, but could a slower shutter speed show some blur on the rain adding some streaks?  The drops in the lake (or ocean?) show that it is raining, but I just think it would be cool.  A nice image overall</td>', 'I don''t know if this would work, but could a slower shutter speed show some blur on the rain adding some streaks?  The drops in the lake (or ocean?) show that it is raining, but I just think it would be cool.  A nice image overall', '2004-07-04 20:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795347, 86836, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but am not wild about the composition.  I think the length and shape of the grain could be used to strengthen the composition, maybe having some prevalent diagonals.  There doesn''t seem to be much form to the subject here, and imho, the more interesting subject is the taller strand to the left, though the focus is on the center.  The exposure itself is good (though a little oversharpened).</td>', 'I like the subject, but am not wild about the composition.  I think the length and shape of the grain could be used to strengthen the composition, maybe having some prevalent diagonals.  There doesn''t seem to be much form to the subject here, and imho, the more interesting subject is the taller strand to the left, though the focus is on the center.  The exposure itself is good (though a little oversharpened).', '2004-07-04 20:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(795350, 86582, 509, '<td valign="top">Captivating waterfall.  This shot might benefit from some dodging and/or burning to fix the overexposed section at the top and add more emotion to the scene overall.  I would definitely go back and get a variety of shots (if you haven''t already), as I''m sure there is a lot to see here.</td>', 'Captivating waterfall.  This shot might benefit from some dodging and/or burning to fix the overexposed section at the top and add more emotion to the scene overall.  I would definitely go back and get a variety of shots (if you haven''t already), as I''m sure there is a lot to see here.', '2004-07-04 20:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795396, 86939, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the composition of this one, but I have to give you credit for capturing the decisive moment.  The jump''s apogee combined with the great expression make for an excellent photo.  Just wish it was a bit sharper and the shutter had been a bit quicker to freeze the action better.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the composition of this one, but I have to give you credit for capturing the decisive moment.  The jump''s apogee combined with the great expression make for an excellent photo.  Just wish it was a bit sharper and the shutter had been a bit quicker to freeze the action better.', '2004-07-04 21:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795399, 85346, 20204, '<td valign="top">I can see the symmetry of the cloud reflection being asthetically attractive, but when I hold up a piece of paper to crop this image a bit below the tree reflections it seems to call better attention them as a subject.</td>', 'I can see the symmetry of the cloud reflection being asthetically attractive, but when I hold up a piece of paper to crop this image a bit below the tree reflections it seems to call better attention them as a subject.', '2004-07-04 21:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795404, 86568, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the highlights in the clouds required so much of the range that the detail in rocks was lost and underexposed.  I think spot metering on a less hot area would have helped to bring them into a closer exposure zone.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the highlights in the clouds required so much of the range that the detail in rocks was lost and underexposed.  I think spot metering on a less hot area would have helped to bring them into a closer exposure zone.', '2004-07-04 21:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795408, 86931, 20204, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and contrast.  I like the balance between the sky and ground details.  Very well done image!</td>', 'Excellent detail and contrast.  I like the balance between the sky and ground details.  Very well done image!', '2004-07-04 21:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(795412, 86423, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the cropping on this, but I do like the subject.  The partial land on the right detracts somewhat and the almost square aspect ratio feels awkward.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the cropping on this, but I do like the subject.  The partial land on the right detracts somewhat and the almost square aspect ratio feels awkward.', '2004-07-04 21:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(795430, 85358, 6661, '<td valign="top">This is superb, my favourite of the challenge. 10.</td>', 'This is superb, my favourite of the challenge. 10.', '2004-07-04 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(795556, 83815, 13091, '<td valign="top">Déja vu...The wall</td>', 'Déja vu...The wall', '2004-07-05 00:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795557, 86996, 13091, '<td valign="top">Déja vu...Reflections</td>', 'Déja vu...Reflections', '2004-07-05 00:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
