(796034, 86951, 4008, '<td valign="top">When I saw the thumbnail I thought just another picture of the staue of liberty. But seeing the full image I must admit I really like the tones here. The green from the statue also recurring in the sky, the gold colored flame, really nice.</td>', 'When I saw the thumbnail I thought just another picture of the staue of liberty. But seeing the full image I must admit I really like the tones here. The green from the statue also recurring in the sky, the gold colored flame, really nice.', '2004-07-05 08:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
