(796040, 85953, 4008, '<td valign="top">the graffiti on the left and the persons on the right are competing for attention, not sure what the subject of this image is (and also don''t understand the title).</td>', 'the graffiti on the left and the persons on the right are competing for attention, not sure what the subject of this image is (and also don''t understand the title).', '2004-07-05 08:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
