(796467, 86499, 2764, '<td valign="top">Do we have a winner here???  Just perfect.  Llove the desaturation, makes the day look hot and hazy, love the red striped shirt for focus and the erotic wet skirt and the toe ring.  Love the action, the story, one girl helping the other.  Love the watery background and the droplets in the foreground.  Makes the viewer fell like both a participant and a voyeur. 10</td>', 'Do we have a winner here???  Just perfect.  Llove the desaturation, makes the day look hot and hazy, love the red striped shirt for focus and the erotic wet skirt and the toe ring.  Love the action, the story, one girl helping the other.  Love the watery background and the droplets in the foreground.  Makes the viewer fell like both a participant and a voyeur. 10', '2004-07-05 13:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
