(796479, 87006, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think I would crop all the foreground.  tyr it?  the striking shapes of the tree branches and the light through the leaves is completely surreal and painterly.  The ground is too realistic and detracts.  Without the foreground you have some terrific patterns going:  Tree tunk is one, curly silouette branches is another. straight hanging doen brances frame the bottom and the sideways stanted leaves in the top right corner is the last.  All play nicely torgether in an abstrqct texture.</td>', 'I think I would crop all the foreground.  tyr it?  the striking shapes of the tree branches and the light through the leaves is completely surreal and painterly.  The ground is too realistic and detracts.  Without the foreground you have some terrific patterns going:  Tree tunk is one, curly silouette branches is another. straight hanging doen brances frame the bottom and the sideways stanted leaves in the top right corner is the last.  All play nicely torgether in an abstrqct texture.', '2004-07-05 13:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
