(796515, 85238, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awesome, inspiring shot.  I really like the drama of the sky against the serenity of the scene.  The overall color scheme just works together so well without being boring.   One of my favorites.</td>', 'Awesome, inspiring shot.  I really like the drama of the sky against the serenity of the scene.  The overall color scheme just works together so well without being boring.   One of my favorites.', '2004-07-05 13:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(796517, 80970, 14986, '<td valign="top">Interesting to see the validation on this shot, as I thought about requesting a review myself.  Amazing to believe that you could capture all these strikes at once!  I like the rooftops in the photo as well.   <br/> <br/>To have captured the subtle colors of the clouds as well - it has to be one of the best lightning photos I''ve seen.  This one''s a winner for sure!</td>', 'Interesting to see the validation on this shot, as I thought about requesting a review myself.  Amazing to believe that you could capture all these strikes at once!  I like the rooftops in the photo as well.    To have captured the subtle colors of the clouds as well - it has to be one of the best lightning photos I''ve seen.  This one''s a winner for sure!', '2004-07-05 13:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(796518, 86138, 14986, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a difference a sky can make.  The scene in the foreground is nice, but not really out of the ordinary.  However, add that sky to it and the wonderful hills in the background and you have a great combination of colors and interests here.   I think I might like to see more of the water, but I''m not sure.    Very nice shot!</td>', 'Wow!  What a difference a sky can make.  The scene in the foreground is nice, but not really out of the ordinary.  However, add that sky to it and the wonderful hills in the background and you have a great combination of colors and interests here.   I think I might like to see more of the water, but I''m not sure.    Very nice shot!', '2004-07-05 13:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796520, 86870, 14986, '<td valign="top">The reflections in the water are what make this photo stand out.   Technically, I just don''t see how this one could get any better.  Sharp as a tack, great colors and textures with the water and the feathers.   It''s just a duck, yes - but wonderfully captured.</td>', 'The reflections in the water are what make this photo stand out.   Technically, I just don''t see how this one could get any better.  Sharp as a tack, great colors and textures with the water and the feathers.   It''s just a duck, yes - but wonderfully captured.', '2004-07-05 13:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(796522, 84578, 14986, '<td valign="top">These guys are so photogenic for bugs!   Very clear shot with nice colors.   I might have liked it better just a little less straight on.</td>', 'These guys are so photogenic for bugs!   Very clear shot with nice colors.   I might have liked it better just a little less straight on.', '2004-07-05 14:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(796524, 84364, 14986, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised we didn''t see more DC shots!  The colors here are so nice.   The thing I find distracting is the water''s edge line on the right coming down at an angle.   Not sure if a small counter-clockwise rotation would mess everything else up or not.    Still - very nice shot.</td>', 'I''m surprised we didn''t see more DC shots!  The colors here are so nice.   The thing I find distracting is the water''s edge line on the right coming down at an angle.   Not sure if a small counter-clockwise rotation would mess everything else up or not.    Still - very nice shot.', '2004-07-05 14:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(796531, 87132, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely.   It will make an awesome print.   The composition is very good, but I think what makes this one stand out is the lighting and the reflections.  The darkness and the reflections work perfectly to draw the attention to the blooms.   Nice sharp focus.</td>', 'This is just lovely.   It will make an awesome print.   The composition is very good, but I think what makes this one stand out is the lighting and the reflections.  The darkness and the reflections work perfectly to draw the attention to the blooms.   Nice sharp focus.', '2004-07-05 14:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(796542, 86800, 14986, '<td valign="top">A different shot, and I like it alot.   I will be interested to see how much, if any, post processing  went into this one.   The sky is awesome, with having the lighter clouds around her head.   I think the cropping/framing is perfect and the contrast and lighting give just the right dramatic feel to the photo.    <br/> <br/>I would love to see the outtakes from this photo shoot!</td>', 'A different shot, and I like it alot.   I will be interested to see how much, if any, post processing  went into this one.   The sky is awesome, with having the lighter clouds around her head.   I think the cropping/framing is perfect and the contrast and lighting give just the right dramatic feel to the photo.     I would love to see the outtakes from this photo shoot!', '2004-07-05 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(796551, 86206, 14986, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure and contrast make this one pop.  It''s a perfectly formed flower too!  Altogether just a lovely shot and would make a great print.</td>', 'Perfect exposure and contrast make this one pop.  It''s a perfectly formed flower too!  Altogether just a lovely shot and would make a great print.', '2004-07-05 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(796559, 87150, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how this has been done to bring the viewer right to the eyes (with all the stuff around them, you''d think it''d be distracting) - but I guess it all serves instead to frame those eyes.   Wonderful expression and a very nice photo of this guy.   Good title to match it.</td>', 'I don''t know how this has been done to bring the viewer right to the eyes (with all the stuff around them, you''d think it''d be distracting) - but I guess it all serves instead to frame those eyes.   Wonderful expression and a very nice photo of this guy.   Good title to match it.', '2004-07-05 14:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(796564, 83508, 14986, '<td valign="top">Great action shot - love catching the horses in mid-trot.   Very nice colors and clarity to the shot.   This one took some effort to get so well done.</td>', 'Great action shot - love catching the horses in mid-trot.   Very nice colors and clarity to the shot.   This one took some effort to get so well done.', '2004-07-05 14:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(796568, 84754, 14986, '<td valign="top">The clarity and lighting of this one make it stand out among the bird shots IMO.   The detail is wonderful, the pose is perfect and the colors and blurred background give it that "wow" factor.   Very nicely done.</td>', 'The clarity and lighting of this one make it stand out among the bird shots IMO.   The detail is wonderful, the pose is perfect and the colors and blurred background give it that "wow" factor.   Very nicely done.', '2004-07-05 14:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(796573, 84994, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and tones to this shot.   Sensual without being in your face.</td>', 'Very nice composition and tones to this shot.   Sensual without being in your face.', '2004-07-05 14:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(796575, 85041, 14986, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you could do anything to improve this one!   Perfect in-flight shot .  Great clarity (look at that eye!) and the perfect blue sky and colors just bring this one to life.</td>', 'I don''t think you could do anything to improve this one!   Perfect in-flight shot .  Great clarity (look at that eye!) and the perfect blue sky and colors just bring this one to life.', '2004-07-05 14:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(796581, 87139, 14986, '<td valign="top">I just love the simplicity and feel of this shot and I think it''s perfectly named.    I might have liked a little more interest in the tones - something a tad more golden.  Better to under do it than over do it though, IMO.   This is a nice shot.</td>', 'I just love the simplicity and feel of this shot and I think it''s perfectly named.    I might have liked a little more interest in the tones - something a tad more golden.  Better to under do it than over do it though, IMO.   This is a nice shot.', '2004-07-05 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(796586, 83036, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very nice golden tones and sillohuettes.    I like the composition with the reflections in the water.   Some people might think it''s too dark,  but on my monitor anyway, it gives a great feel to the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice golden tones and sillohuettes.    I like the composition with the reflections in the water.   Some people might think it''s too dark,  but on my monitor anyway, it gives a great feel to the shot.  Nicely done.', '2004-07-05 14:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(796588, 86474, 14986, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious.  I had to chuckle at this shot and I  think I would have liked to get a photo of you getting this photo!   <br/> <br/>Nice colors and clarity.  Fun composition and angle.   Good job!</td>', 'This is hilarious.  I had to chuckle at this shot and I  think I would have liked to get a photo of you getting this photo!    Nice colors and clarity.  Fun composition and angle.   Good job!', '2004-07-05 14:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(796592, 87103, 14986, '<td valign="top">What a charming shot.  The expressions are perfect.  I would have likes a litle more contrast to the shot, but I don''t know how that would work with the little girl.<br/> <br/>The moment is captured wonderfully here, and that''s really what matters.</td>', 'What a charming shot.  The expressions are perfect.  I would have likes a litle more contrast to the shot, but I don''t know how that would work with the little girl. The moment is captured wonderfully here, and that''s really what matters.', '2004-07-05 14:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(796595, 85560, 14986, '<td valign="top">Very stunning sky colors here.  Nicely captured, but a bit on the boring side.  I''m not sure what I would do differently.   I guess it would depend on what''s available.  Maybe focus more on one thing instead of the whole line of dark trees?   In anycase, it looks like you got to enjoy a great sunset.</td>', 'Very stunning sky colors here.  Nicely captured, but a bit on the boring side.  I''m not sure what I would do differently.   I guess it would depend on what''s available.  Maybe focus more on one thing instead of the whole line of dark trees?   In anycase, it looks like you got to enjoy a great sunset.', '2004-07-05 14:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796600, 81724, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awww.....I wonder how close you actually were here?  Looking right at you too - just a perfect pose.   Very nicely taken with great focus and detail.  I''m no expert, so I don''t know if you post processed the blurred background, of if DOF was actually like that, but it works well.     Really good detail on the fur and the face.  The colors seems a little too bright - especially the green.    Nice shot!</td>', 'Awww.....I wonder how close you actually were here?  Looking right at you too - just a perfect pose.   Very nicely taken with great focus and detail.  I''m no expert, so I don''t know if you post processed the blurred background, of if DOF was actually like that, but it works well.     Really good detail on the fur and the face.  The colors seems a little too bright - especially the green.    Nice shot!', '2004-07-05 14:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(796720, 84364, 15648, '<td valign="top">Great colors</td>', 'Great colors', '2004-07-05 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(796727, 86600, 15648, '<td valign="top">Shame his wing is covering his face a bit. I like that you can see his eye. 7</td>', 'Shame his wing is covering his face a bit. I like that you can see his eye. 7', '2004-07-05 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(796731, 86859, 15648, '<td valign="top">You should have done a off center crop. Show more water</td>', 'You should have done a off center crop. Show more water', '2004-07-05 15:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(796794, 86953, 4090, '<td valign="top">I like the "outside in" better, while this photo is good " sky, Composition" it is lacking something don''t know what.. 7</td>', 'I like the "outside in" better, while this photo is good " sky, Composition" it is lacking something don''t know what.. 7', '2004-07-05 17:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(796801, 83921, 4090, '<td valign="top">you can almost touch this as it''s so clear, focus and composition is spot on 10</td>', 'you can almost touch this as it''s so clear, focus and composition is spot on 10', '2004-07-05 17:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(796841, 86409, 20066, '<td valign="top">Really very good I think. One can feel the personality from the model and also the photograper!  So this is my first ten.</td>', 'Really very good I think. One can feel the personality from the model and also the photograper!  So this is my first ten.', '2004-07-05 17:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(796865, 86476, 21714, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop or a complete black background would have worked much better for this image. I like the texture but you could have balanced the light a bit more by using a reflector or a fill-in light from the right. I also think that the hotspot is a bit strong. Maybe that''s what you wanted to achieve. Bottom line is this photograph has potential and it''s definitely worth another try. <br/>Best of luck.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop or a complete black background would have worked much better for this image. I like the texture but you could have balanced the light a bit more by using a reflector or a fill-in light from the right. I also think that the hotspot is a bit strong. Maybe that''s what you wanted to achieve. Bottom line is this photograph has potential and it''s definitely worth another try. Best of luck.', '2004-07-05 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(796871, 85052, 21714, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus and great detail and I know it''s not easy to achieve with a bird in flight. But I don''t think the composition works.  To me it looks like the bird is boxed. Maybe it''s too big  for the frame. Looks like it has no where to go.  I don''t get the free feeling.</td>', 'Sharp focus and great detail and I know it''s not easy to achieve with a bird in flight. But I don''t think the composition works.  To me it looks like the bird is boxed. Maybe it''s too big  for the frame. Looks like it has no where to go.  I don''t get the free feeling.', '2004-07-05 18:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(796878, 84365, 21714, '<td valign="top">Great composition and fine detail. It''s a brilliant shot. There are parts of the birds body that does bother me. Maybe it''s moiré or maybe that''s how the bird was. But it does kill the full impact this image would otherwise have.</td>', 'Great composition and fine detail. It''s a brilliant shot. There are parts of the birds body that does bother me. Maybe it''s moiré or maybe that''s how the bird was. But it does kill the full impact this image would otherwise have.', '2004-07-05 18:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(796882, 86531, 21714, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great chess player. Interesting image. Actually, it''s a brilliantly wonderful image :S</td>', 'Looks like a great chess player. Interesting image. Actually, it''s a brilliantly wonderful image :S', '2004-07-05 18:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796895, 84994, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful shot. Lighting is great but I am not sure about her hands. Looks a bit rough and out of balance to me. But that''s only slightly.  Overall, it''s a wonderful photograph.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful shot. Lighting is great but I am not sure about her hands. Looks a bit rough and out of balance to me. But that''s only slightly.  Overall, it''s a wonderful photograph.', '2004-07-05 18:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(796904, 82934, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. It would have looked much better if it was a bit sharper and brownish bits were''t there. It looks a bit untidy. But well spotted.</td>', 'Nice composition. It would have looked much better if it was a bit sharper and brownish bits were''t there. It looks a bit untidy. But well spotted.', '2004-07-05 18:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(796909, 84307, 21714, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous. A fabulous image indeeeeeeeeeeeeeed.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous. A fabulous image indeeeeeeeeeeeeeed.', '2004-07-05 18:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(796925, 85342, 7743, '<td valign="top">You''ve done very well with depth of field and the colours are nice.  However, the bright spot at the bottom is a bit distracting and the main subject is a little too central.  It could be put off center be cropping about 1/4 of the picture off the lefthand side.  Also, this may have worked better  in a vertical composition to emphasize the stems of the flowers. 6</td>', 'You''ve done very well with depth of field and the colours are nice.  However, the bright spot at the bottom is a bit distracting and the main subject is a little too central.  It could be put off center be cropping about 1/4 of the picture off the lefthand side.  Also, this may have worked better  in a vertical composition to emphasize the stems of the flowers. 6', '2004-07-05 19:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(796949, 87103, 2764, '<td valign="top">Just perfect - I love the expressions and the bit of light on her face.  Who is in the cage anyways?</td>', 'Just perfect - I love the expressions and the bit of light on her face.  Who is in the cage anyways?', '2004-07-05 20:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796951, 86999, 2764, '<td valign="top">Sometimes an off center composition is more interesting.  This one needs some punch somehwere - maybe saturating the yellow stamens?  Maybe a closer crop?  High contrast black and white?  Despite the perfect focus and DOF, this one is lacking in composition.</td>', 'Sometimes an off center composition is more interesting.  This one needs some punch somehwere - maybe saturating the yellow stamens?  Maybe a closer crop?  High contrast black and white?  Despite the perfect focus and DOF, this one is lacking in composition.', '2004-07-05 20:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(797000, 86870, 4729, '<td valign="top">Lovely....the reflections are beautiful!</td>', 'Lovely....the reflections are beautiful!', '2004-07-05 20:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(797102, 86582, 12268, '<td valign="top">this would have looked even better with a longer exposure shot, making the water fall seem softer &amp; almost painted. also maybe a tighter crop to keep the full focus on the fall. maybe a bit off the top/ regardless, it''s a really nice shot.</td>', 'this would have looked even better with a longer exposure shot, making the water fall seem softer & almost painted. also maybe a tighter crop to keep the full focus on the fall. maybe a bit off the top/ regardless, it''s a really nice shot.', '2004-07-05 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(797105, 86474, 12268, '<td valign="top">funky shot! my fave so far! 10</td>', 'funky shot! my fave so far! 10', '2004-07-05 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(797129, 85628, 18517, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t a DrJOnes shot, I don''t know what is.</td>', 'If this isn''t a DrJOnes shot, I don''t know what is.', '2004-07-05 22:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(797281, 86474, 8054, '<td valign="top">LOL! This is a hilarious photo and I love it! Perfect perspective and DOF. Did you pay these cows to pose just the way you wanted? :) 10!</td>', 'LOL! This is a hilarious photo and I love it! Perfect perspective and DOF. Did you pay these cows to pose just the way you wanted? :) 10!', '2004-07-06 01:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(797286, 87006, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject for the free study but I think it''s overexposed and/or oversharpened.</td>', 'Excellent subject for the free study but I think it''s overexposed and/or oversharpened.', '2004-07-06 01:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(797291, 86604, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think you were trying to go for a selective desat with this and you (mostly) succeeded. The lower parts of the sky are still a faint blue and not quite duotone yet. If I''m wrong, please tell me. I think the sunject could have used a different facial expression like one of great surprise or relief that the apple was hit instead of himself. Good effort overall.</td>', 'I think you were trying to go for a selective desat with this and you (mostly) succeeded. The lower parts of the sky are still a faint blue and not quite duotone yet. If I''m wrong, please tell me. I think the sunject could have used a different facial expression like one of great surprise or relief that the apple was hit instead of himself. Good effort overall.', '2004-07-06 01:22:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(797298, 83036, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is simply sheer beauty. Outstanding.</td>', 'This image is simply sheer beauty. Outstanding.', '2004-07-06 01:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(797300, 84486, 22734, '<td valign="top">very becoming image. Good choice for sepia</td>', 'very becoming image. Good choice for sepia', '2004-07-06 01:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(797302, 86625, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is just a great shot for any port</td>', 'This is just a great shot for any port', '2004-07-06 01:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(797303, 86600, 22734, '<td valign="top">An amazing take. A true 8 in my book.</td>', 'An amazing take. A true 8 in my book.', '2004-07-06 01:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(797306, 86859, 22734, '<td valign="top">very nice and soothing...</td>', 'very nice and soothing...', '2004-07-06 01:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(797307, 86483, 22734, '<td valign="top">very nice action shot</td>', 'very nice action shot', '2004-07-06 01:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(797308, 86507, 19025, '<td valign="top">This picture kind of looks like it''s moving if you stare at it...like it''s moving up toward you.. Great!!! I love this one..<br/></td>', 'This picture kind of looks like it''s moving if you stare at it...like it''s moving up toward you.. Great!!! I love this one..', '2004-07-06 01:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(797310, 86322, 8054, '<td valign="top">I studied this for a long time trying to think of different ways this could have been accomplished. I think your way is probably one of the better ways and how I might have done it as well. I imagined that the child''s mother or father just called saying it''s time to go. The child collected the chalk, got up and started to walk away. Very well done and well executed. The icing on the cake, to me at least, is the motion blur. This is one of those very simple yet very effective photos. 10</td>', 'I studied this for a long time trying to think of different ways this could have been accomplished. I think your way is probably one of the better ways and how I might have done it as well. I imagined that the child''s mother or father just called saying it''s time to go. The child collected the chalk, got up and started to walk away. Very well done and well executed. The icing on the cake, to me at least, is the motion blur. This is one of those very simple yet very effective photos. 10', '2004-07-06 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(797311, 85346, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a type that one hangs in one''s livung room. Very nice.</td>', 'This is a type that one hangs in one''s livung room. Very nice.', '2004-07-06 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(797313, 85431, 19025, '<td valign="top">Blurry...Lesbians?...cute picture otherwise<br/></td>', 'Blurry...Lesbians?...cute picture otherwise', '2004-07-06 01:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(797314, 86953, 22734, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the old lithographs. Very nice feel.</td>', 'This reminds me of the old lithographs. Very nice feel.', '2004-07-06 01:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(797315, 86939, 19025, '<td valign="top">AH..Orlando Florida...was just there last week. Love it!! And saw that black dolphin/whale too.. I got some neat pictures of that show. It was fun..</td>', 'AH..Orlando Florida...was just there last week. Love it!! And saw that black dolphin/whale too.. I got some neat pictures of that show. It was fun..', '2004-07-06 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(797316, 86959, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a very softly lit subject and I wish the middle tree had more substance to it; a little darker. That way it would better match the contrast of the foreground which is very dark. I really like the volumetric lighting and the way the light pokes through the tree. Very good effort. 8</td>', 'This is a very softly lit subject and I wish the middle tree had more substance to it; a little darker. That way it would better match the contrast of the foreground which is very dark. I really like the volumetric lighting and the way the light pokes through the tree. Very good effort. 8', '2004-07-06 01:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(797319, 81045, 8054, '<td valign="top">HAHA! Great designs on the back of the ladybug! Maybe try flames and a car # or even add some sponsors. Very original! Next time put more negative space in the front vs center the insect. 7</td>', 'HAHA! Great designs on the back of the ladybug! Maybe try flames and a car # or even add some sponsors. Very original! Next time put more negative space in the front vs center the insect. 7', '2004-07-06 01:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(797320, 87139, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is poster material. Very nice.</td>', 'This is poster material. Very nice.', '2004-07-06 01:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(797326, 85342, 8054, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh! I read the title out loud a few times and kept laughing. I also love the symmetry between the plant that the fly is resting on and the background. My only real complaint is the fly itself which seems a bit too sharp. My minor complaint is that it''s too centered but it seems to fit. I probably would have put the fly more to the left of the frame since that is the direction it seems to be facing (for the most part). Great job! 8</td>', 'This one made me laugh! I read the title out loud a few times and kept laughing. I also love the symmetry between the plant that the fly is resting on and the background. My only real complaint is the fly itself which seems a bit too sharp. My minor complaint is that it''s too centered but it seems to fit. I probably would have put the fly more to the left of the frame since that is the direction it seems to be facing (for the most part). Great job! 8', '2004-07-06 01:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(797328, 86483, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter for the free study. I love how the smoke trains the eye to follow towards the plane. Negative space is perfect and so is the cropping. Smart choice going with b/w, as well. 10</td>', 'Excellent subject matter for the free study. I love how the smoke trains the eye to follow towards the plane. Negative space is perfect and so is the cropping. Smart choice going with b/w, as well. 10', '2004-07-06 01:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(797333, 84364, 8054, '<td valign="top">I really like this entry a lot. Lighting, composition, focus, cropping...all perfect. What''s wrong with it? Color balance seems a bit biased towards blue. The trees do not appear black (what I would expect considering the time this was taken) but have a blue and red tint. 6</td>', 'I really like this entry a lot. Lighting, composition, focus, cropping...all perfect. What''s wrong with it? Color balance seems a bit biased towards blue. The trees do not appear black (what I would expect considering the time this was taken) but have a blue and red tint. 6', '2004-07-06 01:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(797335, 86996, 8054, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you played with the idea of using the wall to create the other half of the Washington Monument instead of using it to make a second one. I do like the current version, however. I also like how you kept the names blurred to keep them anonymous but we can still see them as names. 5</td>', 'Don''t know if you played with the idea of using the wall to create the other half of the Washington Monument instead of using it to make a second one. I do like the current version, however. I also like how you kept the names blurred to keep them anonymous but we can still see them as names. 5', '2004-07-06 01:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(797336, 84347, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very impressive macro. Normally I don''t cringe at insects but this one does it to me. I guess it''s all the details I can see. Lot of tiny little hairs...black beady eyes...&lt;shudder&gt;. Although this one appears to be a female spider with the long eyelashes, LOL! Great focus and DOF and all that stuff. 10</td>', 'Very impressive macro. Normally I don''t cringe at insects but this one does it to me. I guess it''s all the details I can see. Lot of tiny little hairs...black beady eyes...<shudder>. Although this one appears to be a female spider with the long eyelashes, LOL! Great focus and DOF and all that stuff. 10', '2004-07-06 01:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(797338, 86628, 8054, '<td valign="top">Photo feels slightly tilted to the left. Other than that, nice soft focus and use of natural light.</td>', 'Photo feels slightly tilted to the left. Other than that, nice soft focus and use of natural light.', '2004-07-06 02:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(797340, 86457, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like the strong contrast type of photo but I think the top of the sky was darkened a bit too much and is a bit distracting. Details of eveything from the trees to the rocks on the mountains to the distant clouds is amazing.</td>', 'I like the strong contrast type of photo but I think the top of the sky was darkened a bit too much and is a bit distracting. Details of eveything from the trees to the rocks on the mountains to the distant clouds is amazing.', '2004-07-06 02:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(797342, 84695, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is a dramatic landscape/marine photo then I take the title into account. I had to struggle to locate the lighthouse. I presume it''s the tiny thing on the top of the rocks. Contrast is also a bit dark and flat.</td>', 'This is a dramatic landscape/marine photo then I take the title into account. I had to struggle to locate the lighthouse. I presume it''s the tiny thing on the top of the rocks. Contrast is also a bit dark and flat.', '2004-07-06 02:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(797345, 83036, 12160, '<td valign="top">Awesome image. Great colors and interesting silhouette.</td>', 'Awesome image. Great colors and interesting silhouette.', '2004-07-06 02:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(797349, 86512, 12160, '<td valign="top">Simple yet very powerful image.</td>', 'Simple yet very powerful image.', '2004-07-06 02:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(797354, 85659, 22967, '<td valign="top">Cute photo, but the flash seems pretty harsh, try either cutting down the intensity, bouncing the beam upwards, using a reflector, or using a diffuser. Also, try to capture a more natural, playful moment.</td>', 'Cute photo, but the flash seems pretty harsh, try either cutting down the intensity, bouncing the beam upwards, using a reflector, or using a diffuser. Also, try to capture a more natural, playful moment.', '2004-07-06 03:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(797355, 86638, 22967, '<td valign="top">Try a tighter, more creative crop, especially when you are resizing for the web.</td>', 'Try a tighter, more creative crop, especially when you are resizing for the web.', '2004-07-06 03:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(797357, 85610, 22967, '<td valign="top">Could be a great shot, next time try shooting during better lighting. Also, I''m not sure if you were going for a soft focus or the heat was causing it, but  the shot seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Could be a great shot, next time try shooting during better lighting. Also, I''m not sure if you were going for a soft focus or the heat was causing it, but  the shot seems a bit out of focus.', '2004-07-06 03:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
