(797452, 87102, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty well done shot technically, but I might have blurred the road a bit more, or tried to get rid of it all together.  Based on some threads I have seen, you might be able to rubber stamp it out within the rules of an advanced challenge.  On the interest scale, a picture of a cat is always going to have a difficult time against some of the other entries.</td>', 'This is a pretty well done shot technically, but I might have blurred the road a bit more, or tried to get rid of it all together.  Based on some threads I have seen, you might be able to rubber stamp it out within the rules of an advanced challenge.  On the interest scale, a picture of a cat is always going to have a difficult time against some of the other entries.', '2004-07-06 07:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
