(797565, 85426, 9411, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. The ducks reflections are very nice element. The crop on the bottom is a bit tight as is the right hand side.  I really like the almost panoramic composition.</td>', 'Lovely image. The ducks reflections are very nice element. The crop on the bottom is a bit tight as is the right hand side.  I really like the almost panoramic composition.', '2004-07-06 10:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(797569, 86409, 9411, '<td valign="top">Stunning work.  I have a feeling this is one of those images, that, if we were able to view it with a darker surround, ti would show even more detail.  The textures are wonderful.. love the toning and composition.</td>', 'Stunning work.  I have a feeling this is one of those images, that, if we were able to view it with a darker surround, ti would show even more detail.  The textures are wonderful.. love the toning and composition.', '2004-07-06 10:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(797571, 86568, 4767, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Long title.  I like the diversity within the shot.  Silhouetted palms,  dramatic clouds and a powerful surf.  In the distance, the beckoning Diamond Head.</td>', 'Lovely photo. Long title.  I like the diversity within the shot.  Silhouetted palms,  dramatic clouds and a powerful surf.  In the distance, the beckoning Diamond Head.', '2004-07-06 10:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(797572, 86870, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wow... Great image with interesting elements.  The duck is well detailed and nicely positioned in the frame.  The water and reflections are really the star in my opinion.  Excellent light control and dof.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Wow... Great image with interesting elements.  The duck is well detailed and nicely positioned in the frame.  The water and reflections are really the star in my opinion.  Excellent light control and dof.  Nicely done.', '2004-07-06 10:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(797574, 85687, 4767, '<td valign="top">Possibly the best de-sat in this contest.  I like it!</td>', 'Possibly the best de-sat in this contest.  I like it!', '2004-07-06 10:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(797578, 86597, 4767, '<td valign="top">GREAT clouds!</td>', 'GREAT clouds!', '2004-07-06 10:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(797581, 83041, 4767, '<td valign="top">interesting that the moon/sun? should appear light in a dark sky.  A very graphic and pleasing image, imho.</td>', 'interesting that the moon/sun? should appear light in a dark sky.  A very graphic and pleasing image, imho.', '2004-07-06 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(797654, 81239, 3724, '<td valign="top">Dark reds and greens on the blue-black back is beautiful.  Good design - center placement is fine.  The woven focus is acceptable.   Curious illumination - dramatic but realistic  play of light on these iris seems to reach the limits of bright and dark.   Hot spots with lack of detail don''t bother me like they usually do, seems to work in this view.  Intermediate  and dark shadows complement the bright areas.</td>', 'Dark reds and greens on the blue-black back is beautiful.  Good design - center placement is fine.  The woven focus is acceptable.   Curious illumination - dramatic but realistic  play of light on these iris seems to reach the limits of bright and dark.   Hot spots with lack of detail don''t bother me like they usually do, seems to work in this view.  Intermediate  and dark shadows complement the bright areas.', '2004-07-06 11:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(797660, 86507, 3724, '<td valign="top">Positive and negative space created by the green back peeking through the red petals  is striking.</td>', 'Positive and negative space created by the green back peeking through the red petals  is striking.', '2004-07-06 11:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(797669, 86091, 16241, '<td valign="top">surreal</td>', 'surreal', '2004-07-06 11:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
