(797828, 84771, 9411, '<td valign="top">Stunning work. simple effective and perfectly executed.  10  I just had to come back and say,, I think this is, quite possibly, a perfect image.  Bravo!</td>', 'Stunning work. simple effective and perfectly executed.  10  I just had to come back and say,, I think this is, quite possibly, a perfect image.  Bravo!', '2004-07-06 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(797834, 86957, 20779, '<td valign="top">Good focus and lighting; I would have liked to see more color and interest to hold my eyes.</td>', 'Good focus and lighting; I would have liked to see more color and interest to hold my eyes.', '2004-07-06 14:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(797835, 84379, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. I love the detail on the bee, who is the star of this shot. THe flowers are overpowering him, how ever. They are so busy and plentiful the bee is getting a bit lost. There are some overexposed areas on the petals. Your depth of field is almost perfect.  I realize this is a very hard image to get spot on.  My one suggestion would be a slight desaturation of the flowers to help that stunning bee stand out.  8</td>', 'Wonderful. I love the detail on the bee, who is the star of this shot. THe flowers are overpowering him, how ever. They are so busy and plentiful the bee is getting a bit lost. There are some overexposed areas on the petals. Your depth of field is almost perfect.  I realize this is a very hard image to get spot on.  My one suggestion would be a slight desaturation of the flowers to help that stunning bee stand out.  8', '2004-07-06 14:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(797841, 86626, 20779, '<td valign="top">Sky is very nice, but the house appears too darkened in the shadows on my monitor. I think I may have used less cropping and something more in the photo to add "interest".</td>', 'Sky is very nice, but the house appears too darkened in the shadows on my monitor. I think I may have used less cropping and something more in the photo to add "interest".', '2004-07-06 14:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(797844, 81045, 9411, '<td valign="top">Fascinating creature. I''ve never seen marking like that before. I love the high key treatment, just enough shadow to give definition to your subject. The wee bit of motion blur mirrors your title well. The only negative I see to comment on is, the slight lack of definition on the lower head and neck (do they have necks?) Otherwise an excellent image. 8</td>', 'Fascinating creature. I''ve never seen marking like that before. I love the high key treatment, just enough shadow to give definition to your subject. The wee bit of motion blur mirrors your title well. The only negative I see to comment on is, the slight lack of definition on the lower head and neck (do they have necks?) Otherwise an excellent image. 8', '2004-07-06 14:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(797847, 86964, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very serene scene, but I find myself not held for long. The center has an oddly smooth blur that looks as if the texture were cloned out. I obviously don''t know what processing was or wasn''t used; this is just how it appears on my monitor.</td>', 'Very serene scene, but I find myself not held for long. The center has an oddly smooth blur that looks as if the texture were cloned out. I obviously don''t know what processing was or wasn''t used; this is just how it appears on my monitor.', '2004-07-06 14:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(797848, 84379, 4090, '<td valign="top">wow ..... stunning photo 10</td>', 'wow ..... stunning photo 10', '2004-07-06 14:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(797850, 85595, 9411, '<td valign="top">These little guys are natural hams. And may be rapidly becoming one of the most photographed creatures in the world.  You ''ve nicely captured the classic "smile" there are excellent details in the fur.  It is just lacking that WOW factor that makes an image pop off the screen.  That said, I''ve been looking at him/her for quite some time now, so obviously ther is merit to the image.  The crop is just a bit tight on top, I feel, other than that, nicely done.  8</td>', 'These little guys are natural hams. And may be rapidly becoming one of the most photographed creatures in the world.  You ''ve nicely captured the classic "smile" there are excellent details in the fur.  It is just lacking that WOW factor that makes an image pop off the screen.  That said, I''ve been looking at him/her for quite some time now, so obviously ther is merit to the image.  The crop is just a bit tight on top, I feel, other than that, nicely done.  8', '2004-07-06 14:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(797851, 86855, 20779, '<td valign="top">The eyes are a somewhat disturbing for me to look at, but that is a personal "taste" thing. On my monitor, the focus is blurred and the colors appear somewhat "muddy".</td>', 'The eyes are a somewhat disturbing for me to look at, but that is a personal "taste" thing. On my monitor, the focus is blurred and the colors appear somewhat "muddy".', '2004-07-06 14:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(797852, 85700, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice composition, perhaps just a bit too busy ideally.</td>', 'Very, very nice composition, perhaps just a bit too busy ideally.', '2004-07-06 14:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(797855, 83188, 20779, '<td valign="top">I obviously don''t know what your vision was, but for my taste, the blur is too extreme and covers too much area. The flower also appears to be squashed up against glass, giving it a less appealing look IMO.</td>', 'I obviously don''t know what your vision was, but for my taste, the blur is too extreme and covers too much area. The flower also appears to be squashed up against glass, giving it a less appealing look IMO.', '2004-07-06 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(797857, 86999, 20779, '<td valign="top">Lovely flower; I would have liked to see more color, though. IMO, de-sat works best with one deeply saturated color rather than more neutral ones. Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Lovely flower; I would have liked to see more color, though. IMO, de-sat works best with one deeply saturated color rather than more neutral ones. Focus is a bit soft.', '2004-07-06 14:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(797859, 86566, 20779, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably already heard this more than enough times, but I am sure you are losing "points" for the small size of your photo. The flower is beautiful, but the flocus is too soft throughout the picture to do it justice IMO.</td>', 'You''ve probably already heard this more than enough times, but I am sure you are losing "points" for the small size of your photo. The flower is beautiful, but the flocus is too soft throughout the picture to do it justice IMO.', '2004-07-06 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
