(798649, 83041, 8624, '<td valign="top">my gut reaction was that I didn''t like this, but for some reason I kept looking and it gets interesting. The sky gradient is very pleasing as it the different gray tones in the hills. nice job with a creative effort.</td>', 'my gut reaction was that I didn''t like this, but for some reason I kept looking and it gets interesting. The sky gradient is very pleasing as it the different gray tones in the hills. nice job with a creative effort.', '2004-07-06 22:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
