(798661, 87150, 7560, '<td valign="top">This is one of the strongest street portraits I;ve seen on the site. You really capture the focus and intensity of the rider in this shot. The goggles and helmet really add to it by removing almost all recognizable elements to the face but the eyes. I''d try using a polarizer to cut the small amount of glare present. Without fail, this is my top portrait for this challenge. 9</td>', 'This is one of the strongest street portraits I;ve seen on the site. You really capture the focus and intensity of the rider in this shot. The goggles and helmet really add to it by removing almost all recognizable elements to the face but the eyes. I''d try using a polarizer to cut the small amount of glare present. Without fail, this is my top portrait for this challenge. 9', '2004-07-06 22:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(798663, 85741, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the expression on her face. I''d crop a bit tighter on the right. Very nice 6</td>', 'I love the expression on her face. I''d crop a bit tighter on the right. Very nice 6', '2004-07-06 22:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(798665, 85426, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity and sharpness of this shot. I''d almost crop out the duck on the right and pull it tighter. You have a great natural symmetry shot that way. 6</td>', 'I love the clarity and sharpness of this shot. I''d almost crop out the duck on the right and pull it tighter. You have a great natural symmetry shot that way. 6', '2004-07-06 22:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
