(798778, 86418, 9747, '<td valign="top">Love this landscape! The five trees lined up is very striking and is a wonderful focal point of the picture. Wish the picture was bigger, also I think it needs a little more contrast. Excellent choice in making this B&amp;W, that helped give it a "flavor". (Though I''m curious to see what it looks like in color.) Beautiful scenery!</td>', 'Love this landscape! The five trees lined up is very striking and is a wonderful focal point of the picture. Wish the picture was bigger, also I think it needs a little more contrast. Excellent choice in making this B&W, that helped give it a "flavor". (Though I''m curious to see what it looks like in color.) Beautiful scenery!', '2004-07-06 23:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(798792, 86445, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very solemn scene, excellently done. I think the glow/blur needs to be toned down a bit. Even so, it''s a great picture and the bright colors of the flag in the center amidst the greys and greens pulled everything together. Maybe if the borders were thicker, it would nicely frame the whole scene and help carry the attention towards the center.</td>', 'Very solemn scene, excellently done. I think the glow/blur needs to be toned down a bit. Even so, it''s a great picture and the bright colors of the flag in the center amidst the greys and greens pulled everything together. Maybe if the borders were thicker, it would nicely frame the whole scene and help carry the attention towards the center.', '2004-07-06 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(798801, 86517, 9747, '<td valign="top">This makes for a great stock picture. Although the shadows under the giraffe''s eye is somewhat distracting. Would have liked to see more of its neck. Love the sky and clouds! Very nice shot.</td>', 'This makes for a great stock picture. Although the shadows under the giraffe''s eye is somewhat distracting. Would have liked to see more of its neck. Love the sky and clouds! Very nice shot.', '2004-07-06 23:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(798815, 86566, 9747, '<td valign="top">Wow, great action capture! Alas, the picture is too small. Would be nice if the DOF were a bit shallower too (so that the background would be more blurred and bring attention to the bee/flower). All in all, a good shot!</td>', 'Wow, great action capture! Alas, the picture is too small. Would be nice if the DOF were a bit shallower too (so that the background would be more blurred and bring attention to the bee/flower). All in all, a good shot!', '2004-07-06 23:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
