(798831, 86604, 9747, '<td valign="top">This gave me a grin. Y''know what might''ve been cooler? Drip a bit of apple sauce or juice on the guy''s forehead... that would have been great for dramatic/shock effect! ;-) Maybe crop a bit of the right side to help bring the focus to the guy. Great choice of the background, I like the low-hanging branches. Good idea in bringing out the colors of the apple and arrow. Very nicely done!</td>', 'This gave me a grin. Y''know what might''ve been cooler? Drip a bit of apple sauce or juice on the guy''s forehead... that would have been great for dramatic/shock effect! ;-) Maybe crop a bit of the right side to help bring the focus to the guy. Great choice of the background, I like the low-hanging branches. Good idea in bringing out the colors of the apple and arrow. Very nicely done!', '2004-07-07 00:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
