(799736, 86800, 13602, '<td valign="top">Let me guess, this takes place in Iceland? :)) Beautiful image anyways, well done!</td>', 'Let me guess, this takes place in Iceland? :)) Beautiful image anyways, well done!', '2004-07-07 08:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(799740, 84310, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very sensual image. Nice detail. But I think you could have filled in the face a bit more. There are few shadows under her arm which are not too appealing.</td>', 'Very sensual image. Nice detail. But I think you could have filled in the face a bit more. There are few shadows under her arm which are not too appealing.', '2004-07-07 08:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(799742, 86409, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, great composition. Very powerful image.</td>', 'Beautiful tones, great composition. Very powerful image.', '2004-07-07 08:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(799902, 85837, 5391, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I''m trying to think of the name of the guy who used to take pictures of celebrities while in "mid jump".  He said that was a great way to take a picture of a person and find out who they really were, because people let it all go when they''re jumping.  I like the group effect.  Lighting is a little spotty, but it''s a fun, creative picture.  Made me smile.  8</td>', 'I love it.  I''m trying to think of the name of the guy who used to take pictures of celebrities while in "mid jump".  He said that was a great way to take a picture of a person and find out who they really were, because people let it all go when they''re jumping.  I like the group effect.  Lighting is a little spotty, but it''s a fun, creative picture.  Made me smile.  8', '2004-07-07 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(799905, 85687, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the low angle that includes the building and how you''ve played with the desaturation.  9</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the low angle that includes the building and how you''ve played with the desaturation.  9', '2004-07-07 11:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(799955, 82739, 23912, '<td valign="top">a little blurry in the background. I just don''t get the title, spring colors?</td>', 'a little blurry in the background. I just don''t get the title, spring colors?', '2004-07-07 11:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(799959, 85176, 23912, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2004-07-07 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(799967, 83748, 23912, '<td valign="top">Lightning is so hard to capture, but you have done so, extraordinarily! Great job!</td>', 'Lightning is so hard to capture, but you have done so, extraordinarily! Great job!', '2004-07-07 11:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(799969, 87012, 23912, '<td valign="top">Her eyes say it all...hubba bubba!!! I like this natural shot!</td>', 'Her eyes say it all...hubba bubba!!! I like this natural shot!', '2004-07-07 11:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(799971, 82511, 1368, '<td valign="top">Scary but beautiful, lovely shadows it almost looks unreal, good job :)</td>', 'Scary but beautiful, lovely shadows it almost looks unreal, good job :)', '2004-07-07 11:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(799977, 86958, 23912, '<td valign="top">I love this picture and the caption actually fits it perfectly!</td>', 'I love this picture and the caption actually fits it perfectly!', '2004-07-07 11:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(799981, 86338, 23912, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking!</td>', 'Breathtaking!', '2004-07-07 11:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(800026, 86959, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb image.  The muted colors give it a very relaxing feel.  Definitely in the top few - and that''s hard in a challnge with so many great entries.</td>', 'Superb image.  The muted colors give it a very relaxing feel.  Definitely in the top few - and that''s hard in a challnge with so many great entries.', '2004-07-07 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(800030, 86409, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and the great pose help make this a very mysterious image.  The sepia is nice but it also makes the white border very obvious.  (My feeling is that if you notice the border, it''s a bit distracting.)<br/> <br/>I expect this to finish in the top group.</td>', 'Perfect lighting and the great pose help make this a very mysterious image.  The sepia is nice but it also makes the white border very obvious.  (My feeling is that if you notice the border, it''s a bit distracting.) I expect this to finish in the top group.', '2004-07-07 12:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(800050, 87006, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve created a very magical image that has a lot of impact.  The dark shape of the tree limbs at the top are especially nice against the yellow leaves.  The only negative comment - true or not - is that it looks a bit "unreal" due to post processing.  (If that''s not so - sorry for the comment.  But no points deducted for that anyway.)  You should finish way up there.</td>', 'You''ve created a very magical image that has a lot of impact.  The dark shape of the tree limbs at the top are especially nice against the yellow leaves.  The only negative comment - true or not - is that it looks a bit "unreal" due to post processing.  (If that''s not so - sorry for the comment.  But no points deducted for that anyway.)  You should finish way up there.', '2004-07-07 12:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(800070, 85238, 19608, '<td valign="top">My oh my - what a classic!  The placement of the barn is perfect - without it the dead centered mountain would be problematic.  The soft colors are remarkable as is the sky''s pallette. The ONLY thing I would do with this is remove the border.<br/> <br/>You should be in the close vicinity to a town called "Ribbonsville."</td>', 'My oh my - what a classic!  The placement of the barn is perfect - without it the dead centered mountain would be problematic.  The soft colors are remarkable as is the sky''s pallette. The ONLY thing I would do with this is remove the border. You should be in the close vicinity to a town called "Ribbonsville."', '2004-07-07 12:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(800095, 84994, 23919, '<td valign="top">wonderfull body and color lines</td>', 'wonderfull body and color lines', '2004-07-07 12:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(800099, 87033, 19608, '<td valign="top">A true work of art.    The only thing that doesn''t work for me is the jogger.  It does provide some scale, but that scale makes the bird seem gigantic.  I love the black background that makes the bird relly pop  and the muted brown in the foreground.  There is a train to a town called "Ribbonsville" you should hear it approaching.</td>', 'A true work of art.    The only thing that doesn''t work for me is the jogger.  It does provide some scale, but that scale makes the bird seem gigantic.  I love the black background that makes the bird relly pop  and the muted brown in the foreground.  There is a train to a town called "Ribbonsville" you should hear it approaching.', '2004-07-07 12:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(800104, 86119, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture and great exposure for a mostly white scene.  Everythuing that needs to be sharp really is.  Not crazy about Latin titles - but I bet a lot of nature photographers love it.</td>', 'Excellent capture and great exposure for a mostly white scene.  Everythuing that needs to be sharp really is.  Not crazy about Latin titles - but I bet a lot of nature photographers love it.', '2004-07-07 12:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(800106, 84513, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This really sings - perfect focus - crisp as can be.  Colors are vibrant and are enhanced by the background colors.  My only complaint is that it''s cropped a bit too close as I''d like to see more of the red top notch (or whatever it is called.)</td>', 'Wow!  This really sings - perfect focus - crisp as can be.  Colors are vibrant and are enhanced by the background colors.  My only complaint is that it''s cropped a bit too close as I''d like to see more of the red top notch (or whatever it is called.)', '2004-07-07 13:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(800116, 86445, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptional image with loads of impact.  Composition is very nice - with the excption that I''d like to see the flag less centered.  The flat lighting is exactly right.  You should finish way high!</td>', 'This is an exceptional image with loads of impact.  Composition is very nice - with the excption that I''d like to see the flag less centered.  The flat lighting is exactly right.  You should finish way high!', '2004-07-07 13:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(800122, 86436, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge and very well done.  The only problem I have is the choice of the whitish hat as it becomes the point of highest contrast.  Everything else, the pose, your model, the setup, lighting......EXCELLENT.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge and very well done.  The only problem I have is the choice of the whitish hat as it becomes the point of highest contrast.  Everything else, the pose, your model, the setup, lighting......EXCELLENT.', '2004-07-07 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(800129, 87012, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is one of those desturations that really works better than ot would in full color.  The black and white rendering is perfect with grat crisp white and loads of black blacks.  Then there''s you model!  What a perfect expression on a lovely young lady.  Were you able to get a shot right as the bubble burst?   I expect you will be up in the straosphere with the score on this.</td>', 'This is one of those desturations that really works better than ot would in full color.  The black and white rendering is perfect with grat crisp white and loads of black blacks.  Then there''s you model!  What a perfect expression on a lovely young lady.  Were you able to get a shot right as the bubble burst?   I expect you will be up in the straosphere with the score on this.', '2004-07-07 13:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(800135, 85061, 19608, '<td valign="top">The blurred background is a very interesting and a good way to highlight the insect - with the exception of the very bright white spot on the bottom left edge. <br/> <br/>The insect is a very small part of the image and is fairly centered - not really as effective as it could be.  Great coilors.</td>', 'The blurred background is a very interesting and a good way to highlight the insect - with the exception of the very bright white spot on the bottom left edge.  The insect is a very small part of the image and is fairly centered - not really as effective as it could be.  Great coilors.', '2004-07-07 13:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(800142, 86566, 11897, '<td valign="top">too small to judge fairly.</td>', 'too small to judge fairly.', '2004-07-07 13:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(800145, 86000, 19608, '<td valign="top">Isn''t Tuscon an amazing place?  I shot that mission over a three-day perion over lNew Year 2003.  Your blue sky is perfect against the white building. Composition is effective and exposure could not be better.</td>', 'Isn''t Tuscon an amazing place?  I shot that mission over a three-day perion over lNew Year 2003.  Your blue sky is perfect against the white building. Composition is effective and exposure could not be better.', '2004-07-07 13:21:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(800168, 86597, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and a wonderful sky make this image really stand out.  It may seem a bit too centered, but the bales in the right background help mitigate that.  The merger between the closest bale and the one behind shouold have been prevented by changing position a bit.</td>', 'Great colors and a wonderful sky make this image really stand out.  It may seem a bit too centered, but the bales in the right background help mitigate that.  The merger between the closest bale and the one behind shouold have been prevented by changing position a bit.', '2004-07-07 13:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(800173, 84307, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a fun image.  Great use of desaturization.</td>', 'What a fun image.  Great use of desaturization.', '2004-07-07 13:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(800177, 86138, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a winner!  I love the layeriung effect of the water, the blac/brown land, the buildings, the two layers of blue mountains and ther three layers of sky.    Lighting on the clouds is exquisite.</td>', 'You have a winner!  I love the layeriung effect of the water, the blac/brown land, the buildings, the two layers of blue mountains and ther three layers of sky.    Lighting on the clouds is exquisite.', '2004-07-07 13:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(800181, 86611, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your idea is great and with an excellent model.  I really like the lighting on the model but find the light reflection on the glass very obtrusive.  The highest point of contrast is the white against blak in the border - which means it does NOT work.  Not sure the black gloves work that well - may be better without them - or with a different color.</td>', 'Your idea is great and with an excellent model.  I really like the lighting on the model but find the light reflection on the glass very obtrusive.  The highest point of contrast is the white against blak in the border - which means it does NOT work.  Not sure the black gloves work that well - may be better without them - or with a different color.', '2004-07-07 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(800186, 86963, 19608, '<td valign="top">I just did Yosemite''s 4-mile trail from Glacier Point to the valley two days ago - what a perfect hike.  Your image is a great rendering of this trail.  I really like how you used the reddish-brown dirt to provide some additional color.  Composition is also very nice with the curvey line of the path walking you through the image.</td>', 'I just did Yosemite''s 4-mile trail from Glacier Point to the valley two days ago - what a perfect hike.  Your image is a great rendering of this trail.  I really like how you used the reddish-brown dirt to provide some additional color.  Composition is also very nice with the curvey line of the path walking you through the image.', '2004-07-07 13:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(800189, 85220, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great use of slow shutter speed and apeture to creat both the car streaks and the star burst of the lights.  Your time of day could not be better - capturing the deep blue post sunset sky perfectly.  The lighting on the small arches is wonderful.</td>', 'Great use of slow shutter speed and apeture to creat both the car streaks and the star burst of the lights.  Your time of day could not be better - capturing the deep blue post sunset sky perfectly.  The lighting on the small arches is wonderful.', '2004-07-07 13:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(800195, 87141, 19608, '<td valign="top">Pure childhood in a Norman Rockwall scene.  It is a perfect image with the possible exception that the grass in the bright area surrounding the boy seems a biot artificial.  You should finish very high as it really is an "extraordinary"  image.</td>', 'Pure childhood in a Norman Rockwall scene.  It is a perfect image with the possible exception that the grass in the bright area surrounding the boy seems a biot artificial.  You should finish very high as it really is an "extraordinary"  image.', '2004-07-07 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(800204, 84771, 19608, '<td valign="top">A true work of art - very well planned an executed.  Lighting on the wheat is exceptional as is the composition.  Perfect focus - must have been no wind at all (assuming it was done outdoors.)  Backgroun sky and stars are the final great touch.  You should score very high - but the competition is truly tough this time.</td>', 'A true work of art - very well planned an executed.  Lighting on the wheat is exceptional as is the composition.  Perfect focus - must have been no wind at all (assuming it was done outdoors.)  Backgroun sky and stars are the final great touch.  You should score very high - but the competition is truly tough this time.', '2004-07-07 13:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(800208, 85943, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very vibrant colors made even moreso by your choice of a black background.  Perfect composition and DoF..  The water drops add a very nice touch.  Border does nothing for me at all.</td>', 'Very vibrant colors made even moreso by your choice of a black background.  Perfect composition and DoF..  The water drops add a very nice touch.  Border does nothing for me at all.', '2004-07-07 14:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(800214, 86499, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice capture of a very "fun" scene.  Your shutter speed was just right for the water.  The foreground at the bottom is a bit distracting and could easily be cropped.  The fact that you mentioned  it''s a candid shot make it seem like you are asking us to overlook some flaws.  The title would be far better without the parenthetical part.</td>', 'A very nice capture of a very "fun" scene.  Your shutter speed was just right for the water.  The foreground at the bottom is a bit distracting and could easily be cropped.  The fact that you mentioned  it''s a candid shot make it seem like you are asking us to overlook some flaws.  The title would be far better without the parenthetical part.', '2004-07-07 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(800215, 81973, 19184, '<td valign="top">The plane and tree are a bit blurry.  Could be a nice photo if it wasn''t for this.  I like the color of the sky.</td>', 'The plane and tree are a bit blurry.  Could be a nice photo if it wasn''t for this.  I like the color of the sky.', '2004-07-07 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(800236, 87101, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting - without it, this would be a nice "record shot."  With this lighting, it becomes a real winner.  Compositioin is very well done.</td>', 'Perfect lighting - without it, this would be a nice "record shot."  With this lighting, it becomes a real winner.  Compositioin is very well done.', '2004-07-07 14:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(800239, 86256, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great seeing. This becomes a very graphic and abstract image with pleasing lines shapes and colors.  You''ve already "de centered" the shoreline "horizon" - but I''d suggest you take even a bit more off the top - leaving about 1/3 of the image as the scene and 2/3 of the image as the reflection.</td>', 'Great seeing. This becomes a very graphic and abstract image with pleasing lines shapes and colors.  You''ve already "de centered" the shoreline "horizon" - but I''d suggest you take even a bit more off the top - leaving about 1/3 of the image as the scene and 2/3 of the image as the reflection.', '2004-07-07 14:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(800248, 87084, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your idea was very good - as the back lighting really brings out the texture of the cloth.  But - the bottom line is that there is not much to explore in the image.</td>', 'Your idea was very good - as the back lighting really brings out the texture of the cloth.  But - the bottom line is that there is not much to explore in the image.', '2004-07-07 14:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(800252, 87079, 17203, '<td valign="top">A fun image- I like the playfulness. Make sure you rotate next time to get the fenceposts vertical- that''s a faux pas around here. ;-)</td>', 'A fun image- I like the playfulness. Make sure you rotate next time to get the fenceposts vertical- that''s a faux pas around here. ;-)', '2004-07-07 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(800253, 85945, 19608, '<td valign="top">A reallly nice idea but unfortunately the print is really flat or muddy.  It doesn''t have a ny real crisp whites of dep deep blacks.  Border is not bad - but it isn''t really needed either.</td>', 'A reallly nice idea but unfortunately the print is really flat or muddy.  It doesn''t have a ny real crisp whites of dep deep blacks.  Border is not bad - but it isn''t really needed either.', '2004-07-07 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(800256, 87141, 17203, '<td valign="top">Whether intentional or not, I like the watercolor look. The highlights are a little overexposed, but very nice composition. 7</td>', 'Whether intentional or not, I like the watercolor look. The highlights are a little overexposed, but very nice composition. 7', '2004-07-07 14:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(800261, 83041, 17203, '<td valign="top">I hate overly processed images... except this one. ;-) A very frame-worthy approach to an otherwise mundane scene, and very appropriate for a Free Study. I wish the top wasn''t so brown (shift the color to purple or deep red maybe), but that''s just my personal taste. 8</td>', 'I hate overly processed images... except this one. ;-) A very frame-worthy approach to an otherwise mundane scene, and very appropriate for a Free Study. I wish the top wasn''t so brown (shift the color to purple or deep red maybe), but that''s just my personal taste. 8', '2004-07-07 14:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(800266, 84740, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and light. I''d like to see the whole scene shifted so the second tree on the right is cropped out, and more there''s water on the left. The focus appears soft, as if you cropped in a lot, but still one of the better shots in this group. Well done! 8</td>', 'Beautiful color and light. I''d like to see the whole scene shifted so the second tree on the right is cropped out, and more there''s water on the left. The focus appears soft, as if you cropped in a lot, but still one of the better shots in this group. Well done! 8', '2004-07-07 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(800274, 86584, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great image, though the cropping is a little tight for my taste. The contrast between building and sky is very striking. I see plenty of detail in the white areas, but I do think you could have underexposed a bit to hold even more. I probably would have sat here for a few hours if necessary waiting for a bird to pass by for additional interest.</td>', 'Great image, though the cropping is a little tight for my taste. The contrast between building and sky is very striking. I see plenty of detail in the white areas, but I do think you could have underexposed a bit to hold even more. I probably would have sat here for a few hours if necessary waiting for a bird to pass by for additional interest.', '2004-07-07 14:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(800285, 82862, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Good color and reflections on the water. I''d like a little sharper focus for more detail (maybe you had to crop too much?), and I think that left storage tank could be cropped out. Whenever I see a good sky or twilight photo, I complain to myself that there are too many trees in my area. This is about 30 minutes from my house, so thanks for ruining that excuse for me! ;-)</td>', 'Nicely done. Good color and reflections on the water. I''d like a little sharper focus for more detail (maybe you had to crop too much?), and I think that left storage tank could be cropped out. Whenever I see a good sky or twilight photo, I complain to myself that there are too many trees in my area. This is about 30 minutes from my house, so thanks for ruining that excuse for me! ;-)', '2004-07-07 14:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(800288, 86091, 17203, '<td valign="top">It''s raining men! Hey... wasn''t there a song to that effect? A little dark, but good color and composition on this unusual find.</td>', 'It''s raining men! Hey... wasn''t there a song to that effect? A little dark, but good color and composition on this unusual find.', '2004-07-07 14:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(800318, 87017, 9668, '<td valign="top">Simple, nice tones, good composition. Should do well.</td>', 'Simple, nice tones, good composition. Should do well.', '2004-07-07 15:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(800332, 86600, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I have aheron on my lake.. if only I had a 300mm lens!! :-)</td>', 'Great capture! I have aheron on my lake.. if only I had a 300mm lens!! :-)', '2004-07-07 15:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(800335, 87100, 11897, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, maybe a tad more saturation but as it is ..great</td>', 'Beautifully done, maybe a tad more saturation but as it is ..great', '2004-07-07 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(800336, 84365, 11897, '<td valign="top">stunning 10</td>', 'stunning 10', '2004-07-07 15:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(800338, 85041, 11897, '<td valign="top">I think the missing wing may cost you a ribbon. A beauty.  9</td>', 'I think the missing wing may cost you a ribbon. A beauty.  9', '2004-07-07 15:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(800340, 84067, 11897, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image</td>', 'Wonderful image', '2004-07-07 15:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(800341, 81045, 4482, '<td valign="top">Awwwww! man! I want cool bugs like that here!! great one! 8</td>', 'Awwwww! man! I want cool bugs like that here!! great one! 8', '2004-07-07 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(800343, 83121, 11897, '<td valign="top">I feel it is a little too over processed. Probably make a very nice print though.</td>', 'I feel it is a little too over processed. Probably make a very nice print though.', '2004-07-07 15:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(800346, 86933, 2612, '<td valign="top">The backlight creates a nice rim around the subject, but I think you need some more light from the front as well. A simple reflector (white shirt, white poster board, etc) or some fill flash would have helped.</td>', 'The backlight creates a nice rim around the subject, but I think you need some more light from the front as well. A simple reflector (white shirt, white poster board, etc) or some fill flash would have helped.', '2004-07-07 15:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
