(800582, 87064, 2612, '<td valign="top">Wonderful view of a poppy. I love the lighting and the way you have layered the petals. Only point that I might discuss would be to show less of the center (forget what that''s called). All I would need to see is the very edge to help identify the subject and then just let the user flow up through the layered petals.</td>', 'Wonderful view of a poppy. I love the lighting and the way you have layered the petals. Only point that I might discuss would be to show less of the center (forget what that''s called). All I would need to see is the very edge to help identify the subject and then just let the user flow up through the layered petals.', '2004-07-07 17:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
