(800676, 86835, 8125, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot the first time I saw the thumbnail and still continue to every time I come back to it.  The colors are really what draws my eye, between the blue sky and green grass... the composition and lighting are good too.  There are a few annoying shadows, but it''s not something I noticed until I really inspected the photo.</td>', 'I liked this shot the first time I saw the thumbnail and still continue to every time I come back to it.  The colors are really what draws my eye, between the blue sky and green grass... the composition and lighting are good too.  There are a few annoying shadows, but it''s not something I noticed until I really inspected the photo.', '2004-07-07 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
