(800680, 83350, 14781, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!!!</td>', 'Great portrait!!!', '2004-07-07 18:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(800687, 86582, 8125, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful area... My advice would be to zoom in closer on this one so you don''t get the sunny spot on top.  There is also something about it that just doesn''t seem really crisp or maybe it''s just my monitor....</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful area... My advice would be to zoom in closer on this one so you don''t get the sunny spot on top.  There is also something about it that just doesn''t seem really crisp or maybe it''s just my monitor....', '2004-07-07 18:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(800689, 83392, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!!  Good color, composition and lighting - can''t ask for a better sports shooting situation!</td>', 'Great action shot!!  Good color, composition and lighting - can''t ask for a better sports shooting situation!', '2004-07-07 18:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(800690, 81724, 8125, '<td valign="top">wow... great capture.  How much zoom did you have to use for this one?  Excellent use of lighting...</td>', 'wow... great capture.  How much zoom did you have to use for this one?  Excellent use of lighting...', '2004-07-07 18:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(800696, 84486, 8125, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal range you used with this shot - it gives the solitary feel one would experience being out there in the middle of summer.  (I know from experience!)  :-)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like the tonal range you used with this shot - it gives the solitary feel one would experience being out there in the middle of summer.  (I know from experience!)  :-) ', '2004-07-07 18:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(800698, 84284, 8125, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the centered composition in this particular shot.  The tree itself is interesting, but not enough to hold it''s own in a photo.  You might try to find something else in this area where you can include the tree as an element of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the centered composition in this particular shot.  The tree itself is interesting, but not enough to hold it''s own in a photo.  You might try to find something else in this area where you can include the tree as an element of the photo.', '2004-07-07 18:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(800708, 85160, 8125, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little bland in this shot and the Eagle looks like it could use some sharpening.  Great capture though, I would love to have an opportunity to photograph a Bald Eagle someday.</td>', 'The colors are a little bland in this shot and the Eagle looks like it could use some sharpening.  Great capture though, I would love to have an opportunity to photograph a Bald Eagle someday.', '2004-07-07 18:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(800715, 85238, 8125, '<td valign="top">This looks like a painting, what a beautiful scene...</td>', 'This looks like a painting, what a beautiful scene...', '2004-07-07 18:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(800716, 83188, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful imagery.  I like the soft focus and luminescence.  Is this effect straight from the camera or from post processing?  If the former, I''d love to know how you got it to turn out this well.</td>', 'Beautiful imagery.  I like the soft focus and luminescence.  Is this effect straight from the camera or from post processing?  If the former, I''d love to know how you got it to turn out this well.', '2004-07-07 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(800718, 85595, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  These little guys are cute.  Love the expression you caught.  Great lighting in this shot also... very nice  :-)</td>', 'Great capture!  These little guys are cute.  Love the expression you caught.  Great lighting in this shot also... very nice  :-)', '2004-07-07 18:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(800721, 86476, 8125, '<td valign="top">I would love to see this same shot with the same lighting on a solid black background...  the wooden apple is an interesting subject to work with...</td>', 'I would love to see this same shot with the same lighting on a solid black background...  the wooden apple is an interesting subject to work with...', '2004-07-07 18:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(800722, 87017, 509, '<td valign="top">Strong focus and background selection.  I''ve seen similar type shots here before and yours is well done.</td>', 'Strong focus and background selection.  I''ve seen similar type shots here before and yours is well done.', '2004-07-07 18:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(800724, 86483, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great capture and love the use of b/w</td>', 'Great capture and love the use of b/w', '2004-07-07 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(800731, 86624, 8125, '<td valign="top">The bright spots in the sunglasses are distracting...</td>', 'The bright spots in the sunglasses are distracting...', '2004-07-07 18:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(800738, 85659, 509, '<td valign="top">This surely has sentimental value to the photographer, but is technically and artistically bland imho.  The lighting is a bit harsh and unbalanced - bouncing off of the ceiling would be really improve this and eliminate the shadows behind the baby''s head.  If the shampoo bottle is an important part of the composition, I would have placed it differently, otherwise it doesn''t need to be there.  That is a good expression to capture, but the shot suffers from the aforementioned details in my opinion.</td>', 'This surely has sentimental value to the photographer, but is technically and artistically bland imho.  The lighting is a bit harsh and unbalanced - bouncing off of the ceiling would be really improve this and eliminate the shadows behind the baby''s head.  If the shampoo bottle is an important part of the composition, I would have placed it differently, otherwise it doesn''t need to be there.  That is a good expression to capture, but the shot suffers from the aforementioned details in my opinion.', '2004-07-07 18:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(800748, 86769, 509, '<td valign="top">Very good journalistic shot.  Somehow doesn''t quite convey the emotion of the ceremony, but I''m not sure if you were going for that - might be more interesting to show a slightly more angled view (from the back to signify more of a departure, or from the front to show the officers'' faces and give a more personal view).</td>', 'Very good journalistic shot.  Somehow doesn''t quite convey the emotion of the ceremony, but I''m not sure if you were going for that - might be more interesting to show a slightly more angled view (from the back to signify more of a departure, or from the front to show the officers'' faces and give a more personal view).', '2004-07-07 18:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(800753, 86457, 8125, '<td valign="top">An absolutely stunning landscape.  Love the tonal range you used also... my favorite so far in the challenge.  I hope to see it in winners row...</td>', 'An absolutely stunning landscape.  Love the tonal range you used also... my favorite so far in the challenge.  I hope to see it in winners row...', '2004-07-07 18:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(800757, 83375, 509, '<td valign="top">Since the cup of wine is the focus here, I think it might work well if it filled more of the frame.  Still, I''m not certain if I''d rather see more of the cup or more of the couple (in focus).</td>', 'Since the cup of wine is the focus here, I think it might work well if it filled more of the frame.  Still, I''m not certain if I''d rather see more of the cup or more of the couple (in focus).', '2004-07-07 18:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(800758, 87103, 8125, '<td valign="top">Ok, I just found my second favorite in the challenge.  I love this shot!  I wish I knew that girl so I could hang it on the wall - I hope to see this one also in winners row...</td>', 'Ok, I just found my second favorite in the challenge.  I love this shot!  I wish I knew that girl so I could hang it on the wall - I hope to see this one also in winners row...', '2004-07-07 18:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
