(800905, 86483, 2764, '<td valign="top">Do we have a winner?  This photo is classic - talk about leading lines - the smoke trail goes up and back down and straight at us - rule of thirds - contast of textures: smoke, sky, plane - soft background, sharp object - sepia tone to match the era that the plane is from.  Yep, it''s just perfect in every way- 10 of course.</td>', 'Do we have a winner?  This photo is classic - talk about leading lines - the smoke trail goes up and back down and straight at us - rule of thirds - contast of textures: smoke, sky, plane - soft background, sharp object - sepia tone to match the era that the plane is from.  Yep, it''s just perfect in every way- 10 of course.', '2004-07-07 19:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(800907, 83711, 2764, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, interesting DOF,  drab colors, needs something more to give it some punch and make it not boring - maybe saturate the color of the stamens and make them compete with the in focus petal for the center of attention.  maybe lighten up the green of the background?  Make it more high key?  What about converting to black and white?</td>', 'Nice composition, interesting DOF,  drab colors, needs something more to give it some punch and make it not boring - maybe saturate the color of the stamens and make them compete with the in focus petal for the center of attention.  maybe lighten up the green of the background?  Make it more high key?  What about converting to black and white?', '2004-07-07 19:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
