(800925, 86611, 14620, '<td valign="top">Would make for a cool advertisement.  Like the shot it is very good, only slight distractions are the glare on the glass, especially the one cutting off the corner of her eye,  and what looks to be a little liquid on the glass above the wine.  But still an awesome photo.  In fact I like your whole series with this model.  She''s got some great expressions.</td>', 'Would make for a cool advertisement.  Like the shot it is very good, only slight distractions are the glare on the glass, especially the one cutting off the corner of her eye,  and what looks to be a little liquid on the glass above the wine.  But still an awesome photo.  In fact I like your whole series with this model.  She''s got some great expressions.', '2004-07-07 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
