(800928, 86931, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot with a looming sky.  I like atmosphere of fun mixed with a feeling of impending doom at least that''s what I take away from this shot.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot with a looming sky.  I like atmosphere of fun mixed with a feeling of impending doom at least that''s what I take away from this shot.  Very nice job.', '2004-07-07 20:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
