(800937, 86522, 14620, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and the b&amp;w treatment works well with the abstract feel of the shot.  Well Done.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and the b&w treatment works well with the abstract feel of the shot.  Well Done.', '2004-07-07 20:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(800940, 85560, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and great silhouette.</td>', 'Very nice colors and great silhouette.', '2004-07-07 20:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(800948, 84486, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject captured with nice detail. A lower point of view (kneel on the hot sand!) would have avoided the left side getting lost in the horizon. I think it would work better in straight black and white, or at least a less saturated color.</td>', 'Very interesting subject captured with nice detail. A lower point of view (kneel on the hot sand!) would have avoided the left side getting lost in the horizon. I think it would work better in straight black and white, or at least a less saturated color.', '2004-07-07 20:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(800949, 86800, 12160, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, very powerful. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Awesome shot, very powerful. One of my top picks.', '2004-07-07 20:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(800956, 86203, 10402, '<td valign="top">An attractive bird, nicely composed, focus is a bit soft, background is great, overcompressed.</td>', 'An attractive bird, nicely composed, focus is a bit soft, background is great, overcompressed.', '2004-07-07 20:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(800957, 86338, 3697, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the color changes from bright greens at the bottom to dark, forboding colors at the top. And that sky, it looks like something out of Lord of the Rings. Very nice work.</td>', 'I really like the way the color changes from bright greens at the bottom to dark, forboding colors at the top. And that sky, it looks like something out of Lord of the Rings. Very nice work.', '2004-07-07 20:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(800971, 86056, 10402, '<td valign="top">There is a color cast and it could use some sharpening, but otherwise a great photo; good composition, nicely blurred background, and a wonderful pose.</td>', 'There is a color cast and it could use some sharpening, but otherwise a great photo; good composition, nicely blurred background, and a wonderful pose.', '2004-07-07 20:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(800988, 86866, 10402, '<td valign="top">The colorful "painted" sky and sun make a marvelous background for this silhouette. The horse''s tail is a bit strange here; if it was swishing then just a second sooner or later might have made a stronger shot.</td>', 'The colorful "painted" sky and sun make a marvelous background for this silhouette. The horse''s tail is a bit strange here; if it was swishing then just a second sooner or later might have made a stronger shot.', '2004-07-07 20:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(800992, 86765, 10402, '<td valign="top">A lot of interesting stuff here, but no strong center of interest to pull it all together.</td>', 'A lot of interesting stuff here, but no strong center of interest to pull it all together.', '2004-07-07 20:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(801003, 86438, 10402, '<td valign="top">A lot of nice contrasts here: colorful angular cranes and gray billowy smoke, order vs chaos. The seagulls are well place and add a nice touch.</td>', 'A lot of nice contrasts here: colorful angular cranes and gray billowy smoke, order vs chaos. The seagulls are well place and add a nice touch.', '2004-07-07 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(801020, 87141, 10402, '<td valign="top">This image exudes a wonderful atmosphere; I love it! The net nicely balances the centered composition. I''m guessing the background grass was smudged or blurred, an appropriate treatment that works very well here.</td>', 'This image exudes a wonderful atmosphere; I love it! The net nicely balances the centered composition. I''m guessing the background grass was smudged or blurred, an appropriate treatment that works very well here.', '2004-07-07 21:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(801032, 85907, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice composition of a beautiful view. Although it is OK like this, I think a split second sooner would have made a more intriguing photo.</td>', 'Nice composition of a beautiful view. Although it is OK like this, I think a split second sooner would have made a more intriguing photo.', '2004-07-07 21:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(801038, 81572, 2764, '<td valign="top">Ooojh lovely - how about just a bit more contrast somewhere?</td>', 'Ooojh lovely - how about just a bit more contrast somewhere?', '2004-07-07 21:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(801039, 86801, 10402, '<td valign="top">The center of focus is the lake, which is nice but not nearly as magnificant as the glacier, which unfortunately takes a background role in this photo.</td>', 'The center of focus is the lake, which is nice but not nearly as magnificant as the glacier, which unfortunately takes a background role in this photo.', '2004-07-07 21:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(801045, 83826, 19009, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice portrait. 8</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice portrait. 8', '2004-07-07 21:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(801048, 86448, 19009, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I''m thinking China maybe.  Clouds look a bit processed or town is lightened.  Kind of heavy contrast.  Makes for an interesting shot though. 7</td>', 'Interesting, I''m thinking China maybe.  Clouds look a bit processed or town is lightened.  Kind of heavy contrast.  Makes for an interesting shot though. 7', '2004-07-07 21:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801050, 84695, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighthouse plays only a minor role here; this is a photograph of the beach. A wonderful and dramatic one! Nice tonal range and great composition.</td>', 'The lighthouse plays only a minor role here; this is a photograph of the beach. A wonderful and dramatic one! Nice tonal range and great composition.', '2004-07-07 21:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801051, 82927, 19009, '<td valign="top">Wow, magenta....feels a little oversaturated.</td>', 'Wow, magenta....feels a little oversaturated.', '2004-07-07 21:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(801054, 86933, 2764, '<td valign="top">Almost but not quite..Some interesting things going on here though - the best is the lines, the wood and the lines of sauce on the plate and the grill lines on the fish, They all compliment eachother and tie the picture together.  However all the lines point off screen, and lead the voters eyes out.  Hr just thinks "Ok, done, next?"</td>', 'Almost but not quite..Some interesting things going on here though - the best is the lines, the wood and the lines of sauce on the plate and the grill lines on the fish, They all compliment eachother and tie the picture together.  However all the lines point off screen, and lead the voters eyes out.  Hr just thinks "Ok, done, next?"', '2004-07-07 21:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(801055, 86466, 19009, '<td valign="top">Wow, I liked it in the first challenge too.  Didn''t know you could do that.</td>', 'Wow, I liked it in the first challenge too.  Didn''t know you could do that.', '2004-07-07 21:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(801056, 85687, 1519, '<td valign="top">My favorite photo of this challenge. A perfect 10!  Nice work!</td>', 'My favorite photo of this challenge. A perfect 10!  Nice work!', '2004-07-07 21:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(801057, 86476, 8860, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge brief. Good luck.  ;)<br/> <br/>Memorable shot - striking comp.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge brief. Good luck.  ;) Memorable shot - striking comp.', '2004-07-07 21:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(801059, 81572, 1519, '<td valign="top">I usually like to see flowers in color, but this turned out really nice.  Very dreamy, I do like it a lot! 8</td>', 'I usually like to see flowers in color, but this turned out really nice.  Very dreamy, I do like it a lot! 8', '2004-07-07 21:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(801061, 85152, 1519, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but I think the color is just too saturated for my taste.  I''d like to see it with normal coloring.  The angle of the shot is good, nice location,  and I like the woman''s position. 7</td>', 'I really like this shot, but I think the color is just too saturated for my taste.  I''d like to see it with normal coloring.  The angle of the shot is good, nice location,  and I like the woman''s position. 7', '2004-07-07 21:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(801062, 87017, 1519, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Simple, well shot.  Nice composition and the background is nice. 8</td>', 'Nicely done.  Simple, well shot.  Nice composition and the background is nice. 8', '2004-07-07 21:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801066, 86483, 1519, '<td valign="top">I''m revisiting this one and am upping my score.  It is very nicely done.  I like the choice of coloring and the composition is great.  It would be nice to see the plane a bit larger/closer so that it stands out a bit more. Otherwise, great shot! 8</td>', 'I''m revisiting this one and am upping my score.  It is very nicely done.  I like the choice of coloring and the composition is great.  It would be nice to see the plane a bit larger/closer so that it stands out a bit more. Otherwise, great shot! 8', '2004-07-07 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(801069, 87084, 1519, '<td valign="top">I guess you are saying "glowing" bride because the veil is glowing, but it''s almost hard to tell what this picture is.  Maybe a different cropping would help or if we could see some of the bride''s face.  Nice idea, though.</td>', 'I guess you are saying "glowing" bride because the veil is glowing, but it''s almost hard to tell what this picture is.  Maybe a different cropping would help or if we could see some of the bride''s face.  Nice idea, though.', '2004-07-07 21:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801107, 86409, 9913, '<td valign="top">brilliant!</td>', 'brilliant!', '2004-07-07 21:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(801151, 86904, 15403, '<td valign="top">one of the best sports shots on DPC</td>', 'one of the best sports shots on DPC', '2004-07-07 22:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(801155, 86457, 15403, '<td valign="top">Ansel Adams would be proud :).  I love the technique used</td>', 'Ansel Adams would be proud :).  I love the technique used', '2004-07-07 22:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(801194, 86457, 15920, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like B&amp;W landscapes (unless they are by Ansel Adams), but you nailed this.  Perfect focus and contrast.</td>', 'I don''t usually like B&W landscapes (unless they are by Ansel Adams), but you nailed this.  Perfect focus and contrast.', '2004-07-07 22:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(801197, 86138, 15920, '<td valign="top">The sails look like they might be a little sharp, and I am guessing that you had to prcess out some movement from the boats.  That isn''t a big enough issue to worry about though.  The composition and the color of the clouds makes this a very good image.</td>', 'The sails look like they might be a little sharp, and I am guessing that you had to prcess out some movement from the boats.  That isn''t a big enough issue to worry about though.  The composition and the color of the clouds makes this a very good image.', '2004-07-07 22:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(801200, 86961, 15920, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail made me think this would be a good picture, and I wasn''t disappointed.  Perfect lighting (including the chin) and great focus/contrast.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'The thumbnail made me think this would be a good picture, and I wasn''t disappointed.  Perfect lighting (including the chin) and great focus/contrast.  One of my top picks.', '2004-07-07 22:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(801203, 87103, 15920, '<td valign="top">Tremendous composition, good focus, and overall, one of my top picks.</td>', 'Tremendous composition, good focus, and overall, one of my top picks.', '2004-07-07 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(801204, 86439, 5391, '<td valign="top">Oh, MAN...  That is SO cool!  Stunning clouds, great shot!</td>', 'Oh, MAN...  That is SO cool!  Stunning clouds, great shot!', '2004-07-07 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(801206, 86256, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very interesting mirror reflections in the water.  Neat scene.</td>', 'Very interesting mirror reflections in the water.  Neat scene.', '2004-07-07 22:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(801208, 87104, 15920, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, with great DOF.  Skin is almost so perfect as to look over processed.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Beautiful model, with great DOF.  Skin is almost so perfect as to look over processed.  One of my top picks.', '2004-07-07 22:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(801210, 86510, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful photograph.  Very sharp for being taken through a window, and the color scheme all works very well together.  9</td>', 'Really beautiful photograph.  Very sharp for being taken through a window, and the color scheme all works very well together.  9', '2004-07-07 22:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(801215, 85628, 5391, '<td valign="top">Whoa, crazy outfit, man...  Nice shot.  The hot spots by her right hand and at her waist are a bit of a distraction, but otherwise a very cool image.</td>', 'Whoa, crazy outfit, man...  Nice shot.  The hot spots by her right hand and at her waist are a bit of a distraction, but otherwise a very cool image.', '2004-07-07 22:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(801217, 86835, 15920, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  That isn''t much help I know, but it is the truth.  Only slight suggestion I have is that the clouds are slightly overexposed to the point where there is little detail, but, the rest of the image is strong enough so you really have to look for that flaw.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this.  That isn''t much help I know, but it is the truth.  Only slight suggestion I have is that the clouds are slightly overexposed to the point where there is little detail, but, the rest of the image is strong enough so you really have to look for that flaw.  Very nicely done.', '2004-07-07 22:50:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(801218, 82745, 1519, '<td valign="top">I think this would be nicer if there was something else to focus on since there isn''t much color variation in this photo.</td>', 'I think this would be nicer if there was something else to focus on since there isn''t much color variation in this photo.', '2004-07-07 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(801220, 86409, 15920, '<td valign="top">Just a little grainy, but a very nice overall image.</td>', 'Just a little grainy, but a very nice overall image.', '2004-07-07 22:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(801224, 87102, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the better "cat shots" I''ve seen.  Looks like an inquisitive little guy (girl?).</td>', 'One of the better "cat shots" I''ve seen.  Looks like an inquisitive little guy (girl?).', '2004-07-07 22:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(801229, 87003, 1519, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the lighting and composition.  This really does show a lovely side to a buzzard. :) 8</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the lighting and composition.  This really does show a lovely side to a buzzard. :) 8', '2004-07-07 22:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(801230, 85610, 15920, '<td valign="top">This might benefit from a little more contrast and a bit more saturation.</td>', 'This might benefit from a little more contrast and a bit more saturation.', '2004-07-07 22:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(801231, 86466, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  The natural (I assume) lighting really is gorgeous.  I might change the central composition a bit, but otherwise everything is perfect.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  The natural (I assume) lighting really is gorgeous.  I might change the central composition a bit, but otherwise everything is perfect.', '2004-07-07 22:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(801233, 86637, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your title says it all - the sky is fabulous!  What a great range of colors and values!  I also like the composition you chose - just the right amount of really black at the base to give the image a great foundation.  Having said all that - the border, with the white line - draws way too much attention.  Your image should finish well above the pack - good - no let''s say superb job!</td>', 'Your title says it all - the sky is fabulous!  What a great range of colors and values!  I also like the composition you chose - just the right amount of really black at the base to give the image a great foundation.  Having said all that - the border, with the white line - draws way too much attention.  Your image should finish well above the pack - good - no let''s say superb job!', '2004-07-07 22:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(801235, 85803, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but all the negative space at teh top didn''t help much.  FWIW: I held my hand over the sky and thought that crop was much more interesting.</td>', 'Good idea, but all the negative space at teh top didn''t help much.  FWIW: I held my hand over the sky and thought that crop was much more interesting.', '2004-07-07 22:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(801240, 86836, 15920, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overexposed and over processed (too sharp) on this monitor.</td>', 'Seems a bit overexposed and over processed (too sharp) on this monitor.', '2004-07-07 22:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(801250, 86409, 1519, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Nice pose and composition. I like the lighting and the sepia.  Maybe a bit grainy..  All in all, very nicely done. 8</td>', 'Lovely. Nice pose and composition. I like the lighting and the sepia.  Maybe a bit grainy..  All in all, very nicely done. 8', '2004-07-07 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(801253, 86448, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks a little too abstract to me to enjoy as a photo.  I wish I could help more, because I really liek the idea and composition.</td>', 'This looks a little too abstract to me to enjoy as a photo.  I wish I could help more, because I really liek the idea and composition.', '2004-07-07 22:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801258, 81239, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot, but, here, it is tough to make flower shots stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'Nice flower shot, but, here, it is tough to make flower shots stand out from the crowd.', '2004-07-07 23:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(801263, 86789, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very cool star sort of effect produced by the lights.</td>', 'Very cool star sort of effect produced by the lights.', '2004-07-07 23:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(801267, 85152, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition that is between abstract and real photo.  Either way would have been OK, but, the blue in her hair and the grain as is are a little distracting.</td>', 'This is a great composition that is between abstract and real photo.  Either way would have been OK, but, the blue in her hair and the grain as is are a little distracting.', '2004-07-07 23:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(801269, 85700, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very attractive still life.  The items all work well together and the color scheme is absolutely beautiful.  This should be on the wall in a music studio somewhere.</td>', 'Very attractive still life.  The items all work well together and the color scheme is absolutely beautiful.  This should be on the wall in a music studio somewhere.', '2004-07-07 23:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(801271, 86532, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice silouette, but it is up against some tough competition this month.</td>', 'Nice silouette, but it is up against some tough competition this month.', '2004-07-07 23:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(801276, 85680, 15920, '<td valign="top">Two suggestions: us a little larger picture, and move the guard slightly into the frame.  The saw horse is a decision for you, it might look OK if you removed it, but, it does work as a prop as is.</td>', 'Two suggestions: us a little larger picture, and move the guard slightly into the frame.  The saw horse is a decision for you, it might look OK if you removed it, but, it does work as a prop as is.', '2004-07-07 23:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(801279, 86798, 10402, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure "cute" is the right word, but it is certainly fascinating! Great lighting and composition. The background works really well.</td>', 'I''m not sure "cute" is the right word, but it is certainly fascinating! Great lighting and composition. The background works really well.', '2004-07-07 23:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(801281, 85953, 15920, '<td valign="top">The models could be just a bit sharper.</td>', 'The models could be just a bit sharper.', '2004-07-07 23:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801283, 84673, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice composition catching the light rays.  The clouds near then though are just a little overexposed.</td>', 'Nice composition catching the light rays.  The clouds near then though are just a little overexposed.', '2004-07-07 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(801286, 85572, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful seeing - you-ve captured an elegant scene very nicely.  I like the log at the bottom as a lead-in but would be a bit happier if it were more in the left bottom corner.  I''d also like to see a tiny bit more of the tree-line silhouette at the top.  Having said that - the exposure and focus is perfect - and any post processing you did was done very well.  <br/> <br/>Perhaps the best part of all, many photographers would have walked right by this wonderful composition wondering what they could find to shoot.</td>', 'Wonderful seeing - you-ve captured an elegant scene very nicely.  I like the log at the bottom as a lead-in but would be a bit happier if it were more in the left bottom corner.  I''d also like to see a tiny bit more of the tree-line silhouette at the top.  Having said that - the exposure and focus is perfect - and any post processing you did was done very well.   Perhaps the best part of all, many photographers would have walked right by this wonderful composition wondering what they could find to shoot.', '2004-07-07 23:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801293, 86091, 19608, '<td valign="top">Funny and really extraordinary - it doesn''t even look like tornado weather.  Congrats on a great idea well executed.</td>', 'Funny and really extraordinary - it doesn''t even look like tornado weather.  Congrats on a great idea well executed.', '2004-07-07 23:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(801303, 86962, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky and a very effectice silhouette.  I really like the red highlights on the ground - but dislike the white line in the border.  Colors are absolutely perfect.</td>', 'Wonderful sky and a very effectice silhouette.  I really like the red highlights on the ground - but dislike the white line in the border.  Colors are absolutely perfect.', '2004-07-07 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(801308, 84310, 7151, '<td valign="top">Hope the groom''s got a good lawyer...</td>', 'Hope the groom''s got a good lawyer...', '2004-07-07 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801317, 83343, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional bird portrait!  Eyes are razor sharp as are the feathers.  Background is perfect. Toss the white line in the border.</td>', 'Exceptional bird portrait!  Eyes are razor sharp as are the feathers.  Background is perfect. Toss the white line in the border.', '2004-07-07 23:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(801320, 86866, 23201, '<td valign="top">This is the best of the lot in my opinion, perfect 10, my only 10!!!!</td>', 'This is the best of the lot in my opinion, perfect 10, my only 10!!!!', '2004-07-07 23:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(801329, 85752, 19608, '<td valign="top">The water is very spectacular.  Your composition is also excellent - right on the crash point.  But - for this image, since the kayak is heading towards the right - it would probably work better if it were headed INTO the image rather than out of the image.  Having said that - it''s still a great one - keep it up!</td>', 'The water is very spectacular.  Your composition is also excellent - right on the crash point.  But - for this image, since the kayak is heading towards the right - it would probably work better if it were headed INTO the image rather than out of the image.  Having said that - it''s still a great one - keep it up!', '2004-07-07 23:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(801331, 83121, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a nice and pleasing image but I find the halo effect around the leaves a bit bothersome.</td>', 'You have a nice and pleasing image but I find the halo effect around the leaves a bit bothersome.', '2004-07-07 23:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(801334, 85502, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice high-key and artistic image.  Don''t be discouraged by the votes from the "flower haters."    This would make an exceptional print - keep it up!</td>', 'A very nice high-key and artistic image.  Don''t be discouraged by the votes from the "flower haters."    This would make an exceptional print - keep it up!', '2004-07-07 23:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(801337, 86956, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb colors and silhouette - but because of the shoreline - the horizon appears to tilt downhill left to right.</td>', 'Superb colors and silhouette - but because of the shoreline - the horizon appears to tilt downhill left to right.', '2004-07-07 23:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(801340, 82739, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  The green contrasts beautifully with her hair and her eyes really grab you.  9</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  The green contrasts beautifully with her hair and her eyes really grab you.  9', '2004-07-07 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(801343, 84364, 19608, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary?  YES!!  Great reflection of the mall - I''m gald that crane has been removed...  Composition off center is perfect.</td>', 'Extraordinary?  YES!!  Great reflection of the mall - I''m gald that crane has been removed...  Composition off center is perfect.', '2004-07-07 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(801345, 85760, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle colors work well.  The titled look does not.</td>', 'Nice subtle colors work well.  The titled look does not.', '2004-07-07 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(801347, 86855, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great close up and perfect placement!</td>', 'Great close up and perfect placement!', '2004-07-07 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(801351, 84754, 19608, '<td valign="top">I don''t get your title - but I do get the perfect image!  Great colors, composition, and choice of aperture to blur the backgropund.  Well done indeed.</td>', 'I don''t get your title - but I do get the perfect image!  Great colors, composition, and choice of aperture to blur the backgropund.  Well done indeed.', '2004-07-07 23:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(801354, 86483, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice image - but I think it would work much better in full color.</td>', 'Nice image - but I think it would work much better in full color.', '2004-07-07 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(801360, 81045, 19608, '<td valign="top">Run?  Good title!  I really like the white background as it maks the bug''s colors really stand out.  Perhaps it would be better with more space in front of the critter and less behind.</td>', 'Run?  Good title!  I really like the white background as it maks the bug''s colors really stand out.  Perhaps it would be better with more space in front of the critter and less behind.', '2004-07-07 23:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(801362, 86512, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and nice scenic.  You picked a bad time to enter this however as there are some truly great sunsets and sunrises to compete with.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and nice scenic.  You picked a bad time to enter this however as there are some truly great sunsets and sunrises to compete with.', '2004-07-07 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(801365, 87109, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and background.  The image needs the rest of the flower top and bottom.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Great colors and background.  The image needs the rest of the flower top and bottom. ', '2004-07-07 23:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(801373, 84195, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and scene but I think the shadows don''t reallyhelp much as they have no detail at all.</td>', 'Great colors and scene but I think the shadows don''t reallyhelp much as they have no detail at all.', '2004-07-07 23:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(801376, 86952, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and layering effect.  It would be much stronger if the sun were more to one side instead of dead center.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and layering effect.  It would be much stronger if the sun were more to one side instead of dead center.', '2004-07-07 23:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(801377, 86511, 8624, '<td valign="top">an interesting image but very blown out on the highlights. given the featureless sky, you might consider shooting tighter to put the dock more fully in the frame. A lower visual angle and positioning the camera to put the foreground boards in the left corner of the frame would have providing strong leading lines to guide the eye towards the interesting covered structure.</td>', 'an interesting image but very blown out on the highlights. given the featureless sky, you might consider shooting tighter to put the dock more fully in the frame. A lower visual angle and positioning the camera to put the foreground boards in the left corner of the frame would have providing strong leading lines to guide the eye towards the interesting covered structure.', '2004-07-07 23:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(801379, 80970, 2223, '<td valign="top">Crazy lightning!..OMG! What a lucky lucky shot! 10</td>', 'Crazy lightning!..OMG! What a lucky lucky shot! 10', '2004-07-07 23:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(801382, 86056, 8624, '<td valign="top">nice animal portrait. I like how the owl is peering over its shoulder like a model might strike a pose. the shot is lacking in contrast, though. It would have more punch if you darkened the dark values and brightened the highlights.</td>', 'nice animal portrait. I like how the owl is peering over its shoulder like a model might strike a pose. the shot is lacking in contrast, though. It would have more punch if you darkened the dark values and brightened the highlights.', '2004-07-07 23:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(801385, 84645, 8624, '<td valign="top">great point of view. the choice if birches is a good one too since the peeling and spotted bark has such interesting features.</td>', 'great point of view. the choice if birches is a good one too since the peeling and spotted bark has such interesting features.', '2004-07-07 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(801386, 86800, 2223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Heida?10</td>', 'Beautiful image. Heida?10', '2004-07-07 23:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(801390, 86054, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb - just superb!  The detail in the leaf is amazing.  The lighting on the stem at top creates a nice lead in.  I''d like to crop off about 1/2 of the distance from the left edge to the leaf so it would not be quite so centered.  Even as is - it''s a stunning submission.</td>', 'Superb - just superb!  The detail in the leaf is amazing.  The lighting on the stem at top creates a nice lead in.  I''d like to crop off about 1/2 of the distance from the left edge to the leaf so it would not be quite so centered.  Even as is - it''s a stunning submission.', '2004-07-07 23:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(801392, 81572, 8624, '<td valign="top">outstanding tones and composition. this is a great example to show all the people who hate flower images that, when done well. they can be striking!</td>', 'outstanding tones and composition. this is a great example to show all the people who hate flower images that, when done well. they can be striking!', '2004-07-07 23:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(801394, 86800, 17203, '<td valign="top">This has Heida written all over it. The only thing that might improve this shot for me is a dash of blue ribbon. 10</td>', 'This has Heida written all over it. The only thing that might improve this shot for me is a dash of blue ribbon. 10', '2004-07-07 23:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(801395, 82934, 19608, '<td valign="top">A photogenic  pair captured nicely.  Exposure perfect with flat lighting.  Well done.</td>', 'A photogenic  pair captured nicely.  Exposure perfect with flat lighting.  Well done.', '2004-07-07 23:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(801398, 86835, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice rendition of the old building - postcard quality.</td>', 'Nice rendition of the old building - postcard quality.', '2004-07-07 23:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(801400, 82934, 8624, '<td valign="top">great poses. the reflections make this shot as well as having the foreground bird with his back towards us, giving a great view of the long white head feathers. His pose amuses me too - it looks like he''s just a guy standing there with his hands in his pockets, watching the world go by. well done.</td>', 'great poses. the reflections make this shot as well as having the foreground bird with his back towards us, giving a great view of the long white head feathers. His pose amuses me too - it looks like he''s just a guy standing there with his hands in his pockets, watching the world go by. well done.', '2004-07-07 23:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(801402, 85041, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors caused by perfect exposure.  I want to see the rest of the left wing!</td>', 'Great colors caused by perfect exposure.  I want to see the rest of the left wing!', '2004-07-07 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(801403, 86100, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a perfect sunset!</td>', 'Nice capture of a perfect sunset!', '2004-07-07 23:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(801404, 86009, 8624, '<td valign="top">cool lighting. the tomato almost looks translucent. wish the hot spot wasn''t on the fruit though.</td>', 'cool lighting. the tomato almost looks translucent. wish the hot spot wasn''t on the fruit though.', '2004-07-07 23:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(801405, 86766, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and silhouette - but a bit too centered for me.</td>', 'Great colors and silhouette - but a bit too centered for me.', '2004-07-07 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(801407, 85872, 8624, '<td valign="top">great forms in the chair. I would have preferred a simpler background behind it though.</td>', 'great forms in the chair. I would have preferred a simpler background behind it though.', '2004-07-07 23:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(801410, 86395, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice model with a classic camera - but I don''t get the title or anything really extraordinary, sorry.</td>', 'A very nice model with a classic camera - but I don''t get the title or anything really extraordinary, sorry.', '2004-07-07 23:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(801412, 84115, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors in a good composition. A catchlight in the eye would help immensely.</td>', 'Great colors in a good composition. A catchlight in the eye would help immensely.', '2004-07-07 23:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(801414, 86836, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice subtle colors and it really is an extraordinary feat.  You have a pretty serious overexposure problem here.</td>', 'Very nice subtle colors and it really is an extraordinary feat.  You have a pretty serious overexposure problem here.', '2004-07-07 23:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(801416, 87151, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea, composition and exposure.  Extraordinary is a stretch - but I guess I''d have to agree if I just happened upon a boot on a fence pole... it would not be a normal event!</td>', 'Great idea, composition and exposure.  Extraordinary is a stretch - but I guess I''d have to agree if I just happened upon a boot on a fence pole... it would not be a normal event!', '2004-07-07 23:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(801419, 83121, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little overboard on that gaussian blur filter, huh? It''s a very good photo, but I might have preferred the original to the fuzzy edges. Try the lens blur instead, and you won''t get a glow around your selection. That dark spot to the left of the purple flower is kinda annoying. Excellent focus and light quality on the remainder of your image. 7</td>', 'A little overboard on that gaussian blur filter, huh? It''s a very good photo, but I might have preferred the original to the fuzzy edges. Try the lens blur instead, and you won''t get a glow around your selection. That dark spot to the left of the purple flower is kinda annoying. Excellent focus and light quality on the remainder of your image. 7', '2004-07-07 23:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(801421, 84587, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve made something special from am average scene - and done it very nicely.  The tunnell effet and the blue sky are great.</td>', 'You''ve made something special from am average scene - and done it very nicely.  The tunnell effet and the blue sky are great.', '2004-07-07 23:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(801426, 87003, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice macro with perfect focus.  Background handled well.  I''d like to see the end of the quill at the left.</td>', 'A very nice macro with perfect focus.  Background handled well.  I''d like to see the end of the quill at the left.', '2004-07-07 23:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(801427, 86951, 19608, '<td valign="top">Yes,  an extraordinary lady with loads of character.  Nice composition and use of some pretty flat lighting.</td>', 'Yes,  an extraordinary lady with loads of character.  Nice composition and use of some pretty flat lighting.', '2004-07-07 23:58:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(801428, 86457, 10402, '<td valign="top">What depth! And all in sharp focus. Magnificant.</td>', 'What depth! And all in sharp focus. Magnificant.', '2004-07-07 23:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(801430, 87106, 9668, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, almost abstract (lighting), nice portrayal or an army dude =).</td>', 'Interesting shot, almost abstract (lighting), nice portrayal or an army dude =).', '2004-07-08 00:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(801431, 87104, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model in nice lighting. Her eyes are captured perfectly with crisp focus and vivid catchlights.  The white "thing" above her right arm is awful!  What the heck is it?</td>', 'Beautiful model in nice lighting. Her eyes are captured perfectly with crisp focus and vivid catchlights.  The white "thing" above her right arm is awful!  What the heck is it?', '2004-07-08 00:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(801435, 82805, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors but I''d like to see the whole flower.  Exposure a bit hot on the stem at top - perfect elsewhere.</td>', 'Very nice colors but I''d like to see the whole flower.  Exposure a bit hot on the stem at top - perfect elsewhere.', '2004-07-08 00:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
