(801448, 86988, 9668, '<td valign="top">I guess since I live at the beach, ocean/beach sunsets aren''t as spectacular to me, but this is still nice. I''m confused about the texture on the bottom, why do the waves just do flat? Detracts my attention. Nice sunset, like the reflection off the water/ flatness.</td>', 'I guess since I live at the beach, ocean/beach sunsets aren''t as spectacular to me, but this is still nice. I''m confused about the texture on the bottom, why do the waves just do flat? Detracts my attention. Nice sunset, like the reflection off the water/ flatness.', '2004-07-08 00:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(801451, 86491, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  Lighting is flat but perfect for the shot.  The only problem is that this shot has become so cliche.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  Lighting is flat but perfect for the shot.  The only problem is that this shot has become so cliche.', '2004-07-08 00:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(801452, 86628, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots this June. Very good composition and a unique subject, but the tilted horizon is distracting. It''s a shame the sky wasn''t a little more dramatic- puffy clouds, stormy, sunset...</td>', 'One of the better shots this June. Very good composition and a unique subject, but the tilted horizon is distracting. It''s a shame the sky wasn''t a little more dramatic- puffy clouds, stormy, sunset...', '2004-07-08 00:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(801453, 86395, 9668, '<td valign="top">Are you shooting with a canon, and that''s why there is a conflict? I don''t get it. I like the composition, too bad about clipping the edge of the camera lens. Nice pose.</td>', 'Are you shooting with a canon, and that''s why there is a conflict? I don''t get it. I like the composition, too bad about clipping the edge of the camera lens. Nice pose.', '2004-07-08 00:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
