(801464, 86054, 14620, '<td valign="top">Very simple but very nice.  I love your use of light to bring about the details of the leaf.  And a great eye to catch such a wonderful scene.  Black background  works great.  Not sure if center composition would''ve been my choice, but nonetheless, this is a stunning shot.</td>', 'Very simple but very nice.  I love your use of light to bring about the details of the leaf.  And a great eye to catch such a wonderful scene.  Black background  works great.  Not sure if center composition would''ve been my choice, but nonetheless, this is a stunning shot.', '2004-07-08 00:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(801466, 83675, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a great submission - reminds me of a Mark Twain story - the best black and white of the challenge.  I hope you do well - the image deserves it!</td>', 'What a great submission - reminds me of a Mark Twain story - the best black and white of the challenge.  I hope you do well - the image deserves it!', '2004-07-08 00:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
