(801478, 85659, 17203, '<td valign="top">A nicely expressive portrait, but too much flash. Move the shampoo away and back up to reduce the flash strength. 4-8 feet should be a good distance. You might also try pre-focusing on a part of the bright white tub at the same distance to "fool" the camera into underexposing.</td>', 'A nicely expressive portrait, but too much flash. Move the shampoo away and back up to reduce the flash strength. 4-8 feet should be a good distance. You might also try pre-focusing on a part of the bright white tub at the same distance to "fool" the camera into underexposing.', '2004-07-08 00:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
