(801642, 86789, 17233, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everyones comments. For those who wanted to know about the star pattern in the lights - pure fluke. I had a polariser filter on in readiness for the sunrise and I can only assume that it was a result from that. Cheers</td>', 'Thanks for everyones comments. For those who wanted to know about the star pattern in the lights - pure fluke. I had a polariser filter on in readiness for the sunrise and I can only assume that it was a result from that. Cheers', '2004-07-08 01:15:21.000000', NULL, 0),
