(801661, 87151, 17916, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Maverick:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice shot.  Though the blur looks unnatural to me, I think this is a nice example of more or less digital art. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Just a shallow DOF, only adjusted curves, saturation and color levels. I understand what you mean, though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Maverick: Nice shot.  Though the blur looks unnatural to me, I think this is a nice example of more or less digital art.   Just a shallow DOF, only adjusted curves, saturation and color levels. I understand what you mean, though.', '2004-07-08 01:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
