(801750, 86322, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this. It has a really nice feel of a moment just passed. Your title was really appropriate. This was one of my top picks.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this. It has a really nice feel of a moment just passed. Your title was really appropriate. This was one of my top picks.', '2004-07-08 01:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(801754, 86962, 17492, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critque Club!<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Your framing is spectacular. The couple is rule of thirds, the flag poles are all ragged and leading down to your subjects. The colors you captured are gorgeous.<br/> <br/>Lighting:<br/>Perfect. The people are perfect silohets, the texture on the ground is a nice touch. (someone said they''d have preferred no detail in the foreground, while that is usually good, I really think it works well for your photo.)<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Your technique is flawless.<br/> <br/>Post-processing:<br/>I''m sure you messed around with levels etc or something similar. You did nicely, not only are the results gorgeous, but it doesn''t have that overly-processed look. Whatever you did, it definately looks good in this photo.<br/> <br/>Overall:<br/>I wouldn''t change a thing. Excellent capture, excellent submission. This challenge had some stiff competition, so your 82% percentile finish is well earned.<br/> <br/>Look forward to future submissions.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critque Club! Composition:Your framing is spectacular. The couple is rule of thirds, the flag poles are all ragged and leading down to your subjects. The colors you captured are gorgeous. Lighting:Perfect. The people are perfect silohets, the texture on the ground is a nice touch. (someone said they''d have preferred no detail in the foreground, while that is usually good, I really think it works well for your photo.) Technical:Your technique is flawless. Post-processing:I''m sure you messed around with levels etc or something similar. You did nicely, not only are the results gorgeous, but it doesn''t have that overly-processed look. Whatever you did, it definately looks good in this photo. Overall:I wouldn''t change a thing. Excellent capture, excellent submission. This challenge had some stiff competition, so your 82% percentile finish is well earned. Look forward to future submissions.', '2004-07-08 02:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(801758, 86085, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>The bench appears to be your main focal point and should be in better focus.  As it is now my attention is drawn to the road in the background for two reasons first it is brighter in contrast and secondly it appears to be in focus when compared to the bench.<br/> <br/>Try having the bench in focus with the road out of focus and you will have a very strong photo.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Critique Club The bench appears to be your main focal point and should be in better focus.  As it is now my attention is drawn to the road in the background for two reasons first it is brighter in contrast and secondly it appears to be in focus when compared to the bench. Try having the bench in focus with the road out of focus and you will have a very strong photo. ', '2004-07-08 02:02:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(801760, 86800, 21158, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on a well deserved blue. WTG...</td>', 'Congratulations on a well deserved blue. WTG...', '2004-07-08 02:03:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(801761, 84288, 14012, '<td valign="top">not suprised where you placed, but I thought it was an interesting shot. You''ve learned something from your first entry at DPC, don''t do abstracts if you want to score high. :)<br/> <br/>Good luck in your future challenges.</td>', 'not suprised where you placed, but I thought it was an interesting shot. You''ve learned something from your first entry at DPC, don''t do abstracts if you want to score high. :) Good luck in your future challenges.', '2004-07-08 02:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(801768, 87138, 19952, '<td valign="top">Your pictures just get better and better. I''m going to put you in my favorites list now and avoid the rush that will ensue when you win your first ribbon.<br/> <br/>My mistake - you were already in there! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-08 01:08:25.</i></td>', 'Your pictures just get better and better. I''m going to put you in my favorites list now and avoid the rush that will ensue when you win your first ribbon. My mistake - you were already in there! :-)', '2004-07-08 02:06:42.000000', '2004-07-08 02:08:25.000000', 0),
