(801816, 86409, 8816, '<td valign="top">Heavens to Murgatroid this is good!<br/> <br/>Not just good, awesome.  One of the best photo''s I''ve seen on this site in a long time!  You had quite the unfortunate luck to be in the same challenge as Heida''s shot, otherwise the blue woulda been yours!<br/> <br/>Nice work!<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Heavens to Murgatroid this is good! Not just good, awesome.  One of the best photo''s I''ve seen on this site in a long time!  You had quite the unfortunate luck to be in the same challenge as Heida''s shot, otherwise the blue woulda been yours! Nice work! Lee', '2004-07-08 02:52:05.000000', NULL, 0),
