(801877, 86800, 4159, '<td valign="top">You were the first comment on my shot for this challenge, but I''m late to comment on yours: belatedly, nice job, nice sky, great shot.  It''s very pretty.</td>', 'You were the first comment on my shot for this challenge, but I''m late to comment on yours: belatedly, nice job, nice sky, great shot.  It''s very pretty.', '2004-07-08 03:49:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(801886, 84771, 4008, '<td valign="top">I was wondering whether the starts were real. What a great idea and thank you for explaining it. Great result as well.</td>', 'I was wondering whether the starts were real. What a great idea and thank you for explaining it. Great result as well.', '2004-07-08 03:53:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(801903, 86409, 13602, '<td valign="top">This whas one of the first images I saw in this challenge and it remained my best till the end. Excellent work, verry well deserved ribbon. I wish there would be atleast one explanation for the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s it recived... Anyways, a masterpiece!</td>', 'This whas one of the first images I saw in this challenge and it remained my best till the end. Excellent work, verry well deserved ribbon. I wish there would be atleast one explanation for the 1''s, 2''s and 3''s it recived... Anyways, a masterpiece!', '2004-07-08 04:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(801908, 86800, 13602, '<td valign="top">hehe I guessed right, this does take place in Iceland. Is it just me or the skyes are always too low in altitude there, do people often get struck by lightings over there? Whas your model in any risk of that when you took it? :)) Anyways, it''s a wonderful shot, congrats for the ribbon!!!<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-08 03:14:16.</i></td>', 'hehe I guessed right, this does take place in Iceland. Is it just me or the skyes are always too low in altitude there, do people often get struck by lightings over there? Whas your model in any risk of that when you took it? :)) Anyways, it''s a wonderful shot, congrats for the ribbon!!! ', '2004-07-08 04:13:02.000000', '2004-07-08 04:14:16.000000', 0),
(801910, 86334, 8054, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone! To answer a few questions...<br/> <br/>1. Yes, he was looking straight at the camera when I took his picture so, yes, he''s looking at YOU.  :)<br/> <br/>2. I am not in the reflection at all. I believe those are his jeans in the reflection.<br/> <br/>3. About the highlights, I wish they weren''t there either. I tried to burn those nasty spots but it was to no avail. There weren''t enough details for Photoshop to use for burning so I had to leave them alone. I suppose I could have cloned some in but I didn''t think of that until just now.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone! To answer a few questions... 1. Yes, he was looking straight at the camera when I took his picture so, yes, he''s looking at YOU.  :) 2. I am not in the reflection at all. I believe those are his jeans in the reflection. 3. About the highlights, I wish they weren''t there either. I tried to burn those nasty spots but it was to no avail. There weren''t enough details for Photoshop to use for burning so I had to leave them alone. I suppose I could have cloned some in but I didn''t think of that until just now.', '2004-07-08 04:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(801915, 86800, 19025, '<td valign="top">ARe you going to make this an available print cuz I would love to have one! I can''t believe some people (the nerve of them) to give you anything lower than a 7. That is insane. this picture is truly a piece of art..no doubt about it. Incredible!!!</td>', 'ARe you going to make this an available print cuz I would love to have one! I can''t believe some people (the nerve of them) to give you anything lower than a 7. That is insane. this picture is truly a piece of art..no doubt about it. Incredible!!!', '2004-07-08 04:20:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(801927, 86835, 11897, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.<br/>Paul.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.Paul.', '2004-07-08 04:39:04.000000', NULL, 0),
