(801931, 86800, 2130, '<td valign="top">þokkalega geggjuð mynd, ég vissi að þetta værir þú....rosalega flottur stíll hjá þér...haltu bara áfram að brenna þetta alltsaman, það virðist virka vel :)</td>', 'þokkalega geggjuð mynd, ég vissi að þetta værir þú....rosalega flottur stíll hjá þér...haltu bara áfram að brenna þetta alltsaman, það virðist virka vel :)', '2004-07-08 04:45:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(801962, 86800, 7263, '<td valign="top">Heida, one day i must come to your native land - the skies there are awsome with plenty of buring potential - we could have so much fun! lol<br/> <br/>I feel that you see what i see when looking at a scene - kind of moody and what others may think as ugly, but in a beautiful way (if that makes sense). The kind of scene where people will look out of their window and moan. <br/> <br/>For what it''s worth, you are now my official fave DPC photograoher - by a long shot. Makes me want to shoot again looking at your new images.<br/> <br/>Reagrds<br/> <br/>JP<br/> <br/></td>', 'Heida, one day i must come to your native land - the skies there are awsome with plenty of buring potential - we could have so much fun! lol I feel that you see what i see when looking at a scene - kind of moody and what others may think as ugly, but in a beautiful way (if that makes sense). The kind of scene where people will look out of their window and moan.  For what it''s worth, you are now my official fave DPC photograoher - by a long shot. Makes me want to shoot again looking at your new images. Reagrds JP ', '2004-07-08 05:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
