(802268, 86409, 14386, '<td valign="top">THANK YOU very much. I am here now in the Philippines and I was in the airplane when the results came out. I can''t wait to get in the internet to check how did my picture fare. I am extremely happy to ribbon.<br/> <br/>As what I''ve told you in the note, I don''t know who this lady is. I had taken two good shots of her and I will post the other picture as soon as I get to connect my laptop to the internet.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes guys.<br/> <br/>To Heida, I know you will win he moment I saw your picture.<br/> <br/>And to others, a job well-done. Placing 2nd despite the many outstanding pictures is a big big thing for me.<br/> <br/>And those who voted 1, 2 and 3 for this picture, thanks for reminding me that the picture is far from perfect and that I still have a lot to learn.</td>', 'THANK YOU very much. I am here now in the Philippines and I was in the airplane when the results came out. I can''t wait to get in the internet to check how did my picture fare. I am extremely happy to ribbon. As what I''ve told you in the note, I don''t know who this lady is. I had taken two good shots of her and I will post the other picture as soon as I get to connect my laptop to the internet. Thanks for the votes guys. To Heida, I know you will win he moment I saw your picture. And to others, a job well-done. Placing 2nd despite the many outstanding pictures is a big big thing for me. And those who voted 1, 2 and 3 for this picture, thanks for reminding me that the picture is far from perfect and that I still have a lot to learn.', '2004-07-08 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 0),
