(803595, 85152, 15891, '<td valign="top">Blue hair? Funny eye??  Not on my monitor... This image is beautiful. Very 40''s glam IMO. Technically it''s not as sharp as it could be and there is some noise. But the technical imperfections ADD to the image. Good job!</td>', 'Blue hair? Funny eye??  Not on my monitor... This image is beautiful. Very 40''s glam IMO. Technically it''s not as sharp as it could be and there is some noise. But the technical imperfections ADD to the image. Good job!', '2004-07-09 09:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(803606, 86409, 8159, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the ribbon Manny! I''m gonna go against the grain here (and I''m sure even more people will dislike me because of it), but this picture just doesn''t do anything for me. I''m not sure why, since so many other people can''t believe how it awesome it is. Strange! Maybe it is because I found the moir­­é pattern in the veil, the shiny spot on her nose and "graininess" of her skin distracting? In any event, trying to understand this discontinuity between so many others calling this photo "perfect" and me not seeing it as anything out-of-the-ordinary is something I''m gonna have to think about, because apparently I''m missing something... But in your case, I would keep up what your doing, ''cause everybody else loves it! Congrats again!</td>', 'Congrats on the ribbon Manny! I''m gonna go against the grain here (and I''m sure even more people will dislike me because of it), but this picture just doesn''t do anything for me. I''m not sure why, since so many other people can''t believe how it awesome it is. Strange! Maybe it is because I found the moir­­é pattern in the veil, the shiny spot on her nose and "graininess" of her skin distracting? In any event, trying to understand this discontinuity between so many others calling this photo "perfect" and me not seeing it as anything out-of-the-ordinary is something I''m gonna have to think about, because apparently I''m missing something... But in your case, I would keep up what your doing, ''cause everybody else loves it! Congrats again!', '2004-07-09 10:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(803607, 83188, 16493, '<td valign="top">Its kind of like its snap shot from a dream.<br/>But there is no place for the eyes to rest, needs larger DOF for this flower. You should try this on diffrent flowers or angles.<br/>6 or 7 if I where in a good mood.</td>', 'Its kind of like its snap shot from a dream.But there is no place for the eyes to rest, needs larger DOF for this flower. You should try this on diffrent flowers or angles.6 or 7 if I where in a good mood.', '2004-07-09 10:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(803610, 86800, 8159, '<td valign="top">Congrats on another ribbon Heiða! After seeing your "from the camera" original, it is <i>amazing</i> how a photo can be totally transformed into something extraordinary by someone with the right "vision" in the digital darkroom. What a difference!</td>', 'Congrats on another ribbon Heiða! After seeing your "from the camera" original, it is amazing how a photo can be totally transformed into something extraordinary by someone with the right "vision" in the digital darkroom. What a difference!', '2004-07-09 10:10:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(803611, 86531, 8860, '<td valign="top">This is so emotive and well observed. He has such a wistful, almost worried look. Beauitiful shot.</td>', 'This is so emotive and well observed. He has such a wistful, almost worried look. Beauitiful shot.', '2004-07-09 10:12:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(803618, 86457, 8159, '<td valign="top">What a terrific capture Jodie! Congrats on getting your second ribbon so soon after your first. The more I look at your picture, the better it gets. I hope to one day be able to take a landscape picture as good as you do!</td>', 'What a terrific capture Jodie! Congrats on getting your second ribbon so soon after your first. The more I look at your picture, the better it gets. I hope to one day be able to take a landscape picture as good as you do!', '2004-07-09 10:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(803630, 86409, 20018, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful, one of my favorites of the entire site and it should''ve taken the blue ribbon!. I''d like to see a copy though with less sharpening, the nose is generally an area I try to avoid oversharpening on because of the large pores. Sometimes I go back and blur the pores a bit to make them less noticeable, the sharp/grain look looks fine everywhere else, but overall ABSOLUTELY BEAUTIFUL. I love the color treatment and the composition with the eye/veil/hand.</td>', 'absolutely beautiful, one of my favorites of the entire site and it should''ve taken the blue ribbon!. I''d like to see a copy though with less sharpening, the nose is generally an area I try to avoid oversharpening on because of the large pores. Sometimes I go back and blur the pores a bit to make them less noticeable, the sharp/grain look looks fine everywhere else, but overall ABSOLUTELY BEAUTIFUL. I love the color treatment and the composition with the eye/veil/hand.', '2004-07-09 10:29:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(803652, 87106, 5391, '<td valign="top">Really good shot!</td>', 'Really good shot!', '2004-07-09 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(803654, 87139, 5391, '<td valign="top">Beautiful depiction of grace.  Congrats on a lovely photo!</td>', 'Beautiful depiction of grace.  Congrats on a lovely photo!', '2004-07-09 10:53:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(803767, 86522, 12448, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 7 during the challenge.<br/> <br/>I like the shot, the lines of the shadows but the roots ended up being a distraction for me and it lacked contrast for the black and white subject.  Very few black and white shots can get away with low contrast.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps!<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'I gave this a 7 during the challenge. I like the shot, the lines of the shadows but the roots ended up being a distraction for me and it lacked contrast for the black and white subject.  Very few black and white shots can get away with low contrast. Hope this helps! Deannda', '2004-07-09 12:36:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(803793, 86522, 3087, '<td valign="top">The lighting of the background is great - I really like the graphic element those curved shadows provide. Placement of subject within frame is good - and it balances well with it''s own shadow. Focus seems poor - the detail on the leaves, pot, roots etc just isn''t sharp. Could also do with bouncing just a touch of light back onto the near side of the plant to make it easier to see that detail.</td>', 'The lighting of the background is great - I really like the graphic element those curved shadows provide. Placement of subject within frame is good - and it balances well with it''s own shadow. Focus seems poor - the detail on the leaves, pot, roots etc just isn''t sharp. Could also do with bouncing just a touch of light back onto the near side of the plant to make it easier to see that detail.', '2004-07-09 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(803810, 87022, 7711, '<td valign="top">Bill -- I would have liked to see a little more of the bg.. maybe more around or above his head. I love the colours and the look of the subject, but I just feel like the crop is a bit tight. Because of his pose and the layout of a baseball diamond..even having him more to the right and more of the left part of the field might have added some more interest!</td>', 'Bill -- I would have liked to see a little more of the bg.. maybe more around or above his head. I love the colours and the look of the subject, but I just feel like the crop is a bit tight. Because of his pose and the layout of a baseball diamond..even having him more to the right and more of the left part of the field might have added some more interest!', '2004-07-09 13:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(803819, 87022, 11800, '<td valign="top">I only voted for 30% and didn''t get to this one. The lack of comments would indicate that it is a competent picture but didn''t inspire people much.<br/>I think the colors are great as well as the exposure. Was this taken under mixed lights? If it was you did a good job balancing them out. His face is nicely illuminated. This would make a good publicity photo.</td>', 'I only voted for 30% and didn''t get to this one. The lack of comments would indicate that it is a competent picture but didn''t inspire people much.I think the colors are great as well as the exposure. Was this taken under mixed lights? If it was you did a good job balancing them out. His face is nicely illuminated. This would make a good publicity photo.', '2004-07-09 13:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
