(805826, 86800, 22760, '<td valign="top">I''ll give 2 thumbs up on this one. Not even Simon can knock this print, it is absolutely awesome. The only thing that I see in a negative manor is the way that the horizon looks, it gives the sense that the heavily clouded sky was added into the picture. If it is authentic, then that is quite a coimcidence.</td>', 'I''ll give 2 thumbs up on this one. Not even Simon can knock this print, it is absolutely awesome. The only thing that I see in a negative manor is the way that the horizon looks, it gives the sense that the heavily clouded sky was added into the picture. If it is authentic, then that is quite a coimcidence.', '2004-07-11 11:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(805848, 84994, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by difarnecio:</b></div><hr/><i>   I have to say that i am done with this site. The photos that continue to place high are just so. . . too long to explain. It''s been fun. Again, thank you all for the great comments. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Don''t leave us... We have to learn more from you!</td>', 'Originally posted by difarnecio:   I have to say that i am done with this site. The photos that continue to place high are just so. . . too long to explain. It''s been fun. Again, thank you all for the great comments.  Don''t leave us... We have to learn more from you!', '2004-07-11 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(805928, 86085, 7743, '<td valign="top">This is a crop from a larger photo.  My original idea was to include the entire shadow behind the bench, however that put the bench right in the middle.  Another option was to not crop at all but that included some lens flare, which I like, but I believe would have produced a lower score than this crop did.  The original link is below.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=90323" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7743/thumb/90323.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7743/thumb/90323.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7743/thumb/90323.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a crop from a larger photo.  My original idea was to include the entire shadow behind the bench, however that put the bench right in the middle.  Another option was to not crop at all but that included some lens flare, which I like, but I believe would have produced a lower score than this crop did.  The original link is below. ', '2004-07-11 12:59:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(805945, 86499, 13602, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and the good score, @Tiberius - multzam!<br/>The reasons why a chosed this over the alternate is because I submitted them both during the month on another photography site (photoforum.ru) and this one seemed to be a bit more apreciated, also I kinda like the composition in his one a bit more.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and the good score, @Tiberius - multzam!The reasons why a chosed this over the alternate is because I submitted them both during the month on another photography site (photoforum.ru) and this one seemed to be a bit more apreciated, also I kinda like the composition in his one a bit more.', '2004-07-11 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(805964, 84994, 7778, '<td valign="top">Actually, I like the model''s hands. <br/>The incidental emphasis (on them) you, apparently, would have preferred to avoid, speaks to me more profoundly and delicately than the more obvious sensuality of the larger part of the image.<br/> <br/>To have both, IMHO, expands the emotional range of the photo.</td>', 'Actually, I like the model''s hands. The incidental emphasis (on them) you, apparently, would have preferred to avoid, speaks to me more profoundly and delicately than the more obvious sensuality of the larger part of the image. To have both, IMHO, expands the emotional range of the photo.', '2004-07-11 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 0),
