(808850, 86507, 10720, '<td valign="top">This flower looks far more impressive in the large size, with all the fine detail then it looks in the thumbnail. I am guessing when people  looked at thumbnail first it predisposed them to a lower vote.  It works very well as a centered picture, but some people also vote using the rule of thirds as an absolute. This is a picture where centering not only works well but moving it too the side I don''t think would have given it nearly so dramatic an impact.</td>', 'This flower looks far more impressive in the large size, with all the fine detail then it looks in the thumbnail. I am guessing when people  looked at thumbnail first it predisposed them to a lower vote.  It works very well as a centered picture, but some people also vote using the rule of thirds as an absolute. This is a picture where centering not only works well but moving it too the side I don''t think would have given it nearly so dramatic an impact.', '2004-07-13 11:00:43.000000', NULL, 0),
