(809253, 80970, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture for a 34 second exposure. I can never get lightining to be that cooperative for me, but i like to try and capture it. I like fine art photography and this is a good candidate for a fine art composite... Just replace the forground with an interesting silhouette and you would have a winner. :)<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'This is a great capture for a 34 second exposure. I can never get lightining to be that cooperative for me, but i like to try and capture it. I like fine art photography and this is a good candidate for a fine art composite... Just replace the forground with an interesting silhouette and you would have a winner. :) Great job!', '2004-07-13 16:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
