(839143, 87103, 15900, '<td valign="top">I loves pictures that tell stories. Very sweet &amp; touching. The choice of using a chimp &amp; a girl is great! The expression of both subjects is very well captured. It really shows a large degree of both physical &amp; emotional connection. The b/w treatment works wonder here in bringing out the atmosphere. I also like the way the picture is divided into the sharper left and the blurer right-very artistic... and how the angle seem to suggest that the girl is the one in the cage instead.</td>', 'I loves pictures that tell stories. Very sweet & touching. The choice of using a chimp & a girl is great! The expression of both subjects is very well captured. It really shows a large degree of both physical & emotional connection. The b/w treatment works wonder here in bringing out the atmosphere. I also like the way the picture is divided into the sharper left and the blurer right-very artistic... and how the angle seem to suggest that the girl is the one in the cage instead.', '2004-08-03 12:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
