(1168652, 86052, 14986, '<td valign="top">Awww...I just want to reach out and pet these guys.  Don''t know how you got such a close shot, but the two of them together is wonderful.  It almost makes the viewer want to place some sort of caption with the expessions.  I really like how the faces fill the frame and are really the focus.  Nice DOF.<br/> <br/>Wow..just read a few of the other comments. I''m not an animal photographer, but I really like the lighting and composition of this.  The eyes didn''t bother me at all. I guess I just get an overall "feeling" from the shot of closeness between these two and the viewer, and for me the eyes are only a small part of that here.</td>', 'Awww...I just want to reach out and pet these guys.  Don''t know how you got such a close shot, but the two of them together is wonderful.  It almost makes the viewer want to place some sort of caption with the expessions.  I really like how the faces fill the frame and are really the focus.  Nice DOF. Wow..just read a few of the other comments. I''m not an animal photographer, but I really like the lighting and composition of this.  The eyes didn''t bother me at all. I guess I just get an overall "feeling" from the shot of closeness between these two and the viewer, and for me the eyes are only a small part of that here.', '2005-02-14 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
