(2565561, 80970, 61215, '<td valign="top">Stunning photo. So crisp and clear, and yet so filled with lightning. Just brilliant.</td>', 'Stunning photo. So crisp and clear, and yet so filled with lightning. Just brilliant.', '2006-06-29 09:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2641569, 86532, 48228, '<td valign="top">This has so much depth and works really well for me..... <br/>I a have always love clouds, and I used to lay on the grass, and try to find differant objects in the clouds, or just daydream my life away.....<br/>No two clouds are ever the same, and they a photographers dream.....<br/>I really like your composition with the balance of the clouds against the trees.</td>', 'This has so much depth and works really well for me..... I a have always love clouds, and I used to lay on the grass, and try to find differant objects in the clouds, or just daydream my life away.....No two clouds are ever the same, and they a photographers dream.....I really like your composition with the balance of the clouds against the trees.', '2006-07-20 07:26:45.000000', NULL, 0),
