(3396305, 86409, 74371, '<td valign="top">I cannot remember ever seeing an image that affected me more. Not only is the subject "angelic" but you have captured her in a way that epitomizes what portraiture is all about. She appears magically in another world.<br/> <br/>I wish I had been around to have voted on this. I hope that you will make this print available for purchase. It is wonderful.<br/> <br/>Mike morris</td>', 'I cannot remember ever seeing an image that affected me more. Not only is the subject "angelic" but you have captured her in a way that epitomizes what portraiture is all about. She appears magically in another world. I wish I had been around to have voted on this. I hope that you will make this print available for purchase. It is wonderful. Mike morris', '2007-02-23 01:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
